window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4701,"title":"Chapter 4701: Steady","paragraphs":["The question from the North American buyer made Ye Jian’s palms sweat slightly. Even her gaze darkened.","She had been undercover for four months, so she knew many things that the police didn’t manage to find out. For instance, the girls who went missing were not limited to China but also Qin, Myanmar, and Laos. Some of the girls who went missing were also tourists.","She also knew that Lina was the creator of this new drug chain. She came up with this idea after coming into contact with an underground network in England and was quickly recognized by the behind-the-scenes boss.","It started a year ago. Now, this new drug chain had spread to the Western countries. Ye Jian knew that those missing girls couldn’t be found anymore.","Even if they were found, they would not be the same as before.","The longer she was undercover, the more information she discovered. A month ago, she found out that all the girls who Lina brought out would come back completely crippled.","The girls who were brought out would be forced to complete the drug transaction. They would become a plaything or even guinea pigs for new drugs.","Ye Jian only needed to investigate who was responsible for these missing girls, where they went, how the new drug transport chain was operated, and where the other party’s base was... She just needed to investigate these things and she would be able to leave. However, although she was investigating thoroughly, she couldn’t spread the news immediately.","Hence, Ye Jian needed a chance to leave. She used the chance that originally belonged to the skinny girl to make Lina choose her. That was why she had this chance.","Next, she needed to think of a way to send the news back to the country.","Ye Jian slowly unwrapped the paper for the new drug and calmed herself down. She continued to pretend that she didn’t understand English and didn’t know what the other party said.","The vicious woman, Lina, immediately realized that the other party wasn’t interested in the ’human goods’ she brought out. She smiled and tried to get information from him. \"I wonder what you like, Mr. Raul? If possible, I really hope that you’ll tell me.\"","\"Hahaha, no, even if I tell you, you won’t be able to satisfy me. You’re not the boss of this business. I just want to talk to your boss personally.\"","The drug dealer from North America, Raul, turned to look at his companion, who was also an old friend of the drug dealer. The two of them looked at each other and smiled. They had no intention of negotiating with Lina.","Lina wasn’t the biggest drug dealer. The person hiding behind her was the real drug lord behind the scenes. However, Lina’s status in the village was quite high. Whenever she appeared, she would receive big clients. The amount of money she received was more than ten million USD.","Facing the doubts of the North American buyers, Lina smiled brightly and replied coquettishly, \"Mr. Raul, Mr. Spat, we’re just familiarizing ourselves with each other today. We can talk about business after we’re familiar with each other.","\"We’re just chatting now, so it can’t be considered a transaction. It’s just that having a beautiful and cute girl accompanying us, our deal will be easier and more pleasant.","\"Mr. Raul, I wonder if you’re satisfied or do you need better specialty services?\"","Raul was one of the drug dealers in North America. In the past, he only cooperated with two local drug manufacturers, the Merraben and the Silver Triangle. Recently, the transportation of drugs in Merraben was completely eaten up by a few big drug dealers in North America. The monopoly of the market caused the second-rate drug dealers like Raul and Spat to lose their minimum purchase cost. Hence, they had no choice but to find another way."]},{"number":4702,"title":"Chapter 4702: Control","paragraphs":["They split into two groups. One went to the various drug manufacturers in the Golden Triangle, where there were more and more second-rate drug dealers from the United States. The other went to the Golden Crescent to look for partners.","When they first entered Laos, they avoided the local drug dealers and found Lina and the rest. This was because the underground market in North America was suddenly filled with girls testing drugs, drug trafficking, and sex marketing. At first, Raul and the other drug dealers didn’t know where these girls came from. In the end, they contacted the person behind the scenes through the sellers who controlled the girls.","Raul and Spat flew over. To be safe, they arranged to meet in Laos. They didn’t go to Myanmar directly.","Lina’s appearance disappointed Raul and Spat. They knew that the smiling woman in front of them was not the real boss they wanted to see.","Lina was a mature and charming woman.","They smelled the same kind of darkness on her.","Although Raul was very interested in special services, this was his first time in Laos. He didn’t want to go for it immediately. He raised his eyebrows and glanced at Ye Jian with interest.","Rather than Ye Jian, he was very interested in the sexy and voluptuous Lina.","\"I do like specialty services, just like the specialty services in the North American underground market. It’s a great feeling to lock young and beautiful girls in iron cages and watch them shake their waists crazily.","\"I like it very much. I hope that one day, there’ll be a mature and sexy woman who can perform for me. For instance, I’d be more interested in a lady like you.\"","It meant that if there was a chance, he wanted Lina to perform for him personally. This was a little contemptuous.","Raul was a drug dealer. Every day, he walked on a sharp knife. He could tell at a glance who was the real mastermind.","Although he could smell the darkness on Lina, he was certain that Lina was not the mastermind. She was just a small leader who served the corporation and had a certain status.","For example, she was good at controlling these young and beautiful girls. She wanted them to recommend drugs to the clients and bring benefits to the entire corporation.","But she wasn’t the one who called the shots.","Raul’s request was met with a coquettish smile from Lina. Wearing a deep V-neck dress, she leaned toward Raul. Ye Jian could only see the gazes of the two drug dealers, which were focused on Lina’s chest.","胸中沟渠,大器!","Ye Jian secretly curled her slightly sweaty palms. Since they were only interested in Lina, she was temporarily safe.","It was just temporary safety. If she stayed here for longer and continued to be controlled by Lina, one day, she would meet a drug dealer who was interested in her.","There was not much time left for her!","\"If there’s a chance, I’ll definitely perform for you personally. At that time, please don’t despise me for not being as beautiful and young as her.\"","She placed her cold hand on Ye Jian’s shoulder. The moment she raised her hand, her left breast was almost exposed from the corner of her white dress. The two drug dealers from North America laughed too.","The atmosphere was quite pleasant. Lina had turned their attention to Ye Jian twice, but it didn’t lead to anything more. She could only give up.","As she drank, she hid the gloominess in her eyes."]},{"number":4703,"title":"Chapter 4703: Beaten","paragraphs":["Lina’s goal was very simple. She wanted to push the girls out and use their young and beautiful faces as bargaining chips. Then, she could make recommendations and retain customers to increase the chances of a successful cooperation.","However, she made a mistake this time.","She thought that these buyers from North America would like the young lady she sent over. In the end, they preferred mature women. The chess piece that she had been carefully training was useless. This was a loss.","It looked like she needed to find a few more voluptuous married women.","After walking out of the hotel, Lina sized up Ye Jian with her cold gaze. She smiled coldly. \"Your luck is not bad.\"","Ye Jian lowered her head and stood there obediently. She didn’t speak or look at Lina, especially when Lina was sizing her up.","She had always given Lina the impression that she was obedient, knowledgeable, and timid. Even if she didn’t say anything, Lina felt that it was normal.","Seeing this, Lina, who felt a little bored, glanced at her coldly. She swayed her waist and walked to the front on her thin high heels.","Ye Jian bit her lower lip and followed obediently.","If she didn’t follow along, the bodyguards behind her wouldn’t be polite.","Lina was not in a good mood. Even when she got into the car, she was so angry that the two bodyguards didn’t dare to speak.","Ye Jian was about to get into the car when she realized that there was something different in the car... The driver had changed. It was no longer the driver who came to the border to receive her. Instead, this driver had a scar on the right side of his face. It was a deep scar left behind by a bullet.","Ye Jian was about to get into the car obediently when the new driver suddenly opened his mouth and spoke in English, \"The general wants to ask you if you’ve struck a deal with the two businessmen from North America.\"","Ye Jian, who was bending over to get into the car, stopped in her tracks.","General?","Was it a codename or a military rank?","Suddenly, Ye Jian remembered that when they came from the border of Myanmar, the bodyguards had given the officers money to pass the checkpoint. Her heart sank uncontrollably.","If the general that the driver mentioned represented a military rank and the driver was asking if Lina’s business deal was successful, could it be that... Lina’s backer was a general from the Burmese military?","At the thought of this, Ye Jian felt cold sweat on her back.","If that was the case, the severity of the situation was beyond imagination!","No!","She had to contact Captain Deng today. There had been no news for four months. Would Captain Deng and the rest think that she was dead?","Before Ye Jian could sit properly, a sharp wind blew over.","Smack!","Ye Jian, who had been slapped by Lina, didn’t dare to resist. She sat down and covered her face. Even though she was in so much pain that tears welled up in her eyes, she didn’t dare to question Lina.","\"Please tell the general that I’ll definitely succeed in three days. Tonight was my mistake. I didn’t train her properly before bringing her out. Please give me a chance.\"","Lina, who slapped Ye Jian a second ago, became extremely cautious now. Even her posture was much lower. It was obvious that she was very afraid of the general the driver mentioned.","Ye Jian received this slap for nothing. She knew very well that she was taking the blame for Lina’s failure in her business deal.","Lina needed to give the general an explanation. She didn’t want to be punished by the general, so she could only push someone out to bear the consequences. Ye Jian was the best choice as she was the only other person in the car."]},{"number":4704,"title":"Chapter 4704: Surveillance Cameras","paragraphs":["The driver didn’t care who was hit or wronged. He didn’t even look at Ye Jian. There was no need to waste time on unimportant people.","\"The general has been at the border recently. It has been a long time since you reported the situation to him...\" The driver retracted his words in time and glanced at Ye Jian coldly.","After hitting her, Lina, who felt much better, immediately explained, \"She doesn’t understand English. She only speaks Mandarin and Burmese.\"","The driver immediately retracted his gaze and continued, \"The general will arrive at Laos after another day. Clear your schedule and clean up the people around you. Don’t bring anyone with you.\"","Lina’s words dispelled the driver’s vigilance. It could be seen that she held a lot of weight in the entire corporation. Even the driver trusted her.","Ye Jian, whose face was burning with pain, covered her face tightly and kept lowering her head. She shrunk her body and tried her best to pretend that she was invisible. She tried her best not to let the people in the car feel her presence.","The arrival of the driver made Lina extremely tense. Ye Jian was being stared at by the two bodyguards. No matter where she went, the two bodyguards never left her side. Even when she was sleeping, they would handcuff Ye Jian’s hands and feet. They wouldn’t give Ye Jian a minute to act alone. They completely cut off Ye Jian’s contact with the outside world.","Captain Deng finished his day’s work in the office building of Yun Province’s Narcotics Brigade. He dragged his tired feet and walked past the wall. He didn’t return to the office immediately. Instead, he habitually walked in front of the wall and reported today’s work to his comrades.","\"Comrades, we investigated a huge number of drugs today and handed over 500 grams of drugs. There were pills, medicine, powder, and all kinds of other stuff. These guys are getting more and more cunning. They put the powder into hollow plastic bands and used them to tie their hair. Each one contained a full 50 grams.","\"The drug dealers are getting more and more cunning. We can’t relax at all. The drug dealers are getting brutal, and we can’t retreat. We’ll continue this battle to the end. Just watch.\"","Captain Deng wiped the spotless glass wall with his hands and stood quietly for a while before turning around and returning to his office.","Just as he sat down and was about to drink the newly brewed hot tea, a narcotics police officer knocked on the door excitedly and came in. \"Boss, good news! There’s news from Laos. The female soldier we deployed four months ago has appeared in Laos.\"","At the same time, he placed a few blurry photos in front of Captain Deng. \"Look, the photos sent back were taken by the surveillance cameras. This girl wearing the traditional clothes is the person we sent.\"","Captain Deng, who was resting with his back against the chair, jumped up and grabbed all the photos to examine them carefully.","That was right!","It was indeed the female soldier they sent!","Even though the photos were very blurry, he could recognize the female soldier at a glance!","\"There’s another woman beside her. This is...\" The officer pointed at another photo. \"This is her. She’s about 1.7 meters tall. She’s never appeared before. She’s a new face. The people we sent have been following her closely.\"","Captain Deng finally had news about the female soldier. He heaved a sigh of relief. He immediately pointed at one of the photos and said in a deep voice, \"Do a facial analysis. Then, look through the old files to see if there’s a match!\"","\"Okay! I’ll investigate immediately!\" The narcotics officer nodded. He left the office quickly and went to the technical department.","Cheli City’s Brigade Unit had locked onto a new face. It was none other than Lina."]},{"number":4705,"title":"Chapter 4705: Sad Tears","paragraphs":["Lina’s appearance gave Cheli City’s narcotics police a new direction of investigation. They also found a hidden clue that they didn’t discover before.","It could be said that Ye Jian was the reason why Lina was exposed.","If Cheli City’s narcotics police hadn’t been paying attention to Ye Jian’s whereabouts, and if the narcotics police of the three countries had not been informed to monitor the surveillance footage at the borders of the three countries, the narcotics police of Cheli City wouldn’t have noticed Lina.","It was a new face. It was a foreign face that didn’t have a criminal record and hadn’t entered China’s territory. Even if the narcotics police had sharp eyes, they wouldn’t have been able to lock onto Lina as a criminal suspect just by looking at the surveillance footage.","It was precisely because Ye Jian was beside her that Lina, who had never been targeted by the Chinese narcotics police, was exposed.","However, the investigation into Lina didn’t go smoothly. 20 narcotics officers worked hard for two days and two nights, doing the investigation based on Lina’s approximate age. However, they found nothing.","Then, they asked the Myanmar counter-narcotics team if there were any female drug dealers. There were, but her age and appearance couldn’t be matched. The woman who appeared beside Ye Jian seemed to have appeared out of thin air. There was no information about her at all.","\"Keep investigating! how could there be no information about a living person? That’s impossible! Investigate! We must find out!\"","\"She’s alive. As long as she’s alive, she would’ve definitely left a trace of her past life. Look into her entry and exit records from countries, and what about the various cities in Myanmar? Since she appeared at the border of Laos, it means that she has a record of going overseas. As long as there are records, we can definitely find her!\"","Captain Deng from Cheli City’s Narcotics Brigade flew into a rage when they didn’t gain anything for two consecutive days and nights.","While the narcotics police were still investigating, an old man who was walking shakily was escorted into the Narcotics Brigade by two traffic police officers. He was here to look for Captain Deng.","Captain Deng’s breathing was so low that his subordinates didn’t even dare to breathe loudly. When he saw the white-haired old man, surprise flashed past his eyes. The anger on his face disappeared immediately. When the old man saw Captain Deng, he grabbed Captain Deng’s arm tightly with his skinny and withered hands.","Captain Deng hurriedly held the old man. He knew why the old man was here...","The old man, who came to look for his granddaughter, had tears in his eyes when he saw Captain Deng. He said in a trembling voice, \"Captain Deng, have you found my granddaughter? Why isn’t she back yet? How long will it take for her to come back? Will I be able to see my granddaughter again?\"","The old man’s muddy eyes were washed by tears. At that moment, there was a look of wisdom in the old man’s eyes that made Captain Deng not dare to look at them directly.","The old man, who hadn’t seen his granddaughter for a long time, already had an answer in his heart. It was just that... he didn’t dare to think too deeply about it.","His old bones were fine, and he was still alive. How could something happen to his granddaughter if he was still doing fine?","The old man, who didn’t want to wait, ventured out of the mountains alone. He asked around and finally reached a city he had never been to in his entire life. He saw the identical emblem on the police cap of the traffic police officer who was commanding the traffic. That was how he came here.","\"Don’t worry, we’ll definitely find your granddaughter. We’ll definitely let you see your granddaughter. I swear on my police uniform that I’ll definitely find your granddaughter!\"","He climbed through the mountains and came to a city that he had never been to in his entire life. Tears rushed out of Captain Deng’s eyes. He couldn’t imagine what the old man had experienced. He walked through those mountains that were difficult for humans and cars to enter and came to the city."]},{"number":4706,"title":"Chapter 4706: Filthy People","paragraphs":["In order to find his granddaughter, the old man risked his life.","The arrival of the old man alerted the leaders of Cheli City. The leaders of Cheli City’s Narcotics Brigade and the Criminal Investigation Unit were summoned to the city for a meeting on the same day. They returned to their respective bureaus with the orders from the higher-ups.","Lina’s appearance became the key to whether they could find the old man’s granddaughter. The two groups of people from the Narcotics Brigade and the Criminal Investigation Unit were all involved in the case of finding Lina’s whereabouts.","Cheli City’s narcotics police didn’t give up. They continued to check the various border surveillance cameras carefully. In order to find the whereabouts of this person so that the entire case could progress, the narcotics police who patrolled during the day would cooperate with their colleagues to check the surveillance cameras when they returned to the team at night.","Four days had passed since they found out about Lina’s existence, but there was still no progress from Cheli City’s Narcotics Brigade. The air around Captain Deng had been so low for the past few days that no one dared to take the initiative to walk over and talk to him. Apart from work matters, they would lower their heads and walk around him whenever they saw his gloomy expression. They didn’t dare to provoke him.","It couldn’t be helped. Their leader would always be in a bad mood once a month. It had become an iron law. Usually, he would only be unhappy for a day, but this time, it would probably last longer.","It would probably take three to five days before his mood lifted.","Just as the narcotics police in Cheli City were investing more resources into investigating Lina, the borders of Laos were destroying a batch of drugs that they had seized in the past month.","They were mainly from drug dealers from Myanmar and Laos.","The higher-ups of the Laos military and the Burmese military were all present. They expressed their determination to fight against the drug dealers to the end.","The two countries’ television stations reported the drug-control operation in real time and highly praised the higher-ups of the military of the two countries who were present. They said that the two countries would continue to work together and create a good future.","Ye Jian watched the live-stream through the phone. When the faces of the higher-ups of the Burmese military appeared on the computer, Ye Jian’s eyes darkened. After a while, a knowing smile flashed past her eyes.","The high-ranking member of the Burmese military who expressed his determination to fight drugs was none other than General Minlai, who had once cooperated with Cobra’s but ended his cooperation because of Cobra’s death.","When she entered Myanmar to save Yijin, she ended up having to stab the sharp knife into Captain Xia’s chest with K7. That was when she heard General Minlai’s name.","After Xia Jinyuan came back, he didn’t tell her that Minlai was a high-ranking member of the Burmese military. The narcotics police should have noticed something. However, because there was no concrete evidence and he had a high position, it was completely beyond the scope of the narcotics police’s investigation. Even if they did notice something, they wouldn’t have been able to do anything.","When Ye Jian, who was staring at the television, heard General Minlai’s name she immediately thought of the name she had heard in Myanmar. The driver also mentioned ’general’. Connecting the two, she knew clearly who the real boss behind Lina was.","As a high-ranking member of the Myanmar military, General Minlai looked righteous on the surface, but in fact, he was doing shameful things.","Even... Lina was one of his subordinates. The pile of bones in the forest was also General Minlai’s doing.","The boss behind Lina, the ’general’ mentioned by the driver... Why were the missing girls able to leave the country smoothly and go to various foreign countries? Why were Lina and the other drug dealers able to smoothly expand their power in the Golden Triangle and transport drugs out of Myanmar to be sold around the world? Now, there was finally a reasonable explanation.","General Minlai acted as their backer."]},{"number":4707,"title":"Chapter 4707: Angry","paragraphs":["Ye Jian was in a good mood because she unintentionally discovered Lina’s boss. However, Lina, who was in the room next door, wasn’t in such a good mood.","Especially when she saw that the Laos military had destroyed all the drugs that were confiscated. Lina’s face turned pale instantly. These destroyed drugs were all money, and money was the general’s life. He needed a lot of money to buy weapons. He needed a lot of money to maintain his power.","Now, someone had destroyed his ’life’ in front of him. Then... she, who was going to see him soon, would definitely suffer from the general’s wrath.","All the subordinates below the general knew that the general didn’t vent his anger by pointing his finger at the person who made him mad and scolding them... Instead, he would take out his gun and kill the useless person.","She worked so hard for the general because she wanted him to know that she was useful and that killing her would be the biggest loss.","Now, she was starting to worry that the general would vent all his anger on her. She was worried that she would never see the light of day.","Lina didn’t dare to watch television anymore. She was so anxious that she couldn’t even sit properly.","She had to think of something. She had to think of something.","What could she think of?","That was right. First, she needed to shift the general’s anger. It would be best if she could shift it to someone else. Who?","Five minutes later, Ye Jian’s room door was pushed open. Lina, who was supposed to rest in the room next door, walked in arrogantly.","Ye Jian was still watching the television. Through the television, she memorized all the guards around General Minlai, including the bodyguards who had blended into the crowd.","She memorized everything. Ye Jian memorized all the faces that appeared on the screen so that she could recognize them in the future.","When Lina entered the room, Ye Jian immediately stood up and greeted her obediently, \"Lina...\"","\"Yeah.\"","Lina responded with a straight face. She walked straight to the single lounge chair in the room and sat down. Her oppressive aura was not weak at all. Even her gaze was condescending.","In her eyes, Ye Jian was like an ant. Whether she lived or died depended on her words and gaze.","\"Seeing that you’ve been obedient for the past few days, I’ll bring you to a place tonight to meet a big shot.\" Her gaze turned to the television. She happened to see a Western reporter holding a microphone and handing it to General Minlai. He asked if Myanmar had made any big moves against drugs recently and even raised a rather sensitive question.","\"General, there are many drugs in Myanmar. Is someone in the military providing political cover? If there’s indeed such a thing happening, do you know about it?\"","He was just short of saying, ’Are you the person supporting these drug dealers, General Minlai?’","General Minlai’s expression suddenly turned cold. He stopped walking and personally took the microphone of the Western reporter. He faced the camera and replied righteously, \"Our Burmese military will never provide political cover for drug dealers. No army will do anything to harm society, let alone commit crimes on purpose!\"","Ye Jian smiled.","Of course, he wouldn’t provide political cover for drug dealers. He was dealing drugs himself.","No army would do anything to harm society, heh. The warlords and local armed forces were all built to protect his personal power.","In front of the media, General Minlai made it sound so dignified. Wasn’t he afraid that karma would come to bite him in the ass?"]},{"number":4708,"title":"Chapter 4708: Scheme","paragraphs":["The person who asked the question was a reporter from a certain Western country. However, the one who was frightened was Lina, who was tense.","Lina, who had broken a few of her manicured nails, took out her phone. Her expression was dark as she made a series of calls. She didn’t bother hiding her conversations from Ye Jian.","Whenever she gave orders in front of Ye Jian, she would only do it in English.","\"The Western reporter who appeared on television at 11:03 am, find an opportunity to teach him a lesson.\"","She could only teach him a lesson. She couldn’t do more than that.","Otherwise, it would be too obvious. It would be equivalent to telling the entire world that the Burmese military was indeed providing political cover for the local drug dealers. And because of the exposure by a Western reporter, they flew into a rage out of humiliation and killed him.","Lina really wanted to kill the Western reporter who asked the question, but the situation didn’t allow her to.","The person on the other end of the phone received the order and didn’t ask too many questions. He just answered a few simple questions to find out who the target was.","After hanging up, Lina took a few deep breaths to dissipate the anger in her chest. Tonight, she had to bring the ’human goods’ in front of her over. She needed to divert the general’s anger.","If not, she would definitely become the general’s next victim.","Her gaze was so cold, and she was sizing up Ye Jian blatantly again. She was estimating Ye Jian’s value again.","Ye Jian glanced at Lina timidly. The moment their gazes met, Ye Jian was so afraid that her shoulders tightened and she trembled like a frightened chick.","Seeing this, Lina’s red and sexy lips curved into a cold smile.","She liked to see the fear on these young ladies’ faces. They thought that they would succeed because they were young and beautiful, but in reality, she would make them wish they were dead.","The feeling of torture was really satisfying.","Lina, who was playing with her fingers, raised her leg and waved her hand. The bodyguard who had been guarding Ye Jian all day walked to Lina’s side and knelt beside her legs. He reached out and massaged Lina’s legs.","Ye Jian fiddled with her fingers uneasily. She lowered her head tightly and didn’t dare to look.","After being trained by Lina for nearly three months, she had seen too many dark sides of human nature. Bundling, leather whips, wax burns, needle pricks... Any girl that didn’t satisfy Lina would definitely suffer from all sorts of unheard abuse.","The girls screamed while Lina laughed out loud. She enjoyed it.","Ye Jian was scalded by wax once because she didn’t cooperate and abuse another girl who was kidnapped from Thailand.","In the past three months...","Ye Jian lowered her eyes slightly. Her eyes were red. She used to think that she had experienced the most unfair and darkest treatment. It was not until she fell into Lina’s hands that she realized that the real darkness was something that could not be seen normally. It was impossible for it to be made public. It was impossible for it to be reported. It was a darkness that was completely hidden to the rest of the world.","She could still faintly hear the screams of the girls Lina had tortured. There was also a faint sneer on Lina’s face. If this woman was not eliminated, who knew how many innocent girls would die in her hands?","In the afternoon, a hotel attendant delivered lunch. Since Lina was in the room with them, the attendant sent a sumptuous lunch to the room. Ye Jian also came into contact with others in the hotel apart from the bodyguards and Lina.","The attendant who came in with lunch bowed and greeted Ye Jian. Ye Jian took the initiative to walk over and whispered in the Burmese dialect, \"I’ll help you...\"","Before the attendant could reject her, Ye Jian had already walked around him. As she gently raised her arm, a small object landed in her palm. Then, she turned around, and there was nothing in her hand."]},{"number":4709,"title":"Chapter 4709: Self-Harm","paragraphs":["No one noticed what Ye Jian did. Even the attendant didn’t know that something had fallen into Ye Jian’s hand. Although Lina and the bodyguards in the room had been watching Ye Jian’s every move, they didn’t notice it either.","They only saw Ye Jian passing by the waiter. She didn’t do anything else.","Since Lina didn’t stop Ye Jian, the bodyguards didn’t stop her either.","The reason why Ye Jian dared to suggest that she help the waiter was because she knew Lina’s preferences. As Lina was a woman who liked to be served like a queen, Ye Jian’s initiative didn’t make her unhappy.","This was also Lina’s fatal flaw.","Unfortunately, she didn’t realize it herself.","The waiter looked at Lina first. He knew who was the one making the decision in the room. Seeing that Lina didn’t react, he dared to turn his body slightly.","Ye Jian thanked him softly and picked up a white porcelain bowl with a stainless steel lid.","The waiter had just said something in Burmese when Ye Jian, who was holding the bowl with both hands, found that it was so hot that her expression changed drastically. However, she didn’t shout. She just quickly tried to place the bowl back in the dining cart.","Crash!","The bowl of soup fell from Ye Jian’s hand. The hot soup splattered on Ye Jian’s legs and instep. Her flesh immediately turned red.","\"Lina, I’m sorry, I’m sorry...\"","Ye Jian knelt on the ground and admitted her mistake. Even though the ground was overflowing with soup and the porcelain pieces were sharp, she still knelt straight down just to... fight for a chance to go to the bathroom.","Lina, who was sitting in the chair like a queen, frowned when she saw Ye Jian kneeling on the sharp porcelain fragments. The waiter was also frightened. He didn’t dare to move and stood beside the dining car, waiting for Lina’s outburst.","Lina didn’t speak immediately. She stared at Ye Jian with interest. Her gaze slowly moved from Ye Jian’s face to her knees. She smiled and played with her fingers.","The fabric of the traditional skirt was not very thin. However, in order to make herself look really pitiful, Ye Jian chose to kneel straight down. Some sharp porcelain pieces pierced through the fabric and into Ye Jian’s knees.","Ye Jian’s face turned pale from the dull pain. She didn’t care how painful it was. Instead, she was concerned about Lina’s anger. She had no choice but to kneel.","Blood flowed out and stained the fabric. Ye Jian didn’t even dare to breathe loudly. In the end, she collapsed on the ground. Her humble posture made the anger in Lina’s eyes disappear.","\"Get up.\"","After about five minutes, Lina estimated that it was about time. If Ye Jian continued kneeling, she might not be able to see the general tonight, so Lina forced herself to open her mouth.","Ye Jian stood up and thanked Lina profusely.","It wasn’t easy to be a spy, especially since she fell into the hands of someone like Lina. If Ye Jian wasn’t careful, she would be killed by Lina. Ye Jian was able to live until now because of her good disguise.","Ye Jian staggered to her feet and whispered to the waiter, \"I’m sorry. Please wait for me for a minute. It’ll be quick!\"","Lina raised her eyebrows. She believed that the ’human goods’ under her control wouldn’t be able to play any tricks. As long as Ye Jian didn’t leave the room, what tricks could she play?","The sound of running water could be heard from the bathroom. Lina could vaguely hear a low groan of pain. She crossed her legs and changed her posture lazily. She waved at the waiter who didn’t dare to move.","A message in English was sent to Captain Deng’s phone."]},{"number":4710,"title":"Chapter 4710: Keep A Close Eye","paragraphs":["\"General Minlai, Lina, and the Burmese military control the drug chain. The missing girls are from Thailand, Laos, Myanmar, and China. The location is 327 kilometers north of Nasse Village.\"","In a five-star hotel at the border of Laos, Ye Jian, who had washed up, lowered her head and laid out all the food. When the waiter bent down again, the cell phone was still in his pocket, revealing a small corner.","Naturally, Ye Jian didn’t leave any traces on the cell phone.","Captain Deng, who was leading the team to inspect the passing cars, felt a vibration in his pocket. He waved his hand and asked the narcotics officer beside him to take over while he took out his phone to check.","When he saw the contents of the message, Captain Deng’s face, which was tanned by the sun, lit up. However, he calmed down after glancing at it.","As someone who had seen many storms, no matter how big a surprise it was, it would only cause a small ripple. It wouldn’t even show on his face.","However, the surprise this time was too big. It came suddenly without any preparation. Their investigation had reached a stalemate recently. Captain Deng’s mood, which had been bad for a few days, lifted in an instant.","He held his cell phone tightly and rushed back to the bulletproof car. He conveyed the news to the person in charge of this case. To be safe, Captain Deng didn’t say it too explicitly over the phone. He only said that there was great progress in figuring out the mysterious woman’s identity.","That afternoon, Cheri City’s Criminal Investigation Unit, the Narcotics Brigade, and the border defense armed police held another confidential meeting.","All the meetings were dictated. There were no paper materials, nor were they allowed to carry any communication equipment. They sat in the conference room and listened. They could only remember the contents in their hearts. After leaving the conference room, only they knew the content of the meeting. They could not tell anyone else.","As the identity of the mysterious woman was exposed, her backer was also exposed. He was the current largest warlord in Myanmar, General Minlai. This result... was not surprising.","It only made all the officers present feel a chill in their hearts.","The Burmese military was involved in drug trafficking, and their general was the biggest support for the Golden Triangle drug dealers. This had always been the biggest headache for the Burmese government. However... the government didn’t have the ability to stop it.","If they interfered too much, the warlords would take revenge.","\"According to the news, the missing girls are not just limited to our country but also Thailand, Laos, and Myanmar. With Minlai’s interference, all the missing girls successfully entered Myanmar and were sent to this woman called Lina. After she trains them, they’re sent to various countries and engage in special services to expand Minlai’s drug trafficking market.","\"Although the information didn’t specify what kind of special services are provided, with the cruelty of the Golden Triangle drug dealers, we can imagine just how brutal it is.","\"Besides Thailand, Laos, and Myanmar, there’s a trafficking route in China for the girls. We need the Criminal Investigation Unit to completely destroy the trafficking route operated by this mature assembly line.","\"Increase the inspection of the border defense armed police officers. We can’t let any of them off. The border patrol needs to be stepped up too, especially the mountain area between the two countries. We’ll start patrolling fully.","\"Inspections of mobile personnel and passing cars will be carried out all over the country. Civilian police will enter villages, towns, and remote villages to carry out population surveys.\"","After Ye Jian’s message was sent, a large-scale and unprecedentedly strict inspection was carried out throughout the country in the afternoon. The bus stations and train stations became the first important inspection point. The same went for the cars at the highway intersection."]},{"number":4711,"title":"Chapter 4711: Casting The Net","paragraphs":["The dark night in Laos enveloped the land. The noise in the day had vanished, and it was completely quiet. Even the front desk receptionists in the hotel were a little sleepy. From time to time, they would close their eyes before suddenly waking up. They would then quickly drink a few mouthfuls of strong tea. They yawned and rubbed their eyes, forcing themselves to be on duty.","The mirrored elevator door opened with a ding. The sound of high heels stepping on the smooth tiles reached the front desk receptionists. It was like a bell that was urging people to wake up.","The three front desk staff hurriedly stood up and listened to the sound of footsteps. When the guests appeared, they stood up with smiles and greeted them in the language of Laos.","The resplendent hotel lobby instantly became a little noisy because of the group of people. However, the noisy atmosphere was not right. It seemed that the front desk staff didn’t dare to look at the guests.","Especially the woman walking at the front. She was wearing a baseball cap that was lowered to cover most of her face. Although her every step was turbulent, her body movements were very stiff. It seemed like she was going to do something big like... commit murder.","As this thought flashed past her mind, the front desk staff shuddered and secretly patted their forehead, warning themselves not to think too much.","The revolving door turned, and the group of people left the hotel. There were two cars parked outside. One was a four-seater sedan while the other was a business car.","The bodyguard opened the door of the sedan, and Lina got in. Ye Jian walked toward the car naturally. Before she could walk over, Lina, who was sitting in the car, said coldly, \"Come here.\"","These two simple words were cold and sinister.","Everyone lowered their heads slightly. They all knew that Lina was in a bad mood. No one dared to provoke her.","The subordinates who followed Lina all year round knew that as long as Lina was angry, she would definitely vent all her anger on them. As for who was the unlucky person who suffered Lina’s anger today, they didn’t want it to be them.","Hence, these people were used to protecting themselves.","\"Hurry up and go! Don’t dawdle!\"","The bodyguard following closely behind Ye Jian heaved a sigh of relief when he heard that. He lowered his voice and urged the ’unlucky fellow’ to go over quickly. If she delayed, who knew who would become the next ’unlucky fellow’?","Ye Jian’s knees hurt with every step she took. She pursed her lips and turned around obediently... She walked toward the black sedan.","The car door closed, and the motor roared. The two cars left the hotel.","In the dark, someone put down his binoculars and reported through his wireless earpiece, \"Target Two has left the hotel. There are six people. Our men will follow closely.\"","\"Roger, Roger! The radar in the car has started tracking. We’ve successfully located the car. Please evacuate immediately,\" someone replied coldly through the wireless earpiece.","Soon, far away at a certain border in China, the several computer screens that were turned on flickered with strings of complicated codes. As the codes kept changing, a small frame with thin green edges suddenly popped up on the computer that showed the satellite map. A red radar point kept blinking. The information representing geography, location, coordinates, north latitude, and longitude outside the small frame kept changing as the radar point flickered.","In the afternoon, Ye Jian sent the news to Captain Deng. Before the tripartite meeting in Cheli City, Captain Deng first sent the most outstanding scout of the Yun Province’s Narcotics Brigade to Laos.","With the information provided by Ye Jian, it was no longer difficult to lock onto Lina. General Minlai was in Laos. Ye Jian and Lina also appeared in the border city where General Minlai was spotted a few days ago. In addition, the phone that sent the message was from the city. The four scouts went straight to the city."]},{"number":4712,"title":"Chapter 4712: Surveillance Cameras","paragraphs":["Then, the scout called the phone number from which the message was sent and pretended that he had called the wrong number. In less than five minutes, he found out where the owner of the cell phone was working.","This was not difficult for such investigators. As long as there was a clue, they would be able to find out everything.","Criminals needed to have high IQs. Those with low IQs should behave themselves.","The entire route of the car was under the control of the narcotics police. Ye Jian didn’t expect this. She didn’t expect the narcotics police to enter the country in less than ten hours with just her message. They also installed the tracking radar on the car that Lina usually rode in.","Not only was there a radar device, but there was also a listening device. Anyone who spoke in the car would be heard clearly, making it easier for the narcotics police to grasp all of Lina’s movements.","However, in order to prevent the radar device from being discovered, it would only be triggered when the car started driving. Once the car’s engine was turned off, the signal would disappear. This was the biggest disadvantage—they couldn’t grasp the car’s trajectory in time.","However, there was no other way. They had to compromise.","The car started moving, and the radar setup was turned on. The border narcotics police stared at the trajectory of the car and heard the car door closing.","Captain Deng, who was listening in, raised his hand slightly and made a downward gesture. The several narcotics police officers who were participating in the operation in the office held their breaths and focused. On the other side, they adjusted the recording. Once the other party spoke, the voices would be recorded and become the strongest evidence.","Several narcotics officers, including Captain Deng, were ready. However, they suddenly heard two slaps. Everyone’s facial expressions froze.","Someone was being slapped!","A cold female voice was heard. \"Why were you so slow? Were you expecting me to invite you over?\"","\"Lina, that’s not true...\" A timid voice defended herself.","This voice... The narcotics police officers looked at each other, and their expressions tensed up. Wasn’t this the female soldier they sent?","As soon as she finished speaking, several narcotics officers heard two more slaps. Captain Deng clenched his fists and slammed them on the table. With a cold facial expression, he gritted his teeth and said, \"She’s going too far!\"","This was too much!","\"Captain, we must get rid of this woman as soon as possible. As long as she lives, many girls will suffer!\"","\"Captain, the mountain village location provided by the female soldier is definitely reliable. We can bypass General Minlai and cooperate with the Shan State police to see if we can solve the case directly.\"","The four slaps made the narcotics police furious. Although they knew that the female soldier they sent would definitely be treated unfairly and might even lose her life, knowing and accepting were two different things.","Emotionally, it was hard for them to accept it. However, taking into consideration the overall situation, they could only remain calm!","Captain Deng was about to say something when Lina’s cold voice was heard again. \"From now on, you’ll follow behind me the entire time. You’re not allowed to say anything without my instructions! If you dare to disobey me again, ha, you’ll be joining that pile of white bones at the back of the mountain. Do you understand?\"","They were speaking in the Burmese dialect. The narcotics officers in charge of border checks between Myanmar and China all spoke fluent Burmese. Hence, they could understand every word Lina said clearly."]},{"number":4713,"title":"Chapter 4713: Torture","paragraphs":["The pile of white bones at the back of the mountain... That meant that this woman called Lina had killed many missing girls!","It should’ve been expected that those girls wouldn’t have met a good ending when they fell into the hands of a woman like her","If the female soldier wasn’t smart and knew how to protect herself, they might not have been able to hear her voice right now.","Ye Jian, who had been slapped several times in the car, nodded vigorously as if she was afraid that Lina couldn’t see it. Her face was burning with pain, but she didn’t dare to say that she was in pain. She didn’t even have the courage to speak. She could only nod to show that she understood and remembered.","Her cell phone vibrated. Lina took out her cell phone and looked at it. A hint of fear flashed past her eyes. She took a few deep breaths before picking up the call.","\"General, this is Lina speaking.\"","General... General Minlai!","Both Ye Jian’s and the narcotics police’s spirits were lifted. Could it be that Lina was going to see General Minlai now?","Ye Jian narrowed her eyes and held her breath. She lowered her eyes and leaned toward Lina secretly, listening intently...","The soundproofing of the car was not bad. Ye Jian could hear the voice of a middle-aged man who was used to giving orders.","\"Come over as soon as possible. There are many things I need to ask you personally. If you don’t arrive in half an hour, think of a way to deal with yourself.\"","On the other end of the line, General Minlai, who was standing in a dense forest, finished speaking calmly. Without waiting for Lina’s reply, he handed over the cell phone that was still on the call.","The person who took the cell phone was none other than the driver who picked up Lina the other day.","He was also General Minlai’s adjutant and one of his most trusted subordinates.","Lina, who was shivering violently, almost couldn’t hold her cell phone anymore. She swallowed her saliva with difficulty and lowered her voice. Her high-and-mighty attitude instantly crumbled. \"General, I’ll definitely rush over and won’t disappoint you.\"","\"Lina, the general has limited time. He doesn’t like to waste his time on useless people. You still have half an hour to live.\"","The driver’s voice didn’t pull Lina back from hell. Instead, it sent her straight to the depths of it. Lina’s red lips were completely pale, and so was her face.","She knew General Minlai’s personality very well. He was a man of his word. He never changed every decision and never spoke any nonsense. He didn’t tell her to kill herself to scare her. It was... an order that she had to execute if she failed to meet his demands.","\"I understand. Please tell the general that I’ll definitely arrive on time. After all, I’ve never been late when I do things for the general, and I’ve never disobeyed any of the general’s orders.\"","Even though her hands were shaking, Lina’s voice was still steady. She sounded very calm.","She knew that if she panicked now, she would lose her life!","Everyone was afraid of a general’s methods.","After hanging up the phone, Lina took a long time to put the phone away from her ear. Her arm just fell limply to her side, lacking any strength.","Thump...","Just as Ye Jian was about to bend down to pick up the cell phone, Lina, who was trembling in fear, suddenly raised her hand and punched Ye Jian crazily in the narrow car.","\"Who told you to move? Did I say that you could move? Who asked you to pick up my cell phone? Did I say that you could pick up my cell phone?\" She vented all her fear on Ye Jian. Not only did she punch Ye Jian hard, but she also grabbed the hair on the back of Ye Jian’s head with her left hand. The narcotics police could clearly hear Ye Jian gasping in pain."]},{"number":4714,"title":"Chapter 4714: Suffer","paragraphs":["The voice was very familiar. It was so familiar that it made the narcotics police officers clench their fists tightly. Then, there was the sound of someone slapping another person. Line, Target No. 2, was hitting the female soldier they sent out again.","They could hear the sounds, but they couldn’t do anything. They could only listen. Even though anger burned in their chests, they could only listen.","\"Who gave you permission to move around...\"","Slap! Slap!","Ye Jian had already received countless slaps on her face. She was thrown left and right. Ye Jian, who was forced to raise her head, could only cry and beg for mercy.","The corners of the eyes of the narcotics officers turned red.","However, the scene was even more brutal than what they were hearing.","Lina turned all the fear in her heart into anger and directed it at Ye Jian. Not only did she use her fists, but she also kept kicking Ye Jian.","\"Stop hitting me, Lina. Please, don’t hit me... Ah, it hurts. It hurts. Lina, I know my mistake. I know my mistake! Please, stop hitting me. It hurts. It hurts.\"","In the car, Ye Jian begged for mercy in pain. The bodyguard and the driver sitting in the front row looked back through the rearview mirror. When they saw Lina’s ferocious face, they felt lucky that they weren’t the ones who got hit. Fortunately, they brought Ye Jian out.","Otherwise, they would become Lina’s punching bags.","It would be best if all the anger in her heart disappeared. That way, they would be safer.","As for Ye Jian, who was beaten up, heh, she was unlucky to have fallen into Lina’s hands. It was Lina’s kindness that she didn’t kill Ye Jian immediately. If Lina could calm down after a few beatings, it meant that she thought highly of Ye Jian.","In the eyes of these people, fighting and killing were nothing. The main thing was that they could do whatever they wanted. Human nature was like trash to them. They had already lost their human nature.","In the small space in the car, Ye Jian’s screams hurt the hearts of the narcotics police. They had to bear with it. A little impatience would spoil great plans.","On the other hand, this meant that the female soldier they sent was very successful. She didn’t arouse the other party’s suspicion or make them feel that something was amiss. At least her life wasn’t threatened for the time being.","This was the only way to control the anger in their hearts.","Lina was finally tired. Her hands and feet were all sore. She glared at the skinny figure who was sitting in the space between the seats. Her chest heaved up and down rapidly. She rolled down the car window again and let the mountain wind blow in, calming her down.","The bodyguard in the front row handed her a bottle of mineral water respectfully. \"Lina, have some water.\"","As for the figure that was hit until she shrank into a narrow space, the bodyguard didn’t look at her. Those who weren’t important would lose their lives sooner or later. He was already used to it and didn’t think that Lina had done anything wrong.","After taking the mineral water from the bottle, Lina raised her head and was about to drink it when the driver happened to pass by a corner. The car jolted twice. Before she could drink the water, it spilled on Lina’s clothes.","Her anger was ignited again. The driver didn’t notice anything amiss. The bodyguard noticed it and was so frightened that his expression turned cold. He hurriedly apologized, \"I’m sorry, Lina. When we make turns on the mountain, it’ll be very bumpy. Please bear with it.\"","Only then did the driver realize that he had made a huge mistake. He hurriedly apologized, \"Lina, I didn’t do it on purpose. The general needs you to go over as soon as possible. I... I don’t dare to slow down.\""]},{"number":4715,"title":"Chapter 4715: Law Of The Jungle","paragraphs":["The driver’s explanation made Lina’s expression improve slightly.","Although Lina could be so brutal to Ye Jian that she was seen as inhumane, she was not bad to the people around her who went through life and death with her. Although she was brutal, she knew that when she encountered danger, the people around her would protect her and help her evacuate. She couldn’t go overboard.","Lina didn’t argue with them. She raised her head and drank half a bottle of water. Then, she twisted the plastic bottle, making it creak. She was already frustrated, so when she heard the low sobs in the car, Lina tightened her grip on the mineral water bottle. In the end... she poured the rest of the water on Ye Jian’s head.","The cold water suddenly poured down on her head, causing Ye Jian to scream in shock. Lina raised her leg and kicked Ye Jian’s shoulder.","Fortunately, Lina specially put on sportswear to make it easier for her to walk around the mountain. She even changed into sneakers. Hence, although she kept kicking, Ye Jian was still able to withstand it.","If Line were wearing her usual thin high heels, Ye Jian would’ve suffered today.","In front of Lina, Ye Jian had to lower her stance and let Lina think that she was weak and easy to bully. No matter how Lina hit or scolded her, she wouldn’t resist.","Just like what the narcotics police thought, Ye Jian’s disguise was quite successful. Lina didn’t suspect anything, and neither did the bodyguards guarding her. No matter how many beatings she received, Ye Jian’s life was not in danger.","Lina, who had splashed water on Ye Jian, felt that she still had some anger that she needed to vent out. She wanted to teach her a lesson. However, she remembered that she still had to push Ye Jian out to bear the general’s anger later. She was afraid that she would beat Ye Jian to death and lose a punching bag. Even though her expression was ugly, she endured it.","She endured her fists, but she couldn’t control her mouth. She shouted angrily, \"Shut up, you piece of trash! If you cry again, I’ll push you under the wheels and crush you to death! Shut up! Don’t cry anymore!\"","Ye Jian didn’t manage to do anything for her, but she still had the cheek to cry.","Ye Jian shut up, but she didn’t get up from the small corner where she was huddled. Without Lina’s instructions, she couldn’t move. Otherwise, she would be beaten up again.","Although beatings were beneficial to lowering Lina’s vigilance against her, it wasn’t her intention to be beaten often. Some beatings were unavoidable, but some could be avoided.","Lina didn’t ask Ye Jian to move. To her, these girls who were sent to her were worse than dogs. Since they were dogs, she would tease them when she was in a good mood. If she felt like it, she could crush them to death.","The state of the roads in Laos was average. The mountain roads leading to the various villages were all dirt roads. There was not a single asphalt road. General Minlai was in a small village at the border of Laos. It was very close to the place where he destroyed the drugs today. It was so close that he could see the place that was destroyed during the day.","Today, he personally destroyed all the drugs that were supposed to be sent to various countries. How many tens of millions of dollars were destroyed? Tens of millions of dollars!","Tens of millions of US dollars were gone just like that. They were all destroyed in one go. He didn’t even have the time to save the goods. They were all destroyed!","If it weren’t for his subordinates’ incompetence, he wouldn’t have paid such a huge price and suffered such a huge loss!","Money, money. That was all money. How many pieces of equipment could he buy with tens of millions of dollars?!","In the end, they were all destroyed under his eyes.","General Minlai’s face was so ashen that it was bone-chilling.","The adjutant walked over and lowered his head. \"General, Lina is waiting for your instructions outside.\"","\"Let her come alone.\"","The more he thought about it, the more his heart ached. The anger in General Minlai’s heart was on the verge of exploding. Lina was truly unlucky."]},{"number":4716,"title":"Chapter 4716: Brutal","paragraphs":["Lina, who had already arrived, led a group of people into the forest. If they went a little further, they would reach General Minlai’s location.","\"Is the general still angry?\"","Seeing the adjutant come out, Lina asked in a low voice. She didn’t dare to show her anxiety, in case the adjutant told the general that she was uneasy.","\"The general wants to see you.\"","The adjutant didn’t say anything else. Although he had some ties with Lina, this relationship wasn’t enough for him to bear the general’s anger. It was impossible for Lina to learn anything else from him.","Knowing that the adjutant was a ruthless person, a vicious look flashed past Lina’s face. She lowered her eyes and turned to Ye Jian. \"Why are you still standing there? Follow me!\"","Ye Jian moved her feet. The adjutant raised his hand to stop her. \"Lina, the general asked you to go over alone. The rest of you, wait outside.\"","\"I have something to report to the general. She has to go.\"","Lina’s face was as hard as a rock. She couldn’t even control her lips when she spoke.","\"Three minutes left.\" The adjutant only listened to General Minlai. What Lina wanted to say to the general was not within his consideration. If she had anything to say, she could report it to the general directly. The general made his own decisions. It was not up to an adjutant like him to interfere.","Knowing that there was no turning back, Lina’s fingers trembled. She brought Ye Jian out to bear the general’s anger, but now, she couldn’t even bring her along!","They didn’t give Lina too much time to dawdle. She had to go over alone immediately. If not... the general would really make her kill herself.","On the other hand, Ye Jian was very disappointed that she couldn’t go over. She wanted to confirm if it was General Minlai.","Both of them wanted to go, but the general didn’t agree. No matter how arrogant Lina was in front of Ye Jian and the rest, she couldn’t do anything. She could only walk out of the forest alone.","She saw General Minlai standing at the edge of the empty space that stretched out from the mountain. The viewpoint here was wide. It was pitch-black outside the edge, and below was a cliff that was high enough.","Before she could approach, Lina started to panic and be afraid when she saw General Minlai’s back.","Every step she took felt like she was walking on a sharp knife. Every step made her tremble in fear. She was afraid of the warlord who controlled her life and death. She had been afraid of him for more than ten years!","The adjutant didn’t follow them anymore. The surroundings were filled with special forces soldiers from Myanmar. They entered Laos secretly and protected the general’s personal safety. There was nothing wrong with Lina going to see the general alone.","General Minlai heard footsteps approaching step by step from behind. His eyes were cold as he turned around. Lina was so frightened that her entire body jumped. She didn’t expect the general to suddenly turn around. She was caught off guard and broke out in a cold sweat.","\"Lina, do you know why you’re still alive?\"","General Minlai opened his mouth calmly without any anger. His expression was as calm as his voice, but Lina was so frightened that her knees went weak.","Although his voice and expression were calm, the way he looked at her... was so cold that it was as if he would raise his gun and shoot her in the next second.","Lina, who didn’t want to die, knelt in front of General Minlai and bowed deeply. \"It’s because of your magnanimity that I’m still alive.\"","Her words caused General Minlai to let out an extremely cold laugh. He laughed softly and looked at the eyes of the woman kneeling in front of him. He looked at her as if she were a dead person."]},{"number":4717,"title":"Chapter 4717: Kill Them","paragraphs":["Cold sweat broke out on Lina’s back. She didn’t dare to raise her head. She pressed her forehead against the grass and tried her best to let General Minlai see her humbleness.","\"No. It’s because you brought me considerable benefits that I placed you in an important position. However, I’m very disappointed in you. Because of your failure, I lost tens of millions of dollars in Laos. Do you know how many guns and ammunition tens of millions of dollars can buy and how many soldiers I can feed?\"","Lina’s body trembled as she swallowed her saliva and replied jerkily, \"General, I’ll definitely try my best to salvage this loss. Please...\"","In the forest, the branches swayed. Birds flapped their wings and suddenly flew into the dark sky. General Minlai’s hand had already reached for the pistol at his waist. He looked from Lina to the forest where the birds flew out.","The clear and cold moonlight shone on General Minlai’s face. It was even fiercer and colder than Lina’s. It was a fierce and cold look that looked down on everyone and was not afraid of anyone.","Lina, who was kneeling, did not feel anything amiss. She was so afraid that cold sweat was dripping down her back. She swallowed her saliva with difficulty. Just as she was about to finish her sentence, gunshots suddenly came from the forest.","Lina quickly took out a pistol from her waist. She jumped up agilely and protected General Minlai behind her.","\"General, be careful!\"","At this moment, Lina was grateful for the sudden gunshots. It allowed her to have the chance to protect General Minlai and turn the situation around.","The moonlight shone on the ground. General Minlai, who was standing under the moonlight, remained calm in the face of the gunshots. He was not surprised at all.","The gunshots were fired by a soldier hiding in the dark. Someone had entered the forest and was discovered by his soldiers.","Lina didn’t know this. She held her pistol tightly and protected General Minlai. She said in a low voice, \"General, please evacuate immediately. I’ll cover you.\"","General Minlai cherished his life. Although his ’money’ had been destroyed, as long as he was alive, he could earn it back. However, he had nowhere to retreat now. The cliff was behind him, and the path in front was the only way out.","\"Kill them and leave one alive.\"","He wanted to see who wanted to kill him and who had come to the borders of Laos!","The Burmese Special Forces soldiers who were hiding in the dark had already charged over. The gunshots became exceptionally dense. The adjutant waiting at the outer area ran over. \"General, we need to evacuate immediately!\"","A scream came from the forest. It was Ye Jian’s voice. Right on the heels of that, her voice was muffled as she was dragged to the side by the bodyguard beside her.","\"If you shout again, I’ll shoot you first!\" The bodyguard took out his pistol and glared at Ye Jian fiercely. Just now, when she screamed, he almost got shot!","Ye Jian trembled all over. The muzzle of the gun was pressed against her temple. It caused a dull pain. She was really worried that the pistol would misfire...","She nodded furiously, indicating that she would not scream again.","The bullets flew past the top of her head, hitting tree trunks and knocking down leaves. The air was stained with the smell of grass.","Ye Jian lay on her stomach tightly. She hoped that these people who suddenly appeared and fired could kill General Minlai and his men.","The dark clouds slowly covered the cold moon. The moonlight covered the clouds, and the dark forest became pitch-black. The bodyguard, who was preventing Ye Jian from escaping, was startled. He immediately reached out to grab the girl beside him. He grabbed her and slowly exhaled the cold air in his throat."]},{"number":4718,"title":"Chapter 4718: Life-Saving","paragraphs":["The gunshots were as dense as rain. They came from all directions. Ye Jian, who was lying on the ground, couldn’t escape casually. If she escaped now... she would become a live target. Before she could take a few steps, she would be riddled with holes.","She cherished her life!","She still wanted to go back alive to participate in her graduation ceremony.","\"Don’t move. Stay here obediently. If you move, you’ll die faster.\" It was too dark in the forest. The bodyguard was afraid that Ye Jian would escape during the chaos, so he wanted to scare her.","Ye Jian replied while crying, \"I won’t run. I won’t run. Lina won’t let me off. She’ll kill me... I won’t run. I won’t run.\"","The bodyguard was relieved. Lina was very capable. No ’human goods’ had ever escaped from her hands!","Those who were dishonest were always discovered by Lina and dealt with in advance.","The bodyguard who threatened Ye Jian didn’t know that he almost stepped into hell. The moment the gunshots sounded, Ye Jian had the urge to kill the bodyguard who kept staring at her. She still had the intention of killing him until he warned her.","The other party’s words made Ye Jian’s killing intent dissipate.","If the bodyguard died and she remained alive... With Lina’s paranoia, she would definitely become suspicious. Once she became suspicious, no explanation would work. Lina would kill her.","Ye Jian didn’t know whether the narcotics police had taken any action. She needed to continue staying by Lina’s side and find more clues to send back to the country. Hence, she couldn’t make a move.","Ye Jian, whose killing intent had dissipated, became even more obedient. She didn’t move at all. In order to let the bodyguard focus on his surroundings, she even took the initiative to reach out and grab the corner of the bodyguard’s clothes tightly. She was telling him that she was by his side and didn’t dare to escape.","Ye Jian’s cooperation allowed the bodyguard to pay more attention to his surroundings. The gunshots were too chaotic, so he didn’t dare to appear casually. He could only hide well.","It was impossible for the general to come to Laos alone. He would definitely bring his soldiers into the country secretly. With the soldiers around the general, they didn’t have to jump out and fight.","The bodyguard guarding Ye Jian was cautious and did not step out. The two bodyguards beside Lina reacted quickly and hid first. Then, they fired together and headed in Lina’s direction.","The complicated terrain of the forest provided good protection for everyone. The soldiers brought by General Minlai had already figured out this forest during the day. Those fellows who came to assassinate General Minlai at night were killed by these soldiers one by one.","Surrounded by four soldiers, General Minlai stared fiercely at the forest where gunshots kept ringing out. His lips, which had turned purple from smoking all year round, curled into an elicit sneer. \"Keep two alive. Pry their mouths open.\"","\"Yes,\" a soldier replied and informed the soldiers in the forest.","At this moment, Lina heaved a sigh of relief. She was very lucky tonight.","Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!","The bullets hit the hard rocks, and sparks flew everywhere. Ye Jian heard a faint sound behind her. It was the sound of feet stepping on fallen leaves.","However, the bodyguard beside her didn’t notice anything and only stared ahead.","If this continued, they would definitely be discovered.","\"When can we leave? I’m afraid...\" Ye Jian opened her mouth and cried. Her voice didn’t cause any waves among the gunshots, but it was enough for the people behind her to hear.","The footsteps stopped, and the faint sounds disappeared. The bodyguard covered Ye Jian’s mouth tightly again. He wished he could suffocate Ye Jian to death. \"Shut up!\""]},{"number":4719,"title":"Chapter 4719: Missed","paragraphs":["Ye Jian’s nose was covered. Due to the lack of oxygen, her feet and hands were flailing around. She made even more noise, reminding the group of people who were sneaking over that there were people here. Hence, they chose to take a detour.","Even if the other party didn’t take a detour and chose to shoot, with Ye Jian and the bodyguard’s hiding position, they wouldn’t be shot immediately. There was still enough time to escape.","The soldiers brought back by General Minlai were not to be trifled with. They were all brave and good at fighting. The people who came to assassinate General Minlai probably didn’t expect there to be elite soldiers deployed. There weren’t many people sent over, and they weren’t elites either. It was fine in the early stages when they were facing General Minlai’s soldiers as they could still fight. In the later stages, the disparity in strength appeared, and they were gradually losing. However, they wouldn’t lose immediately.","Ye Jian, who was almost suffocated, was finally able to breathe the gunpowder-stained air. She took deep breaths and coughed.","General Minlai was used to all kinds of situations. There had been many assassination attempts on him. As one of the largest warlords in Myanmar, he was definitely a formidable person. He didn’t take such assassination attempts seriously until a red light suddenly flickered.","Lina noticed the red light, and her expression changed drastically. She shouted, \"General, be careful!\"","That was the red light of a sniper rifle. There was a sniper!","The four soldiers reacted faster than Lina. When Lina opened her mouth, someone had already pounced on General Minlai and protected him tightly. Another soldier used his body to block the red light. Large-caliber bullets tore through the air. Lina felt something splashing on her face. It was warm and sticky.","She didn’t scream. She knew very well what was splattered on her face.","The soldier’s head was blown up by bullets. His skull was shattered, and his blood and brain matter splattered all over her face.","With a sniper around, the situation was different. General Minlai, whose expression was dark, wasn’t in the mood to pursue Lina’s matter anymore. He didn’t stay where he was and let the soldiers cover his retreat.","Lina didn’t follow him closely. She just chose to retreat temporarily. When they entered the forest, she said to General Minlai, \"General, I’ll stay. I’m sure you know my methods of interrogating people.\"","At this moment, General Minlai’s expression improved slightly. He snorted softly and left with the soldiers.","\"Leave two alive. Kill the rest,\" the adjutant ordered. Before he left, he gave Lina a meaningful look. He didn’t say anything else and left with the general.","The soldiers in the forest started clearing the area crazily because of the sniper. The screams became more concentrated. Ye Jian kept lying on the ground. Even when the hot bullets hit the back of her hand, she didn’t move.","She didn’t move until the point of the firefight was a little further away from her and the bullets were no longer brushing past her head.","About half an hour later, all the soldiers who had secretly entered the territory of Laos to assassinate General Minlai were killed except for two who were left alive. Lina, whose face was covered in soot, walked out. She looked at the two captured soldiers. The first thing she did was to look for Ye Jian.","She was worried that Ye Jian would take the opportunity to escape.","The bodyguard grabbed Ye Jian’s collar and dragged her over. He pushed her to Lina’s feet and reported Ye Jian’s performance just now.","This time, Lina, who was in a good mood after capturing two soldiers alive, wasn’t angry. Instead, she thought that it was normal.","This was the first time Ye Jian heard gunshots. It was only normal for her to scream in fear.","\"Fortunately, it was just a scream. I thought she would pee her pants.\" Lina giggled and glanced at Ye Jian coldly.","The most important thing now was to pry useful information out of the survivors.","When Ye Jian saw Lina, the first thing she thought of was... if she didn’t kill General Minlai, she should at least kill this beautiful snake. After tonight, she didn’t know when she would have a chance.","Ye Jian was simply thinking about it. However, she didn’t expect that the opportunity wasn’t far away from her."]},{"number":4720,"title":"Chapter 4720: Cruel Means","paragraphs":["Ye Jian saw the two captives too. They didn’t look like people from the military unit or mercenaries. Instead, they looked like thugs. They probably weren’t even bodyguards.","General Minlai didn’t take everyone away. He left a few people behind to help Lina complete the clearing. After the gunfight was over, these people went into the woods and dragged out the corpses one by one without Lina’s orders, making it easier for Lina to count the number of people.","The sniper that appeared had been found.","Ye Jian looked at the sniper that was carried out silently. A sniper that could be killed so quickly was not a sniper.","Holding a sniper rifle wasn’t enough for one to be considered a sniper.","It was said that he even blew up the head of one of General Minlai’s personal guards. This meant that he still had good marksmanship. It was just that he hadn’t mastered the techniques, which led him to lose his life in vain.","Lina, who was standing in the empty space, didn’t push everything to the soldiers left behind by General Minlai. She was afraid that she would disappoint General Minlai again, so she carefully instructed her subordinates to help the soldiers count the number of people left behind. She tried her best not to miss any of them.","It couldn’t be helped. She was a criminal now. If she wanted to appease General Minlai’s anger, she had to make a contribution.","Lina urgently needed to make a contribution so that she could show off her ability. Only then could she continue working in peace and not be afraid of being executed by General Minlai at any time.","That was right. If General Minlai wanted to kill someone, it wouldn’t be considered killing. The official term would be ’execution’.","There was no criminal responsibility for execution.","However, at General Minlai’s level, even if someone really said that he ’killed’ someone, it wouldn’t cause a fuss. General Minlai would still be the victor.","At around 2:00 am, a total of 28 corpses were counted. These people were used to it and didn’t feel uncomfortable at all.","The strong smell of blood in the air made Ye Jian hold her breath. She was standing in the downwind. The wind blew over to her, bringing the smell of blood toward her face. The smell... made her really uncomfortable.","The two people who were tied up saw their brothers whom they usually chatted and laughed with. Now, they were all lifeless. Besides grief and indignation, they hated General Minlai even more.","They thought that Minlai wouldn’t bring too many people with him when he entered the territory of Laos to destroy the drugs. There weren’t many people around him when he appeared on the television. They thought that there weren’t many people... That was why they came up with this plan.","Unexpectedly, it turned out that the rest of Minlai’s people had infiltrated the country secretly.","Before Lina could interrogate them, they kept glaring at her. If it weren’t because she was in a good mood tonight, the two of them would’ve been tortured by Lina several times before they even went down the mountain.","She didn’t have any torture tools on hand... but Lina could make use of whatever she found.","Sharp stones, broken branches... Everything could become Lina’s torture material. She had a way to make people crazy but not die immediately.","Ye Jian, who had been trained by her for three months, shuddered when she saw it with her own eyes.","However, this time, Lina didn’t punish them immediately. Instead, she clapped her hands and brought the two survivors to her. She bent down slightly and looked at the two of them carefully. After confirming that she didn’t know them, she pushed them to the side of the corpses.","Instead of torturing the living, she decided to torture the dead.","Torturing the dead... Once again, Ye Jian saw Lina’s inhumane and cruel side. Ye Jian curled her fingers slightly and exhaled softly. She looked away silently."]},{"number":4721,"title":"Chapter 4721: Bloody","paragraphs":["Lina seemed to have thought of something. She shouted someone’s name. It was none other than the bodyguard guarding Ye Jian. She instructed the bodyguard to bring Ye Jian to the front.","This was to let Ye Jian see her cruelty at a close distance.","\"Hurry up!\"","The bodyguard pushed Ye Jian’s back forcefully. Ye Jian didn’t dare to move. Instead, she retreated step by step. \"No, no. I’m not going over... I’m not going over...\"","\"You’re not going over? You want to be chopped into pieces like them? Fine, as long as you want, I’ll tell Lina immediately.\" The bodyguard with typical Burmese features had a fierce look in his eyes. \"Are you going or not?\"","Ye Jian hugged her head and was dragged by the bodyguard.","\"Take her hands off! Let her open her eyes wide! If she doesn’t watch, I’ll gouge out her eyes!\" Lina saw that Ye Jian was hugging her head and trembling all over. She smiled cruelly and forcefully clasped Ye Jian’s hands behind her back.","\"Lina, please, I’m very obedient. Let me go. I don’t dare to look... Ahhh...\"","Ye Jian saw the scene in front of her even more clearly. At that moment, Ye Jian’s killing intent toward Lina reached an unbearable level.","However, she needed to endure it!","Although the information had been sent out, there was still no news from Captain Deng. She didn’t know if the underground human trafficking route in China had been eliminated or if they had other arrangements... She still needed to bear with it before she received any news from Captain Deng.","Ye Jian trembled like a cicada in fear. Lina raised her head and laughed. She pinched Ye Jian’s chin tightly and said fiercely from above, \"Tonight, on account of your honesty, I’ll only let you watch. I won’t really chop you up.","\"Watch carefully, and remember it in your heart. You have to be more obedient in the future, understand? If not, you’ll end up like them. If I kill you, I’ll chop your body into pieces and throw them into the Mekong River to feed the fish.\"","Ye Jian was like a piece of meat on Lina’s chopping board. She had the power to determine whether Ye Jian lived or died.","The smell of blood in the wind got stronger. Ye Jian felt that her stomach was churning. She wanted to vomit. This was bloody and cruel. It was hell on earth!","The two survivors were so angry at what Lina did that they almost went crazy. They started cursing, and a bunch of vicious words came out of their mouths.","Although Ye Jian finally learned the Burmese dialect within three months, she didn’t know any curse words. After listening for a long time, she only knew that the other party was cursing. As for what they were saying, she could only get the gist of it.","Cursing had never been her specialty, but she heard Lina being cursed. Ye Jian, who was forced to watch from a close distance, suppressed the churning in her stomach. She raised her hand and touched her swollen face. She pursed her lips.","She felt good when she heard Lina being cursed. If it wasn’t for such a bloody scene, she might have smiled...","The cruel and bloody scene made her heart feel as heavy as molten iron. It was so heavy that it was difficult for her to breathe properly.","As the curses of the two survivors got worse, Ye Jian realized that Lina wasn’t angry. This abnormality made Ye Jian’s expression change slightly.","Lina wasn’t someone who would laugh after being scolded. No one in the village dared to say anything bad about her. No one dared to be impudent in front of her. They didn’t even dare to raise their voices in front of her."]},{"number":4722,"title":"Chapter 4722: Evil Human Nature","paragraphs":["Lina was smiling despite being scolded like this... She had to be up to something!","She picked her fingernails while giggling. She said casually, \"Go ahead and cuss me out. You’re not the only ones who have cursed at me. Go ahead, I’ll listen.\"","In front of a bloody scene that was no different from a massacre, Lina was still able to laugh loudly. The more she laughed, the more furious they felt.","Ye Jian, who had been paying attention, slowly lowered her eyes.","She understood why Lina did this.","There were thousands of ways to torture people. Lina’s current method was one of them. She used the cruelest method to pry useful information out of the living.","Ye Jian knew that Lina won again when one of the survivors said, \"Brother Kun won’t let you off.\"","Brother Kun was known as Wu Jinkun. He was one of the drug lords of the Golden Triangle and was once a warlord of the Shan State.","His father was a fishing tyrant who built up his family business with this. When he was in his middle ages, he relied on drug trafficking to become the richest person in Shan State. From then on, he recruited soldiers and spent ten years becoming a warlord in Shan State.","The son inherited his father’s legacy, and Wu Jinkun became a warlord in the Shan State.","But later...","Ye Jian lowered her eyes. Wu Jinkun was too ambitious as he wanted to control the entire Myanmar. Hence, he became surrounded. The former warlord escaped back to his base in the Golden Triangle. Five years later, he suddenly became one of the biggest drug lords in the area.","There was a rumor that Wu Jinkun and General Minlai had a personal grudge. It was said that in the past, Wu Jinkun and General Minlai were as close as blood brothers. Later, they became enemies due to benefits. This information wasn’t written down. After all, it wasn’t verified. However, the narcotics police officer who was with her at that time had discussed it with her.","At this moment, when Wu Jinkun was suddenly mentioned, Ye Jian felt that the ’rumor’ might not be just a rumor. There was no smoke without fire. There had to be some inside story. That was why there were rumors about them being enemies.","If that was the case... Ye Jian looked up slightly and glanced at the two survivors silently. She quickly retracted her gaze and thought about it.","She didn’t suppress the churning in her stomach anymore. As more and more limbs appeared in front of her, even the cold moonlight was dyed with a cold blood color. Ye Jian held the tree trunk with one hand and vomited.","The bodyguard guarding her sneered. He didn’t plan to drag Ye Jian away. He continued to watch her closely so that she could watch the scene.","\"So, it’s Brother Kun.\" Lina, who didn’t spend much effort to get useful information, raised her eyebrows and heaved a sigh of relief.","She could finally give the general a satisfactory explanation!","The soldiers who stayed behind looked at the bloody ground and then at Lina. One of them walked away and took out his phone to call the adjutant beside General Minlai.","Lina, who was secretly observing the actions of the soldier, smiled even wider. She said sarcastically, \"There’s an ancient saying in China. The winner is the king, and the loser is the bandit. Now that you’ve lost, why are you still showing off in front of me?","\"Brother Kun sent you out. Did he want you to cuss at me? Hahaha, why did Brother Kun send such useless people?","\"No wonder the general has always looked down on you. It’s not your fault. Even a bitch like me looks down on you. A drug lord of the Golden Triangle? With such men, what kind of drug lord is Brother Kun? No matter how much a fisherman acts as the boss, he’s still a fisherman.\""]},{"number":4723,"title":"Chapter 4723: Bloody Scene","paragraphs":["\"A mere fisherman wants to compete with the general? How ridiculous! Hahaha!\"","The bloody wind was filled with Lina’s arrogant laughter. She kept saying insults to others.","\"Chop them up and send the body parts to Brother Kun’s stronghold personally!\"","Ye Jian vomited until her throat was burning with pain. Lina managed to pry out some useful information. Now, it was time for Lina to kill them.","Lina, who had never been cussed at like that before, laughed loudly. Her mood was already ruined. She stopped laughing and pointed at the two of them with a ferocious expression. She shouted angrily, \"Break all of their teeth! All of them!\"","What was the point of keeping them? She had been enduring it for a long time!","There was no need to endure anymore!","As someone raised a rock and kept smashing it into the mouths of the two survivors, screams of pain could be heard within a five-kilometer radius.","Stones smashed into the teeth of the two survivors. Their lips, chins, and teeth were smashed. Their entire faces were badly mutilated, and their white bones could be seen.","The two people who were hit didn’t die immediately because the places they got hit at weren’t fatal. One of them even had his eyeballs pop out. He didn’t stop breathing immediately. He was even breathing heavily.","Ye Jian had never seen such brutality before. She vomited until her head was filled with blood and her vision turned black.","This was Ye Jian’s first time entering the tiger’s den as an undercover agent. She saw the darkness and cruelty of human nature. This was the first time she understood how evil human nature could be.","One would never know where the bottom line of human nature was!","The more she came into contact with the darkness of the world, the angrier Ye Jian became.","She was not afraid. She only wanted to destroy these people. She wanted to destroy these inhumane darkness that bred evil. She wouldn’t be afraid even if she had to give up her life!","Captain Deng was right. They represented justice and the core of whether a society was stable or not. Eliminating darkness was their lifelong goal. They would not stop until their lives ended.","Finally, the two survivors lost all their teeth. The people who hit them threw away the blood-stained rocks. Ye Jian even saw flesh tissues falling from the rocks and into the grass...","Lina turned on the flashlight and shone it on two faces that were badly mutilated. Their facial features were no longer intact, and their white bones were revealed. She wasn’t afraid. Instead, she sized them up carefully. After confirming that all their teeth were broken, she nodded in satisfaction.","\"Not bad. Well done. You’ll get a reward when you go back.\"","Lina was quite generous to her subordinates who had risked their lives for her. If not, why would these people work for her?","The two survivors whose faces were smashed until they were unrecognizable were still heaving slightly. When Lina took the shovel from the car and shoveled two handfuls of soil on their faces, their weakly heaving chests finally calmed down.","Ye Jian, who vomited bitter bile, clenched her fists secretly. Lina, Lina... Before she left, she would kill Lina personally!","She could not let a beast-like creature continue to live and harm others!","She needed to find a chance to tell Captain Deng what happened today. She wanted to see if she could lure Wu Jinkun’s men into the mountain stronghold and destroy Lina’s nest.","This way, the narcotics police wouldn’t have to risk their lives to infiltrate Myanmar. They could use Wu Jinkun to destroy Lina.","The car started moving again. This time, Ye Jian didn’t get in the same car as Lina. She was covered in dirt. She was dragged to another car before leaving the hell on earth behind her."]},{"number":4724,"title":"Chapter 4724: Borrowing Force","paragraphs":["Cheli City’s narcotics police didn’t sleep the entire night. Through the radar tracker, they found out where the target, Lina, was meeting General Minlai. Through the eavesdropping device, they also found out that the Golden Triangle drug lord, Wu Jinkun, had sent people into the territory of Laos to assassinate General Minlai. However, they failed.","This news immediately perked up the narcotics police in Cheli City. Soon, they thought of the same thing as Ye Jian.","As it turned out, Wu Jinkun and General Minlai were on bad terms. As it turned out, the rumor was true. That made things much easier!","Captain Deng was very familiar with using others to do one’s bidding.","When Wu Jinkun found out that the people he sent were all killed by his enemy, General Minlai, and their corpses were chopped up, he immediately asked his subordinates who were active in the territory of Laos to go to a certain mountain to check.","Wu Jinkun was furious when the news was confirmed!","Wu Jinkun naturally knew about Lina. The two of them even had a cooperative relationship. However, he didn’t know that she was actually General Minlai’s subordinate.","\"Don’t let her die immediately. I want to personally slice her flesh and cut off her limbs.\"","The tall and strong drug lord, Wu Jinkun, played with the Kachin knife that all the men and women in his race knew how to use. His eyes were sinister.","At the same time, after a 15-day nationwide crackdown, a human trafficking route which was established a year ago surfaced. The organization specialized in kidnapping young girls and young women abroad. It took another three days to capture all criminals involved in the transnational human trafficking organization in various countries. They also killed five armed criminals who resisted on the spot.","After returning to Myanmar, Lina personally reported the situation to General Minlai and brought a deal worth ten million USD. Her landline phone rang furiously before she could even rest. That was when she found out about the news.","Lina, who received General Minlai’s reward, had been in a good mood. Upon learning the news however, she broke the nail on her pinky finger.","\"How’s the situation at the border? Is there any news of the kidnapper? Has China contacted the Shan State police?!\" Lina, who was holding her phone, shouted sternly. She had finally entered the Chinese human trafficking market, but in just a year, it was destroyed by the Chinese police!","How infuriating!","The person on the other end of the phone reported the information they had gathered so far. The Chinese police were strict. The kidnappers had entered China to complete a transaction. They were also dealing in ’human goods’, which were four well-rounded women. They were the mature women that Lina needed.","They were arrested on the spot by the Chinese police. They didn’t even have time to escape.","Lina’s expression suddenly darkened. \"Find an opportunity to kill the kidnappers.\"","\"There was no chance to do anything. After the kidnappers were caught, the Chinese police immediately took them away from Cheli City. We don’t know where they are now.\"","...","\"Contact the informants of the Shan State police and ask them to find out immediately whether the Chinese police managed to get any useful information out of the kidnappers!\" She needed to know if the Chinese police had pried any useful information out of the kidnapper.","\"Alright!\"","The person on the other end of the phone hung up. Just as he hung up, a man in a Burmese military uniform pushed the door open and entered. The man, who had just taken his hand away from the landline phone, froze. A hint of killing intent flashed past his face.","The man who came in was a platoon leader stationed at the border of Myanmar. The person who made the call was the company commander stationed at the border.","\"Company Commander, the Chinese are increasing the strength of their checkpoints. Do we need to increase the strength of our checkpoints too?\" The platoon leader sat down and asked in a low voice. The company commander, who had a guilty conscience, felt relieved."]},{"number":4725,"title":"Chapter 4725: Ruthless","paragraphs":["As the inspection of the borders of China suddenly increased, the border defense soldiers of Myanmar immediately followed suit and increased the inspection of the borders. For a moment, the two sides were in a state of panic. The drug dealers who were secretly transporting drugs didn’t dare to take the risk.","Lina hadn’t received any information on whether the Shan State police had cooperated with the Chinese police. The next night, a big shot came to the mountain village.","Lina personally accompanied this guest to tour the drug-making factory in the village.","\"Brother Kun, give me two more days to deliver this batch of goods. Look at the purity. It’s even better than the drugs I provide overseas.\"","\"I’ve been working with you for many years, Brother Kun. I owe you so much. I wouldn’t dare to sell you inferior goods and disappoint you, Brother Kun.\"","The small piece of paper was covered with a layer of white powder. This was the drug produced by Lina’s drug factory. She handed the lead paper to Wu Jinkun, who had countless thin and dense scars on his face.","Wu Jinkun was from the Kachin race of Myanmar. He was brutal and loyal. It was also because of his loyalty that he was persecuted by General Minlai, whom he had once thought of as his brother. He even lost his status as a warlord and became a drug lord in the Golden Triangle.","The thin scars on his face were all wounds caused by the thorns when he rolled down the mountain when he was fleeing for his life. His face was like a fish net that was destroyed.","He and General Minlai were of the same age. They were both in their early 40s, and their faces were filled with cruelty. Even when they smiled, they were fierce. No one dared to look at them directly.","He took the lead paper and looked at the woman who was still pretending to be obedient in front of him. He sneered in his heart but smiled as usual. His fingers were stained with powder as he rubbed them carefully. \"Not bad. It’s a good product. You’ve always been good at doing things. I’ve always felt at ease.","\"I came over this time to bring you a business deal. Someone will come later. Prepare some goods. We’ll hand in the goods tonight and get the big order together.\"","Lina was overjoyed. Smiling, she politely invited Wu Jinkun out. A bodyguard who had been following her walked over and secretly gave her a look. He shook his head slightly.","This was to tell Lina that everything was normal. Wu Jinkun didn’t suspect anything.","Ye Jian’s eyes darkened when she saw Wu Jinkun. She slowed down her footsteps.","Wu Jinkun was here...","She glanced at the two sides of the hall. There was a bodyguard she had seen once in the fake temple. He was also a Chinese undercover agent.","At this moment, he was on Wu Jinkun’s side.","Ye Jian glanced over. The other party seemed to be waiting for her. Suddenly, he lowered his eyes slightly and glanced at the fruit plate in her hand. Ye Jian looked downward and saw his palm pressing down.","Ye Jian lowered her pupils and walked over more slowly. Her path changed from straight to curved.","As she walked, the skinny girl who used to target her back then bumped into her. Ye Jian was caught off guard, and the fruit plate flew out of her hand. It fell with a bang. The fruit plate shattered, and the fruit scattered in all directions.","\"How can you be so careless!\"","The skinny girl did it on purpose. Without waiting for Lina to scold her, she knelt down and started complaining first.","Lina’s expression turned ugly. She glanced at the scattered fruit and glared at Ye Jian. \"You can’t even do small tasks properly. What’s the use of keeping your hands?\"","The skinny girl, who was kneeling and apologizing, curled up even tighter. She buried her head tightly and smiled coldly.","’This time, let’s see how she ends up. It would be best if her hands were cut off and she turns into a cripple.’","Lina would not put a cripple in an important position!"]},{"number":4726,"title":"Chapter 4726: Hostility","paragraphs":["The girl who always went against Ye Jian was from Myanmar. That day, she and another girl couldn’t snatch the pancakes from Ye Jian. Although she still got two pancakes in the end, she had been vigilant against Ye Jian ever since then. She vaguely felt that the other party was the biggest threat to her survival.","As it turned out, her thoughts were true.","Ever since they were all released and trained by Lina, she had been inferior to the girl from China. She thought that she was smart enough to get rid of the Chinese girl who was rarely punished by Lina. She even used some methods, but she never succeeded.","In the end, the Chinese girl saw through all his tricks. If she weren’t smart enough to quickly clean up the mess she caused, she would’ve suffered greatly.","Ye Jian didn’t argue with her because they were both people who had fallen from grace. It must not have been easy for her either. In order to survive, Ye Jian had no choice but to see through the skinny girl’s small tricks.","Ye Jian always knew that the girl who was kneeling on the ground looked skinny and weak, but she was actually scheming. If not, Ye Jian wouldn’t have used her to shatter the fruit platter.","The skinny girl thought that she could take the opportunity to let Lina cripple Ye Jian. However, she didn’t know that Ye Jian was scheming against her and purposely lured her to attack.","After Lina finished speaking, she raised her hand and asked someone to drag Ye Jian out. Ye Jian, who seemed to be frightened, fell to the ground with a plop. She trembled and didn’t dare to say anything.","The more one said, the more mistakes one made. It was better not to say anything.","Since the Chinese undercover agent who came with Wu Jinkun asked her to knock over the fruit platter, she would do it.","Soon, the other party whispered something into Wu Jinkun’s ear. Wu Jinkun looked up with his beady eyes. He glanced at the two girls kneeling on the ground and looked at Lina. \"My bodyguard said that the fruit platter fell and broke because the person who knelt first intentionally pushed the person carrying it. In my opinion, we should cripple her hands first.\"","Lina didn’t see it happen and just thought that Ye Jian was careless. When Wu Jinkun pointed it out, she couldn’t hold back anymore. She felt that Wu Jinkun had stepped on her dignity.","Her beautiful eyes were sinister as she gritted her teeth and shouted, \"Drag them both away and make them kneel under the sun!\"","The skinny girl, who wanted to harm Ye Jian, rolled her eyes in fear when she heard that. She trembled and wanted to say something. Remembering Lina’s character, her face turned ashen.","Two men wearing Burmese attire walked in with rifles on their shoulders. They grabbed the girls’ hair with fierce expressions and quickly dragged them over.","\"Ahhh... It hurts, it hurts...\"","They were being pulled by their hair, and their screams were heard all the way.","The bodyguard standing behind Wu Jinkun moved his fingers slightly. He lowered his eyes and stood respectfully.","Ye Jian’s scalp was about to be peeled off. She covered her head with her hands. It was so painful that her face was covered with tears. She didn’t resist and had no choice but to let the other party drag her. Here, she was the first to get used to being dragged around.","The skinny girl, who was screaming in pain, was also dragged away. She glared at Ye Jian fiercely.","She had a deep hostility toward Ye Jian. Even though she was screaming in pain, she didn’t forget to say harsh words. \"Don’t think that you can be smug just because I was dragged out too. You’re the one who broke the fruit platter. Lina said that she would cripple your hands. Just you wait!\"","The hostility was so deep, but Ye Jian wasn’t in the mood to deal with it."]},{"number":4727,"title":"Chapter 4727: Killing Intent","paragraphs":["The fruit platter was broken, and she was dragged out... What would the undercover agent of the narcotics police do next?","He would come and look for her, right?","Also, why did he make her smash the fruit platter? She didn’t understand the intention of the undercover narcotics officer.","She didn’t know if it was because of Captain Deng or the situation outside. She didn’t know when they would take action either. It had been almost half a month since she sent the news. With the police’s ability, they should have taken action long ago.","Ye Jian, who was thinking about something, was distracted by the pain in her scalp. She couldn’t pay attention to what the skinny girl said. This made the girl even angrier.","Only two of the five girls from back then were left. The two girls who were killed by Lina had already joined the pile of white bones. The elder sister who was still alive had become Lina’s tool and was sent somewhere. The Burmese girl who had always been targeting Ye Jian felt her hostility toward Ye Jian get stronger and stronger.","Ye Jian had never thought of arguing with the other party, but that didn’t mean that the other party would choose to get along with her peacefully. Seeing that Ye Jian was ignoring her, she gritted her teeth, and killing intent gradually appeared in her eyes.","\"Don’t be smug! Just you wait! Ah...\"","The ruthless girl’s back was scraped by a sharp rock, leaving a bloody wound. She only shut up after her face distorted in pain.","As for the Burmese man who was dragging her away, he didn’t let go.","The Burmese girl, who had a bloody wound on her back, was no longer in the mood to glare at Ye Jian. She was in so much pain that she cried out and begged the Burmese man who was dragging her away, \"I’ll walk by myself. I’ll walk by myself. Please, stop dragging me. It hurts. It really hurts.\" It was so painful that her head seemed to want to dislocate itself.","Ye Jian’s back was also cut by the sharp stones. She gathered her thoughts. Otherwise, she could feel the unbearable pain in her scalp.","Ye Jian suddenly felt a sharp killing intent. She frowned in pain as she looked at the Burmese girl who was very hostile to her. Now, not only was she hostile, but she also wanted to kill her.","She actually wanted to kill Ye Jian?","Ye Jian’s eyes turned vicious. She said in a hoarse voice, \"Ma Min, don’t even think about escaping Lina’s punishment! Idiot!\"","\"What did you say? What did you say? Say it again.\" The Burmese girl, Ma Min, seemed to have suffered a huge blow. She grabbed the wrist of the man who was pulling her hair tightly and kicked Ye Jian crazily. \"It’s you, it’s all you! You’re the stupid one who didn’t hold the fruit platter properly. If I’m punished, I won’t let you off! Just you wait.\"","\"Why are you screaming? You’re courting death!\"","The Burmese man, who was dragging her away, was very impatient with her. He stopped and kicked her waist. It was so painful that she almost fainted.","It was all that Chinese girl’s fault! It was all her fault!","Why wouldn’t she die? Why wouldn’t she die?","It hurt. She was in so much pain!","She had to kill the Chinese girl that Lina valued. Lina said that she preferred useful and ruthless people. There was only one outcome for useless and cowardly people—death!","It wasn’t easy for her to survive. How could she let herself die?","She didn’t want to die, so only the Chinese girl could die!","The skinny girl didn’t feel that she was doing anything wrong. If she didn’t want to die, other people had to die. Just like Lina, she was the only one who killed others while no one would dare to kill her."]},{"number":4728,"title":"Chapter 4728: Action","paragraphs":["Only by becoming someone like Lina could she survive better.","The Burmese girl, Ma Min, had a pained expression on her face as she thought furiously.","The screams outside were getting further and further away. Wu Jinkun, who was here for revenge, glanced coldly at the woman who was pretending not to be guilty at all. He said to the person beside him sarcastically, \"Bring a few people to guard outside. They broke a fruit platter this time. I’m worried that they’ll fall on their guns the next time. I have to ask who ordered them to smash things in front of me.\"","Lina’s cheek muscles twitched. What did he mean?","In the past, when he came to the village, he would always smile at her. Why was there something wrong today?","Could it be that... he had discovered something?","Lina’s heart sank. She smiled and said in a sweet voice, \"Brother Kun, I’ve embarrassed myself. We’ve worked together for many years. Don’t you know me? Don’t worry, Brother Kun. There won’t be a next time.\"","She spoke coquettishly, but her heart was not calm at all. Seeing Wu Jinkun’s dark expression, a trace of nervousness flashed past the depths of her eyes.","Wu Jinkun was a ruthless person that even the general was afraid of. He suddenly came to her stronghold... Did he really come to cooperate? But why did he suddenly come? He didn’t contact her in advance like before.","Wu Jinkun, who had been tricked by this woman for many years, didn’t want to say anything to his enemy. He waved his hand and asked the two bodyguards standing behind him to go out and ask.","Lina, whose dignity was stepped on again, felt a burning pain on her face. She retracted her smile. \"Brother Kun, the people who broke the platter are mine. Do you think I ordered them to do it?\"","\"I’ll know if it is or not after asking. Why? Are you worried?\"","\"Of course not. Your men can go and ask.\" Lina gritted her teeth secretly but still maintained a smile. She magnanimously let Wu Jinkun’s men out.","\"Report to me when you come back.\" Wu Jinkun gestured for his men to leave. The bodyguard who walked out was none other than the Chinese undercover agent who came to Ye Jian with news.","The two bodyguards nodded slightly. When they walked out, they even took out the pistols on their waists. It was obvious what they meant. Lina’s expression turned dark.","She couldn’t help but tighten her grip on the armrest of the bamboo chair. The depths of her beautiful eyes were dark. She asked calmly, \"Brother Kun, what do you mean by this? Have you forgotten the rules of the village?\"","\"I didn’t forget. I’m just worried that there’s danger lurking here. I have to be careful.\" Wu Jinkun was once a warlord and had fought with the Burmese government. He didn’t take a small character like Lina seriously.","In the past, they showed each other some respect because they worked together. Now, they wouldn’t do that anymore.","Lina’s heart sank. \"Brother Kun, if you have something to say, just say it.\"","As the bamboo door closed, the voices inside were isolated.","...","The two bodyguards who walked out saw the girls kneeling under the sun. One of them sneered and said, \"Lina is really vicious. Not many girls can live long in her hands. She’s beautiful but ruthless. No wonder Brother Kun sometimes reminds his subordinates to learn from Lina.\"","The undercover agent from China took out a cigarette from his pocket. The lighter made a click, and blue flames lit the cigarette in his mouth.","He took a deep breath and exhaled a string of white smoke. He looked indifferently at the girls kneeling under the sun. \"Brother Kun wants to know who ordered them to smash the platter. I’ll go over and ask now.\""]},{"number":4729,"title":"Chapter 4729: Deep Intent","paragraphs":["\"That bitch, Lina, is not honest. Her people even smashed the fruit platter in front of Brother Kun today. Who knows if she ordered her subordinates to do it on purpose? Watch this spot carefully. If anything happens, tell Brother Kun immediately. This is other people’s territory. No matter how familiar we are with it, we have to be careful.\"","After he finished speaking, he walked toward Ye Jian who was kneeling under the scorching sun with a cigarette in his mouth.","The undercover agent said that Ye Jian intentionally broke the fruit platter.","The first reason was that it was a test.","The second reason was to see if Ye Jian had a sharp reaction and understood what he meant. After all, the two of them had to cooperate and leave this place tonight.","Thirdly... and most importantly, Lina was cunning and cautious. If he interacted with the female soldier rashly, she would definitely be suspicious. He was afraid of implicating the female soldier. Hence, he needed an excuse to interact with her.","Fourthly, he suggested to Wu Jinkun that they should see if they could persuade the people around Lina to rebel so as to facilitate their plan for tonight.","Now, he could go talk to the female soldier without being suspected by Lina.","At the same time, his first probe made him feel more confident. A simple probe allowed him to see that the female soldier was indeed as sharp as Captain Deng said. She understood immediately with just a simple action.","When he walked over, he was stopped by Lina’s subordinates. The undercover agent puffed out smoke rings continuously and said something while swinging his pistol with one hand. The two people who stopped him reluctantly moved aside.","The sun in June was very bright. It was so hot that the leaves curled up. Even the ground was scorching hot.","Ye Jian, whose hands were tied behind her back, lowered her head as she knelt. She felt that the blood flowing down her back was slowly congealing because of the sun. Even her wounds were no longer bleeding.","The glaring white sunlight was blocked by a shadow. Ye Jian, whose shoulders were trembling, raised her head timidly. There was a fire in her black and bright eyes that was hotter than the sunlight.","He glanced at Ye Jian. He didn’t say anything but secretly made hand gestures.","\"Calm down.\"","Ye Jian’s eyes moved slightly. The undercover agent walked in front of Ma Min. He forced Ma Min to raise her chin with the black and cold muzzle of his pistol. He asked her in a vicious voice, \"Who told you to push her and smash the fruit platter for Brother Kun to see?\"","He had been an undercover agent for many years. The air around him was tainted with the viciousness of a murderer. Ma Min was so frightened that her teeth were trembling. She didn’t even have the courage to speak.","\"Hurry up and say it! Otherwise, I’ll kill you!\"","Ma Min was so frightened that she lost control of her bladder. She didn’t even catch her breath. Her eyes rolled over, and she fainted from fright.","The undercover agent was speechless. She fainted before he could get anything out of her!","He went over and kicked Ma Min. He stared at Ma Min’s face to confirm that she had fainted. Then, he walked to Ye Jian’s side.","The shadow shrouded her again. Ye Jian didn’t raise her head again. Instead, she pretended to be afraid and wanted to move her knees. In front, Lina’s men were staring intently. They were even secretly touching their rifles, preparing to shoot at any moment.","The undercover agent squatted in front of Ye Jian. He didn’t press the muzzle of his gun against Ye Jian’s chin. He spoke in a high and low voice to interrogate Ye Jian. He told Ye Jian what was going on outside.","\"The transnational trafficking routes Lina has established in our country have been destroyed. At the same time, we have a lot of evidence of Minlai’s crimes. Congratulations, Little Ye. Your mission is completed.","\"Wu Jinkun came this time to destroy Lina tonight. The people he brought have already secretly infiltrated the village. Tonight, you and I will cooperate to escape. We can return to our country!\"","Ye Jian closed her eyes gently.","She, who had been undercover for more than four months, could finally... escape tonight. She was looking forward to tonight!","The Burmese girl, who had fainted at the side, trembled slightly. Her fingers curled up secretly. Why did she... seem to hear Chinese people talking in her ears?"]},{"number":4730,"title":"Chapter 4730: Hard To Choose","paragraphs":["Ma Min’s breathing was just a little heavier. Ye Jian noticed it immediately, and the expression on her face changed.","The sun was shining brightly, and there was the sound of cicadas around them, though they seemed to have lost their energy. Ye Jian, who was kneeling, was kicked down too. Ma Min, who just woke up, saw it and felt great.","\"How dare you break something in front of Brother Kun? You’re the first one to do so. Let’s see how long you can stay alive!\"","The undercover agent raised his leg again and kicked Ye Jian’s waist. It looked like he was using a lot of strength, but in fact, he was just kicking her with the tip of his shoe. He couldn’t hurt her at all.","From Ma Min’s point of view, she only knew that the Chinese girl she wanted to get rid of had been kicked again. The more she was beaten, the happier she was.","Even though her body was emitting the smell of urine, Ma Min could still laugh in her heart.","She was really happy!","She liked to see the Chinese girl getting hit!","Hahaha, Ye Jian wanted to compete with her? She was courting death!","Ma Min was a girl from the Kachin race in the mountainous area of Myanmar. The Kachin race in Myanmar was warlike and had produced countless ambitious people. Both men and women had a bloodthirsty nature. Ma Min’s mountain village relied on hunting for a living. That ruthlessness was stimulated when she was young. In the face of danger, Ma Min’s first thought was survival.","She wanted to live well and make a name for herself. She wanted to be like Lina, who could take control of other people’s lives.","Ye Jian’s existence was an obstacle that prevented her from living well. She had to be eliminated.","When she opened her eyes, she saw Ye Jian getting kicked twice. Ma Min only dared to laugh after the undercover agent left. \"How does it feel to be hit? Isn’t it comfortable? Hahaha, there’s something more comfortable waiting for you.","\"Just you wait. You can’t escape. Hahahaha, you can’t escape.\" Her voice was shrill, like small stones scraping across the ground. It was so shrill that it hurt people’s eardrums.","Just now, she had heard people speaking in Mandarin. However, besides the only person who could speak Mandarin, there was no one else.","In that case, who was she talking to?","The man who left just now?","Did the two of them know each other?","Ma Min became excited. If the two of them knew each other, then... could it be said that this fellow was not honest?","Hahaha! Lina didn’t like dishonest fellows!","She had thought of a way to get rid of this fellow as soon as possible!","Ye Jian, who was already used to Ma Min’s hostility, struggled to kneel properly again. She knew that if Lina didn’t see her kneel properly when she came out, she would definitely be beaten up again.","She would be able to leave this dog-eat-dog place tonight. She needed to maintain her current state. She couldn’t add another injury to her body as that would delay things.","Before she left, Lina was the target she needed to deal with with the undercover agent of the Narcotics Brigade.","The Burmese girl in front of her, Ma Min, wanted to kill her... Ye Jian struggled for a long time but didn’t get up. She gave herself some time to breathe. She glanced at Ma Min coldly and made a difficult choice.","Leaving Ma Min alive would be a misdeed. She had assimilated to the darkness. To her, taking human lives was no different from stepping on ants. The assimilated Ma Min, could she still be kept alive?"]},{"number":4731,"title":"Chapter 4731: Cutting Grass","paragraphs":["Ye Jian, who was making a difficult choice in her heart, closed her eyes because of the bright sunlight. She couldn’t let Ma Min stay. It was best to get rid of Ma Min before dealing with Lina.","This girl who was kidnapped along with her had a hard life. In the end, she actually needed to kill Ma Min with her own hands. No one knew how painful this was for Ye Jian.","As for General Minlai... he could only be handed over to the government of Myanmar. He didn’t commit any crimes in China directly. He just instructed his subordinates to do his bidding. Even if China had countless evidence of General Minlai’s crimes, China still didn’t have the right to deal with Minlai.","If General Minlai was not eliminated, it meant that the biggest malignant tumor had not been eliminated. Even without Lina working for him, with General Minlai’s status, there would be many other people working for him.","Killing Lina could indeed affect General Minlai, but it couldn’t touch his foundation.","Unless... they carried out an assassination.","It was easier said than done to assassinate General Minlai. Even the special forces of the Xueyu unit might not be able to kill him.","China had many difficulties in dealing with General Minlai. The only and best choice was to hand the matter over to the government of Myanmar.","The noon sun started to deviate slowly. Ye Jian, who had been exposed to the sun for a long time, had dark brown wounds on her lips. Her throat was dry and itchy. She knelt without moving. Without Lina’s order, no one would come and pull her up.","The drug-making wooden house, which was constantly producing drugs, was bustling with activity. A large number of drugs were produced and processed in factories before being sold all over the world. The drug addicts became General Minlai’s best money-making tool to provide for his troops.","A Burmese man carrying a gun hurriedly pushed open the wooden door of the largest bamboo house in the entire village with footsteps. Sunlight poured into the shady bamboo house through the door frame. The light cut open the darkness in the bamboo house and illuminated Lina’s seductive eyes.","The man first bowed to Lina, then to Wu Jinkun. He pretended to be calm and walked to Lina’s side. He leaned down and whispered into her ear.","Lina tightened her grip on the armrest. A vicious look flashed past her beautiful eyes. \"Tell them not to move for the time being. If discovered, kill everyone and leave immediately. Don’t leave any traces!","\"All the ’goods’ have to be dealt with. There’s no need to send them to the stockade! All the ’new goods’ that haven’t arrived must be dealt with as well. Leave no one alive!\"","The goods referred to the girls who were trained by Lina to deal drugs.","The new goods referred to the girls who had been kidnapped but had yet to be sent to the village.","Lina wanted all the goods to be dealt with to prevent the police from catching her.","\"Yes.\"","The Burmese man with the gun on his back nodded. Thinking of the two kneeling human goods outside, the man asked a few more questions.","Lina, who was sitting in the bamboo house and discussing matters with Wu Jinkun, was so angry that her hands were about to break the bamboo railing. The human goods had brought her huge benefits, and it was also the human goods and drug trafficking that had built up her image in front of General Minlai. However, they had to be destroyed!","First, it started with China. Then, it was Thailand. Would it be Myanmar next? Laos?","Right now, the most important thing wasn’t to destroy the human goods. The most important thing was that she mustn’t let anyone discover her existence!","Everyone had to die. Even if the new goods hadn’t arrived yet, they had to die.","She had to cut the grass and leave no roots behind.","As for the two people outside, Lina glanced at Wu Jinkun and slowly released her grip on the armrest. A cold and dark look slowly rose in her eyes. Then, it slowly sank. Why not... do him a favor?"]},{"number":4732,"title":"Chapter 4732: Something’s Not Right","paragraphs":["In just a few seconds, Lina’s emotions fluctuated. She started thinking of one scheme after another. In the blink of an eye, she raised her hand. Countless lives were about to be lost in her hands.","Ye Jian and Ma Min were the luckiest people now. As Wu Jinkun was unhappy that the fruit platter was knocked over, Lina took the opportunity to please Wu Jinkun and used two lives to coax him.","To them, human lives were just a tool that could be used and disposed of. They would keep them when they were useful and deal with them when they were useless. They never hesitated. It was so simple.","Her bright red lips curled up slightly as she said calmly, \"Lock them up and wait for Brother Kun to deal with them.\"","She definitely couldn’t keep them alive, but she could make better use of their lives.","\"Yes.\"","The man with the gun on his back nodded and quickly left the bamboo house.","Wu Jinkun played with the bamboo wine glass in his hand. The fragrance of wine overflowed from it. A teasing smile flashed past his small eyes.","It looked like that bitch finally knew what was going on outside.","Minlai, that treacherous old thing, clearly knew about it in advance, but he suppressed it and didn’t tell the b*tch. It could be seen that he treated her as a useless person.","If it weren’t for the fact that the b*tch was so ruthless to the people he sent that she didn’t even leave their corpses intact, he might have kept her around to see if he could deal with Minlai.","What a pity. Although that b*tch was beautiful and he still had a trace of interest in her, she didn’t give him any other options. She thought that everything would be fine after seducing that bastard Minlai and that she could stabilize her position in the core area of the Golden Triangle. Heh, tonight, he would let her find out whether that bastard would support her. Without Wu Jinkun’s consent, who would be able to do well in the Golden Triangle?!","Besides the Black Widow, no other woman in the Golden Triangle could really stand for themselves. They all had a backer.","This b*tch wanted to learn from the Black Widow? She overestimated herself!","Wu Jinkun drank all the wine in his bamboo glass. As he put down the glass, a thick killing intent flashed past his eyes.","For the sake of his 30 brothers who died, Lina had to die!","He would cut off her limbs, her waist, and her head to bring back to the village to tell his brothers that he, Wu Jinkun, had avenged them!","Although Wu Jinkun was a drug lord, he was quite loyal. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have been able to make a comeback after his soldiers were defeated and become one of the drug lords of the Golden Triangle.","Wu Jinkun pretended that he didn’t know anything and continued to talk about business matters. Although he had made arrangements, Lina, who had always been uneasy, started to feel uneasy. She wanted to get up and leave several times, but she was also worried that Wu Jinkun would find out that she was in contact with General Minlai. She forced a smile and tried to get Wu Jinkun drunk.","The closed bamboo door opened again. Ye Jian saw the man with the gun walking out again. Even though there was a certain distance between them, she could still see his impatience.","The man seemed to look in the direction where they were kneeling. Then, he instructed the people around him. Two subordinates with guns on their backs raised their heads and looked in their direction. They nodded slightly and strode toward them.","Ye Jian’s heart tightened due to her sharp sense as a special forces soldier.","He went in hurriedly, and when he came out, he looked at them and immediately ordered people to drag them away... Ye Jian’s heart tightened, and her breathing froze for a moment.","Something was wrong, something was very wrong!","Something was wrong!","No one would tell the people who were about to die what would happen next. In these people’s eyes, the two ’human goods’ were just that—goods. Now that the goods had become useless, it was up to them to deal with them.","The ten-meter-deep hole in the back of the mountain was only half filled. It looked like two more corpses would be thrown in tonight."]},{"number":4733,"title":"Chapter 4733: Must Be Eliminated","paragraphs":["Ma Min looked at the two people walking over. She wasn’t as sharp as Ye Jian, so she didn’t realize that she was about to lose her life. She thought that Lina had ended her punishment and looked at Ye Jian provocatively before the two of them walked over. Her lips moved slightly. \"Wait for death, Chinese scum!\"","Ye Jian glanced at her coldly and pursed her lips.","Before the sky turned dark and before Wu Jinkun’s men did anything, she had to protect herself. Nothing could happen.","The two fierce-looking men from Myanmar walked over and dragged one each. Soon, Ye Jian and Ma Min were dragged to a dungeon where no one would be able to leave alive.","Ma Min didn’t realize that something was wrong until she reached the entrance of the dungeon. Her fierce face was instantly covered with horror. She thought that... she didn’t have to kneel anymore. Now, she had been dragged to a place she had never been to before. Ma Min screamed.","The dungeon was like a hunter’s trap, and she was the prey waiting to be killed by the hunter!","\"Why did you send me here? I want to see Lina. I want to see Lina. I have something very important to tell Lina. Let me go over. Let me go over!","\"I have something important to tell Lina. It’s really very important! Let me out. Please let me out. I really have something very important to tell Lina. Let me out, let me out!\"","Ma Min, who finally realized that she was in a dangerous situation, slammed the iron door that was as thick as a baby’s arm. It was welded with steel plates. The iron door clanged. It was useless even if she hit the door until her palms hurt.","The guards outside the dungeon didn’t hear what she said at all. Even if they did, they wouldn’t care.","Those who entered the dungeon were bound to die. What could they say?","With a face full of despair, Ma Min screamed and slammed on the door. Ye Jian saved her energy and waited for tonight. She could finally vent the anger she had been accumulating for months tonight. She needed to conserve her energy.","She weighed the big lock on the iron chain with both hands. It was still alright. If she had some time, she could pry it open. At least, there was a way out.","With an escape route, Ye Jian started to sized up the dungeon.","The dungeon was dark and humid. The air was so turbid that it mixed with the nauseating smell of decay. Large patches of dark brown stains were left on the ground and walls. Ye Jian used her fingernails to dig a piece of the wall and slowly placed it on the tip of her nose to smell it. Her expression gradually froze.","Human blood...","She raised her eyes slightly. Under the sunlight, she looked around the entire dungeon carefully. She saw that the surroundings were dark brown. There were even patches on the ceiling of the dungeon... This was not a dungeon but hell on earth.","She was stepping on dried and discolored human blood. Everywhere she looked, there was human blood. Her entire body was surrounded by human blood...","Lina... had to be eliminated!","Ye Jian’s dark eyes were filled with bloodlust. She slowly raised her hand and touched the dark brown blood spots on the uneven wall. The killing intent in her heart had reached its peak.","Footsteps came from behind, accompanied by the strong wind. Ye Jian turned her body and avoided Ma Min’s attack.","\"It’s you! It’s all your fault! You’re the one who harmed me! I’m going to kill you! I’m going to kill you!\"","If she had held the fruit platter properly, it wouldn’t have broken. Lina wouldn’t have ordered her to be locked up in the dungeon where she hunted her prey. It was all Ye Jian’s fault!","Ma Min screamed shrilly. Her hair was disheveled as she pounced on Ye Jian again.","That was right. As long as she killed Ye Jian, Lina would definitely forgive her and let her off.","She needed to kill Ye Jian!","Ma Min, overcome by the demon in her heart, stared at Ye Jian’s neck until her eyes were red."]},{"number":4734,"title":"Chapter 4734: Alive","paragraphs":["Ma Min grew up in the mountains and had a wild personality. The hunters in the mountains told Ma Min from a young age that she should either let go or kill the prey she liked. This was the survival method of the Kachin.","She was used to the law of the jungle. After being trained by Lina, the killing intent in Ma Min’s bones was stimulated. She learned from Lina that if she wanted to survive, she needed to be ruthless. If anyone became an obstacle to her survival, she had to get rid of them!","\"You’re an eyesore. You’re an eyesore! Without you, Lina would definitely let me off. I’m the most obedient person around Lina. You have to die. You have to die!","\"What’s the use of keeping useless things? I’m going to help Lina kill you. I’m going to kill you!\"","The crazy Ma Min grabbed a handful of dust from the ground and scattered it in Ye Jian’s eyes. While Ye Jian was waving her hand, she pounced on her again. Ye Jian was the prey she needed to kill now. She had to kill Ye Jian!","At this moment, there was only one thought in Ma Min’s mind—kill!","This was not her first time killing someone. Her hands were already stained with blood. She was not afraid to kill again.","\"Ma Min, you’re a very smart girl. On account that we’re both from the Kachin race, I’ll let you live well and live the life you want.","\"Do you see that? The two girls in front are disobedient and useless. Help me kill them. After killing them, you’ll be my person.","\"In the future, help me monitor the other two girls. If they make any movements, tell me everything. Tell me what they said and did.","\"Ma Min, I think so highly of you. You won’t disappoint me, right? Are you familiar with this knife...\"","It was a completely black Kachin knife that had been polished until it shone with a cold light.","Why wouldn’t she be familiar with it?","Everyone in the village had a Kachin knife. Children had to learn how to hold it from a young age. They could use it skillfully when they grew up.","If it weren’t for the fact that she yearned for city life and wanted to live a life where she could eat well and wear good clothes, where she didn’t have to worry about money every day, she would definitely still be living a poor life in the village.","\"This knife is the knife of our Kachin people. It’s a knife that can save us. Now, I’ll give it to you. Help me kill off two useless people.","\"Kill them and from then on, you’ll be my subordinate. Do you want to be my subordinate? My subordinates will get lots of money. You can use the money to live a good life.","\"Why did you leave the village? Wasn’t it because you wanted to live a better life?","\"I’ll give you one chance now. You only have one chance. If you miss it, it might be someone else’s turn to kill you next time. Do you want to live? Do you want to live well? Then kill them, kill them!\"","Kill them, kill them...","Ma Min once regretted leaving her village because she had to go hungry. Now, she didn’t regret it anymore!","Why should she regret it?","Lina said that as long as she killed people, she would live the life she wanted!","She just needed to kill those people!","Just like a few months ago, she closed her eyes and stabbed the Kachin knife into the person’s body. Then, she pulled it out, stabbed it in, and pulled it out again.","She didn’t stop. She used all her strength on the Kachin knife."]},{"number":4735,"title":"Chapter 4735: Fallen","paragraphs":["The blood sprayed on her face. It was very hot. It was so hot that her hands trembled even as she raised the knife. However, the other person was still breathing and screaming. She couldn’t let them scream. She couldn’t let them live.","If they lived, she would be the one to die!","She wanted to live. She wanted to live well, just like Lina!","Ma Min, who had fallen into madness, was already in a mess. Her ears were filled with Lina’s voice. Every word pierced through her ears and imprinted in her mind. Ma Min, who had been completely brainwashed, only knew that she had to kill to live.","This was the rule of survival that Lina taught her.","\"I’ll kill you! I’ll kill you! Don’t dodge! Stand properly! Just like the two of them, I’ll kill you! Ahhh, I’ll kill you!\"","Ma Min’s eyes were red as if she was being controlled. She pounced on Ye Jian again and again. Her sharp cries made the coldness in Ye Jian’s eyes get stronger and stronger.","Just like the two of them...","The first two girls who went missing?","Ye Jian, who dodged continuously without counter-attacking, attacked.","She grabbed Ma Min’s wrist with one hand and twisted it forcefully. Then, she kicked her right leg and knocked the crazy Ma Min down at a fast and violent speed.","Bang!","Ma Min fell hard on the ground, raising dust around her.","\"Ah...\"","Ma Min, who was knocked down, screamed. Now, Ye Jian, who was pressing down on Ma Min’s back with one knee, bent her body into a distorted U shape. The joints of Ma Min’s arms were in extreme pain.","The back of Ma Min’s neck was grabbed by Ye Jian. The side of her face was pressed tightly against the rough ground. Her entire face was pressed into the withered grass on the ground. It was contaminated by human blood and emitted a rotten smell.","This fall caused Ma Min to regain her senses. Ma Min’s voice became sharper. \"Let me go, b*tch! Let me go... Mmm... Mmm...\"","A handful of rancid withered grass was stuffed into Ma Min’s mouth. All her words were stuck in her throat. Ye Jian exerted strength and stuffed more withered grass into her throat. Ma Min was so angry that her eyes rolled back.","\"Did you kill the two girls who went missing in the beginning? Did you kill them?\" Ye Jian grabbed the back of Ma Min’s hand tightly. The bloodlust in her eyes was stronger than Ma Min’s. It was frightening.","Ma Min, whose mouth was stuffed with grass, struggled and tried to use her tongue to push the disgusting grass out of her mouth. She didn’t answer Ye Jian’s question.","\"Did you kill them? Did you?\"","Ye Jian no longer grabbed the back of Ma Min’s neck. She suddenly changed to the grappling position. She used her elbow to lock Ma Min’s throat and used the strength of her arm to raise Ma Min’s head forcefully. She forced Ma Min’s neck to lean back. The back of her head was about to press against the joint of her neck.","\"Mmm... Mmm... Let me go, b*tch... B*tch...\"","\"Did you kill them? Did you kill the younger sister that the elder sister has been looking for? Did you kill the girl you snatched the pancake from? Did you kill them?!\"","With her neck tilted back, it was hard for Ma Min to even breathe. It was even more impossible for her to answer Ye Jian.","Ye Jian took away the withered grass that was stuffed into her mouth. Ma Min, who was able to catch her breath, coughed in pain. She coughed until tears flowed out from the corners of her eyes.","\"You killed the two of them. Why did you kill them?\""]},{"number":4736,"title":"Chapter 4736: Disappear Forever","paragraphs":["A voice that sounded like the sharpness of a Kachin knife sounded in Ma Min’s ear. Ma Min’s eyes widened instantly. She remembered now. Not only was Ye Jian the one speaking in Mandarin earlier, but a man was speaking Mandarin too!","The man who scared her until she fainted also spoke Mandarin!","\"Hey—\"","Before her voice could come out of her throat, Ye Jian used her sharp nails to stab the middle of Ma Min’s upper lip. Pain came. Ma Min swallowed her scream.","\"Why did you kill them? They’re like you. Why did you kill them?\"","Ye Jian questioned her sternly. She thought that the girls from her batch who went missing were dealt with by Lina. Who knew that... they were actually killed by Ma Min?!","\"Let... Let... me go. Traitor, you... traitor...\"","Ma Min leaned her neck back, and her breathing became smoother. A fierce look appeared in her eyes. She wanted to glare at Ye Jian, but Ye Jian was always behind her. She couldn’t glare at Ye Jian at all. All her struggles were useless. She couldn’t move or resist. She was the ’prey’ that had been caught.","The word ’traitor’ entered Ye Jian’s ears clearly. Ye Jian’s eyes were filled with killing intent. Ma Min probably heard her conversation with the undercover agent from the narcotics police, but she wasn’t completely sure at that time.","Ye Jian had another reason to kill her!","\"You killed them. Did you ever think that you would be killed by others one day? Traitor? I’ve never betrayed anyone. How can I be a traitor?\"","She exerted strength on her elbow bit by bit. Ma Min struggled even harder. Panic started to appear in her fierce eyes. \"Let... go, let... go... Lina...\"","\"After killing the two of them, you should have thought that one day, you’d be killed too. Ma Min, you chose a dead end! At that time, in order to survive, you used all your methods to kick the two of them out of the game! From the beginning... you intended to kill all of us!","\"I don’t care what Lina said to you at that time. Even if she asked you to kill them, you shouldn’t have... You shouldn’t have...\"","Ye Jian didn’t continue. Tears were already shimmering in her cold eyes.","Was Ma Min wrong?","She was wrong, but at the same time, she wasn’t.","What was wrong with her wanting to live? In order to live well, she could only listen to Lina’s arrangements and choose to kill people with a knife. Just like that, two innocent lives ended in her hands.","Was it Ma Min’s fault?","No!","It was Lina’s fault!","\"Ma Min, you walked the same criminal path as Lina. You were unscrupulous in order to survive. You thought that you could live well by doing that. You were wrong, you were wrong, Ma Min. You walked the same path as Lina!","\"I had thought about leaving with you and sending you home. I considered it.\" Tears slowly flowed out of Ye Jian’s eyes. She could clearly feel a life slowly flowing away under her hands.","Shock covered Ma Min’s face. Ye Jian had dislocated her arms. Ma Min struggled until the green blood vessels on her neck were protruding. Her throat was filled with despair.","She couldn’t live on. She couldn’t live on!","\"Traitor... You...\"","The curses gradually disappeared, and the light in her eyes gradually faded. Even her limbs gradually stopped moving. Her expression was filled with ferocity and unwillingness. Ma Min would never be able to see the rising sun tomorrow."]},{"number":4737,"title":"Chapter 4737: Abandoned","paragraphs":["Ye Jian let go of her elbow and quietly looked at Ma Min, who had struggled to stay alive. She wiped the tears that flowed out of her eyes and closed them gently. When she opened them again, her eyes were cold.","She got up and dragged the dead Ma Min to a corner of the dungeon, making her look like she was sleeping against the wall. Ye Jian then sat beside her with her hands on her knees, waiting for the sky to turn dark.","At 8:00 pm, it was Wu Jinkun’s time to act. Once the battle outside started, she would take the opportunity to leave the dungeon with the undercover agent surnamed Liu.","Now, the only thing she could do was wait.","Lina, who had finally gotten Wu Jinkun drunk, rushed back to her room and quickly dialed the number of the adjutant beside General Minlai.","She needed to know what was going on outside!","Despite how anxious she was, the call could not get through. There was always a beeping sound. The more it was like this, the stronger Lina’s premonition.","Something must have happened outside!","Lina stopped dialing and shouted, \"Someone!\"","The bodyguard guarding outside pushed the door open and entered.","\"Inform everyone to guard the mountain stronghold strictly. Once any strangers are discovered entering or leaving the mountain stronghold, kill them regardless of who they are! All the finished drugs in the factory will be transferred away. Only the drugs that Brother Kun needs to transport tonight will be left!","\"All sentries, move out. Increase the surveillance around the village! Everyone, carry guns with you!\"","Lina had a strong intuition. Now, her intuition told her that the situation outside was not good. She had to act as soon as possible. She couldn’t wait in the village.","After giving her instructions, Lina’s beautiful face twisted into a hideous expression!","Should she just abandon the village and leave?","No!","This was her hard work. She couldn’t leave just like that!","Would she be in danger if she didn’t leave?","Not for the time being.","Wu Jinkun was still here. Since he dared to come over today, it meant that she wasn’t in danger for the time being. If she was, he wouldn’t have dared to come over.","Even if she really wanted to abandon the village, she had to leave with the cash given by Wu Jinkun!","If she didn’t leave tonight, then at the latest... tomorrow night!","Her fingernails, which were painted bright red, dug into her palms. Lina got someone to come in again.","This time, her arrangement was... to leave.","Outside, the sun was gradually setting in the west. The fiery red clouds flowed to the end of the horizon. The setting sun was bloodshot, and the wind was quiet. The day finally ended, and night fell.","At a military base in the Shan State, a few Jeeps cut through the darkness of the mountain with blinding headlights. A few wild rabbits that were foraging at night were so shocked that their ears twitched and they quickly rushed into the bushes.","The wheels rolled over the mountain road, leaving deep marks.","In the car, a high-ranking general with a cold expression, dark skin, and a terrifying aura kept shaking along with the car. The driver and guard sat quietly. No one dared to speak.","The ringtone broke the dead silence in the car. The sudden ringtone shocked the people accompanying the high-ranking general. They looked at the adjutant who took out his phone.","\"General, the Shan State police are calling.\"","The adjutant didn’t hand over the phone immediately. Instead, he asked a few questions first.","General Minlai glanced at the screen of the cell phone. His eyes were filled with killing intent as he reached out to take the cell phone. \"Hello, it’s Minlai.\"","In just a few seconds, General Minlai’s terrifying killing intent increased a little. Even the adjutant swallowed his saliva and held his breath as he sat upright.","General Minlai had not shown a smile for the past half a month. He even personally executed a few high-ranking military officials who did some cheap shots but did not actually deserve to die. It could be seen how angry the general was."]},{"number":4738,"title":"Chapter 4738: Kill","paragraphs":["Now that the Shan State police had called again, the adjutant lowered his eyes slightly and unconsciously flicked his fingers on his knees. It was probably not a good thing.","The general’s expression was so dark that it seemed to be tainted with the color of the night. It was so dark that even he didn’t dare to look at him directly.","\"Since you chose to cooperate with me, your difficulties are naturally my difficulties too. Don’t worry, there won’t be any problems on my side. You just need to guard the police well and not let those useless people target me.","\"Don’t worry about the Chinese. They can’t do anything to me. How they act is their own business. It has nothing to do with us.","\"Remember, you and I just need to clean up after ourselves. We’ll settle what needs to be settled. We’ll clean up what needs to be cleaned up. Don’t leave any traces behind. If we do that, nothing will happen to us.","\"As for that line, I’ve already decided to give it up. If anything happens, blame it on her. I’ve already sent people to deal with her. If it can be resolved successfully, there’s no need for you to appear. It’s the police’s responsibility to catch criminals in Myanmar. You have full authority to deal with it. You don’t have to ask me.","\"Okay, I believe you can handle it. Yes, tomorrow, a sum of cash will be transferred to your old account... Okay... Sure, let’s have a pleasant cooperation.\"","General Minlai was expressionless throughout the entire conversation. After the call ended, he threw the phone to his adjutant. \"Lina is cunning. Inform the people sent to deal with her not to leave any future trouble for me.\"","\"Yes, General!\" The adjutant nodded.","China’s sudden action was equivalent to pulling Lina out of the water. If they didn’t deal with her now, with the sharp sense of smell of the Chinese anti-narcotics police, they would definitely trace her to General Minlai.","To prevent future troubles, Lina had to be eliminated.","Although she was still useful, compared to the general’s safety, she had to be abandoned no matter how useful she was.","The Jeep continued driving on the mountain road. The forest on both sides flashed past the window, and the car returned to calm.","Lina, who was preparing to welcome a new client, didn’t expect to be abandoned by General Minlai. She didn’t know that the so-called new client wasn’t a client at all but a killer hired by Wu Jinkun.","Wu Jinkun didn’t dare to underestimate Lina. Hence, he hired someone at a high price to kill her.","There were still ten minutes before 8:00 pm. The drugs that needed to be delivered to Wu Jinkun had been loaded and were just waiting to leave. At that moment, figures moved outside the mountain stronghold. Their footsteps were light as they rushed into the forest like ghosts.","Someone whistled as he unbuckled his belt and entered the forest to relieve himself. Before he could finish, a black shadow appeared beside him and covered his mouth and nose. The shadow cut the man’s throat with a long knife. His method was clean and efficient.","Wu Jinkun looked at the time. There were still five minutes before 8:00 pm. He looked at the bodyguard beside him meaningfully and received a subtle nod. A strange smile appeared on Wu Jinkun’s face.","He patted the drugs that had been loaded and smiled until her yellow teeth were revealed.","\"Brother Kun, you’re personally bringing this batch of goods out tonight. For the next batch...\" Before Lina could finish her sentence, the whistle in the village blew sharply. Before Wu Jinkun could react, Lina quickly hid behind the truck and took out her pistol.","Wu Jinkun reacted and hid behind the truck too. \"What happened? It’s not time yet!\"","\"Brother Kun, it’s not one of us!\" The bodyguard tightened his grip on his pistol and replied in a low voice, \"There’s another group of people!\"","Gunshots sounded around the village. Lina closed her eyes tightly with a dark expression. They were here! They were here!","The general had abandoned her!"]},{"number":4739,"title":"Chapter 4739: Battle","paragraphs":["As one of the biggest warlords in Myanmar, Lina was not the only capable person under General Minlai. Qin Maosheng, who was once beheaded by the Xueyu unit, was also General Minlai’s subordinate.","The reason why Lina was able to serve General Minlai was because of Qin Maosheng. As one of Qin Maosheng’s mistresses, Lina had been ambitious from the start.","She first met Qin Maosheng because she was looking for partners. Then, she became his mistress. That was how she met General Minlai through Qin Maosheng. It only took her less than three years to return to the village and start trafficking drugs.","This was also the reason why General Minlai’s income was not completely cut off when the Xueyu unit destroyed the warehouse where Qin Maosheng stored a large amount of drugs.","Besides Qin Maosheng and Lina, there were other drug-making factories behind General Minlai. The drug-making factories that he personally supervised were the biggest source of money for General Minlai to provide for the soldiers of the military unit.","Large quantities of drugs were manufactured and sold worldwide through drug dealers like Lina and Qin Maosheng.","General Minlai was able to give up on his people so easily because he was never worried that no one would be left to make drugs for him. On the contrary, there were many drug dealers who wanted to work with him because of his influence and connections.","General Minlai didn’t hesitate to abandon Lina. When he realized that Lina’s secret was about to be exposed, he immediately sent people to cut her off. Few people could compare to his ruthlessness.","Holding his pistol tightly, Wu Jinkun listened to the continuous gunshots around him. He leaned back against the truck and laughed loudly. \"Lina, with your intelligence, you should know who wants to kill you, right?\"","\"Hahaha! In the past, when I, Wu Jinkun, dominated the Shan State, Minlai was just a small pawn. In the end, he used my power to bite me back. Look at the dog you’re loyal to. He’s done the same thing many times! Hahaha, Lina, do you think you can leave alive today?\"","Wu Jinkun knew that Lina was hiding on the other side. They only had a truck between them. She would definitely be able to hear what he said.","But so what if she heard him clearly?","When Lina first learned about General Minlai, she was terrified. In the past, her lover, Qin Maosheng, was considered a big figure in the Golden Triangle. Just how much military fees had he collected for the general. However, what happened to him in the end?","It was a mystery who killed him. Considering their past relationship, she investigated it in secret. The moment she made a move, she received a warning from the general. If she dared to investigate, he would send someone to deal with her immediately.","In the morning, when she heard the news from the outside world, she knew that something was wrong. She took advantage of the situation to make Wu Jinkun drunk to arrange a retreat route. Now, a large amount of cash was in the car she was preparing to leave in. She had secretly made all the necessary arrangements in the village, even planning which route to take to escape from General Minlai. Since she had decided to leave, so what if she became an abandoned pawn?","Across the truck, Lina gave a sinister smile. \"It looks like you have other plans today. I’m sorry, Brother Kun. I can’t play with you anymore.\"","After she finished speaking, she gave the bodyguard beside her a look. The bodyguard would shoot to suppress Wu Jinkun while she made her retreat.","Despite still being under the influence of alcohol, Wu Jinkun’s expression changed drastically. His eyes emitted a ferocious glint as he shouted at the person beside him, \"Block her!\"","Damn it!","That b*tch actually arranged a path of retreat!","It must have been arranged when he was drunk. Otherwise, she wouldn’t have had the time.","Stupid b*tch!","As expected of someone handpicked by Minlai!","Wu Jinkun, whose face was shrouded in viciousness, spat fiercely and led the way out."]},{"number":4740,"title":"Chapter 4740: Fight","paragraphs":["\"Inform the people to clean up the dungeon. After confirming that the human goods are dead, we’ll leave.\" Lina, who was being protected by her subordinates, suddenly remembered that there were still two loose ends in the dungeon. She immediately gave orders to her people to prevent the two girls from leaving in the chaos.","The people in the dungeon didn’t need to wait for Lina’s instructions. The sound of gunshots were heard. They rushed into the dungeon and fired at the corner where the figures could be seen.","As for whether they hit the targets or not, they needed to open the iron door to confirm it.","\"Open the door!\"","The Burmese man, who was holding a gun, maintained his shooting posture. The moment the iron door opened, he shot all the way in. The dungeon was already filled with a burnt smell. It was the smell of high-temperature bullets entering the human body.","The dungeon in the night was extremely dark. The Burmese man, who was holding a gun, calmed down slightly when he detected the smell. At the same time, he put down his gun and walked toward the corner.","A total of two people came in. There was another person guarding outside the dungeon.","In a corner of the iron door, Ye Jian tied back her long black hair. She looked calmly at the two of them who were facing the corner. They were already a distance away from the iron door. From the corner, she rushed out of the iron door like an arrow leaving the bow.","\"Hey—\"","The Burmese man guarding outside noticed something amiss. He was so shocked that he only had time to open his mouth and shout. The black shadow rushed in front of him and grabbed the loaded rifle in his hand at a speed that left him unable to react.","Ye Jian, who had the upper hand, didn’t have the time to snatch the gun. She decided to use the riskiest method. Before the other party could react, she would shoot the two figures inside the dungeon with the gun still in his hand.","The two people inside turned around when they heard the sound. They knew that something had happened, but they didn’t expect to be greeted by continuous bullets.","The Burmese man, whose gun was held by Ye Jian, immediately tried his best to raise the muzzle. Ye Jian was faster than him. She buckled her fingers and fired.","It wasn’t a precise shot but a sweep...","Bang, bang, bang, bang...","The bullets that were fired continuously hit the people inside, leaving them with nowhere to escape. The bullets that swept over instantly passed through their bodies. Screams tore through the air, startling the Burmese man who had his rifle hijacked.","Ye Jian used all her strength to grab the rifle. Even though the other party’s elbow hit her chest repeatedly and her ribs hurt so much that they felt like they were broken, she didn’t let go.","Finding the best combat method in the most dangerous situation was the method Xia Jinyuan taught Ye Jian.","Ye Jian, who didn’t have any weapons, had to think of a solution. She used the battlefield and obtained a chance of survival. She even got a weapon to escape with.","The two people in the dungeon fell to the ground. The Burmese man shouted even louder.","Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!","Ye Jian kept shooting until the barrel started turning red. The bullets shot to the ground, shot left, shot right, and shot up. Large pieces of soil fell. The not-so-small dungeon was surrounded by gunshots.","Click...","The sound of an empty magazine was heard. Ye Jian, who was continuously hit in the chest, finally stopped. The angry Burmese man raised his gun and smashed it at Ye Jian.","The gunshots outside were chaotic, and the sound of fists could be heard in the dungeon. Ye Jian killed the Burmese man who stopped her from leaving.","Her elbow formed a ’V’ angle as she clamped the other party’s neck tightly. Gritting her teeth, she gave a forceful twist. A cracking sound came from his neck. The Burmese man, who was struggling until his face was red, suddenly lowered his hands. He was no longer breathing."]},{"number":4741,"title":"Chapter 4741: Fury","paragraphs":["Ye Jian had always been stubborn when it came to targets that needed to be dealt with. She had never been benevolent.","During her first overseas combat, she hesitated when facing an underaged Pakistani youth. It was because of Xia Jinyuan’s reminder that she didn’t make a huge mistake.","Mercy on the battlefield would only bring disaster to oneself.","She had already learned the cruelty of war. No matter how young the other party was, as long as she was in danger, she would never be benevolent because of the other party’s age.","She released her arm. A sharp pain suddenly came from her muscles. Right on the heels of that, she started convulsing. Her fingers started trembling.","It was because her muscles were too tense, causing a temporary imbalance.","She massaged her right arm muscles that were as hard as rocks until they felt numb. Ye Jian felt the heat of her blood flowing through her fingertips. Then, she stood up and walked toward the dungeon.","She needed a weapon in her hand, so she picked one up.","The two Burmese men who were shot didn’t die immediately. Ye Jian could still hear them struggling and groaning when she entered.","She picked up one of the guns and unloaded the magazine of the other gun. Then, she touched their waists twice and took out a sharp scimitar from one of the men’s waists. This was the scimitar that the men in the village often used to protect themselves.","The blade was no more than two fingers wide, and it was curved like a crescent moon. It looked a little like a sickle used to cut rice in the farmland, but it was several times sharper than a sickle.","Ye Jian placed it at her waist and aimed her gun at the two people who were still breathing. She shot them in the heart before turning around and walking out of the dungeon.","She needed to find the undercover agent with the surname Liu.","Gunshots could be heard everywhere in the stockade. The people outside consisted of those sent by General Minlai, those sent by Wu Jinkun, and... Lina’s own people.","The sudden shooting by the people sent by General Minlai didn’t do any harm to Lina. On the contrary, it made it more convenient for Lina to leave during the chaos.","Originally, Wu Jinkun only needed to target Lina. Now, the one-on-one situation had become a one-on-two situation. He was suppressed by the firepower of the people sent by General Minlai three times in a row and couldn’t move. Wu Jinkun gritted his teeth in anger.","He didn’t expect Lina to be able to escape successfully!","Lina, who was already prepared to escape, had a smooth journey with a large amount of cash. Listening to the dense rain of gunshots behind her, Lina bent down and climbed into the car. She looked out of the car window and sneered.","\"Drive!\"","After rolling up the brown car window, Lina stopped talking. Under the light of the fire, one could vaguely see the cold smile on her lips turning into a smug one.","She was not as stupid as Qin Maosheng. She did not think that she could rest easy just because she was working together with the general.","General Minlai was ruthless. He was even ruthless enough to scheme against his sworn brother, Wu Jinkun. She knew that she had to be careful when working for him. She also knew that once the situation turned bad, it was best to leave in time.","She could not make the same mistake as Qin Maosheng. He thought that if something really happened, the general would be lenient on account of their relationship.","The car started moving. A few strong lights lit up the mountain. The motor ran at high speed, and the car drove out of the village at the speed of an arrow.","At night, the treetops swayed and the gunshots were chaotic. Ye Jian didn’t care who was in front of her. As long as she saw them shooting, they were all criminals that she had to kill. There was no difference."]},{"number":4742,"title":"Chapter 4742: Escape","paragraphs":["\"Get in, get in! Don’t let her escape! Damn it! Get in and chase her!\"","A rough and violent voice came from the gunshots. Ye Jian’s heart sank. This was Wu Jinkun’s voice. The ’she’ he was talking about might be Lina.","Lina escaped in a car!","Ye Jian’s eyes turned sharp as she rushed out quickly. Holding her gun, she ran toward the southwest direction of the village. That was the place where the village’s vehicles were parked.","\"Brother Kun, our car broke down...\"","Boom!","An explosion louder than a thunderclap sounded. The entire mountain village shook because of the explosion.","In an instant, flames soared into the sky from the southwest direction where the cars were parked. A huge fireball soared into the sky, and heat waves surged in all directions with the explosion as the center. Ye Jian, who was running, saw the mushroom cloud in front of her and quickly went on her knees while protecting her head.","Crash!","All kinds of miscellaneous items fell from the sky like rain. The fire started to engulf the surroundings. Ye Jian, who was wrapping her arms around her head tightly, heard countless curses and screams. The gunshots stopped for a moment because of the sudden explosion.","Ye Jian shook her head. The gunpowder fell on her head. She supported herself with one hand and jumped up. She looked around. There was chaos everywhere. She wasn’t sure if she could find the undercover agent quickly enough. Lina had already escaped and blown up all the parked cars. She had planned her escape!","At the thought of this, Ye Jian picked up her gun and ran like a cheetah that came out to hunt at night. She ran in the direction where the car left.","She couldn’t chase after the car straight on. She could only take a shortcut.","A few months in the village was enough for her to memorize the surrounding terrain. Ye Jian knew very well that taking a shortcut would allow her to catch up with Lina faster and closer.","Ye Jian turned around and ran out. A black shadow stepped on the flames and quickly approached the dungeon. As they approached the dungeon, their footsteps suddenly changed and became faster. They almost rushed in.","He smelled the strong smell of blood in the dungeon!","Ye Jian, the female soldier!","His expression changed drastically as he rushed into the dark dungeon. He took the miniature flashlight at his waist and swept it all the way. The first thing he saw was the Burmese man lying outside with his neck broken. The figure panted softly and calmed down.","After checking the situation in the dungeon, the black shadow quickly retreated.","The female soldier, Ye Jian, had already left the dungeon, but she didn’t come to look for him...","The entire village was in chaos. When the villagers who were cut off by Lina heard the explosion, they were as cunning as rabbits. They crawled into the forest.","These people knew in advance that there would be a fierce battle tonight. With the explosion in the southwest as the signal, everyone immediately crawled into the forest to escape.","At this moment, Wu Jinkun knew that he had been tricked. It didn’t matter if the car they drove broke down. After all, there were still people guarding outside the village!","That b*tch was really smart. She was still able to escape even when she was surrounded!","\"Tell the people outside to guard the place tightly. If they see a car coming out, shoot!\" Wu Jinkun licked the corner of his lips and said coldly. As soon as he finished speaking, his facial expression suddenly distorted. \"Damn it! I’m helping that bastard Minlai clean up his mess tonight!\"","Wu Jinkun was too angry. He raised his pistol and fired randomly at the ground. \"Kill everyone. Leave no one alive! Cut off their heads and throw them into the river!\"","The person Wu Jinkun hated the most in Myanmar was General Minlai. However, the person he wanted to kill tonight was also the person General Minlai wanted to kill. How could he not be frustrated?"]},{"number":4743,"title":"Chapter 4743: Anxious","paragraphs":["It was not a good feeling to be someone else’s tool.","\"Liu! Liu!\"","Wu Jinkun roared. He shouted three times, but no one responded. His ruthless expression turned even uglier. Just now, Liu was still beside him. However, after the explosion, he disappeared!","Liu was the undercover agent that Cheli City’s Narcotics Brigade had placed beside Wu Jinkun. It took him three years to climb up to Wu Jinkun’s side.","This time, not only did he need to help Ye Jian leave, but he also needed to deal with Wu Jinkun secretly and take the opportunity to escape.","After retreating from the dungeon, he didn’t know that Wu Jinkun was looking for him. He didn’t have much time to look for Ye Jian, so he retreated and killed two people who he didn’t know.","At the same time, a message was sent to Captain Deng’s phone.","When Captain Deng finished reading the message, his cell phone was almost destroyed by his grip.","\"They’re already fighting over there.\" Captain Deng put down his cell phone and rubbed his dry eyes. \"It’s a cross-country combat. There are only two comrades. Whether they can come back... depends on tonight.\"","In the core area of the Golden Triangle, even China, which had the greatest anti-narcotics power, did not dare to test the waters easily. There had always been only informants and undercover missions to grasp the general idea of what was going on.","Even so, it was difficult to do it. The big drug lords who moved around the Golden Triangle all year round were extraordinary. Many of their contacts and undercover agents had been sacrificed. Even if there were undercover agents and informants deep inside, the police didn’t dare to let them stay there for too long. They were afraid of their people assimilating and were afraid that they would be in danger.","Captain Deng had long wanted the undercover agent with the surname Liu to return to the country. This time, the timing was just right. Hence, Captain Deng immediately ordered him to return to the country. Captain Deng looked calm on the surface, but he was so anxious that he felt as though his heart was burning.","He was worried that the undercover agent couldn’t return to the country.","The narcotics officers, who had been waiting in the office, surrounded Captain Deng. Their gazes landed on the phone on the desk. Everyone’s expression was serious and cold.","Besides the Golden Triangle, China had secretly sent special forces to clear some drug factories. Only the Golden Triangle was a restricted area. The military and the police wouldn’t send special forces in.","Now, two comrades needed to come out of the restricted area. Even if they sustained minor injuries, it would be fine!","\"General Minlai sent people to assassinate Target No. 2. Target No. 2 noticed it in advance and arranged a retreat. Wu Jinkun didn’t find out until it was too late.","\"Currently, Liu Ning and Ye Jian have lost contact. I speculate that Ye Jian might be chasing after Lina alone. It’s hard to say if she and Liu Ning will meet.","\"It’s not a good thing for the two of them to separate. We can only wait for Liu Ning to send another message. Ye Jian’s graduation ceremony is in a week.\"","After Captain Deng finished speaking, the air in the room froze.","Liu Ning still had his cell phone on him, so he could contact the captain at any time. However, Ye Jian didn’t have any communication equipment on her. If something happened... no one could know immediately!","A week later was her graduation ceremony. The military called and said she was awarded the title of ’Outstanding Student’ of the National Science University. On the day of the graduation ceremony, she had to go on stage to speak. The narcotics officers pursed their lips into a straight line.","If she couldn’t even attend her own graduation ceremony after spending four years in the military school, it would be a lifelong regret!","\"Captain, I suggest that after tonight, we increase our patrols at the border of the province and send helicopters to patrol. As an Outstanding Student, Ye Jian will definitely know how to send us a useful signal.\""]},{"number":4744,"title":"Chapter 4744: Blood","paragraphs":["\"Once our colleagues on the helicopter see a signal on the ground, we can immediately fetch her to the National Science University to attend her graduation ceremony!\"","Ye Jian was still fighting alone in the depths of Myanmar. Captain Deng and the rest had already arranged for a few helicopters to patrol the air along the border between Yun Province and Myanmar.","Ye Jian could faintly hear the sound of a car’s motor in front of her. She could even see beams of light rising and falling from the bends of the mountain road. If she was faster, she would be able to catch up!","She held the rough bark that scratched her hand, turned gently, and slid down the mountain a little further. Ye Jian, who had been running in the mountain the entire time, had countless wounds on her face, body, and legs caused by the thorny vines. She had also been stung by countless insects. Even though her entire body was burning with pain, it didn’t stop her from chasing after the car.","Soon, soon!","As long as she ran in front, she would be able to catch up with the car!","Even if she could only catch up to the last car, it would be enough!","She jumped down from a protruding rock and hugged a tree that grew under the rock as she slid down. She was just a slender figure, but she erupted with unimaginable strength and fought to annihilate evil with her bravery and fearlessness.","What qualities should the soldiers of this era have?","Bravery and fearlessness were definitely the most important!","On Ye Jian, one could see the epitome of the current generation of soldiers. She was fearless and moved forward with her beliefs. She never regretted it and never looked back.","After stepping on this path, she bade farewell to the beautiful and prosperous world. She bade farewell to the songs and dances. She would only be accompanied by sweat and blood. Even so, she would have no regrets.","Ye Jian, who bumped into a fir tree, bit her lower lip tightly. She saw bright lights and heard the sound of a motor. She didn’t even wipe the blood off her forehead. She carried her gun and rushed out again.","In the car, Lina received a call from General Minlai.","On the other end of the phone, General Minlai’s voice was cold. Lina, who was holding her cell phone tightly, felt her heart trembling, but the ruthlessness on her face did not diminish at all. \"General, I brought you countless military expenses, but in exchange, you abandoned me.","\"How could I stay and let myself be killed? I’m not that idiot, Qin Maosheng. I can work for your military unit, but the prerequisite is that my life is protected.","\"Now that you don’t need me anymore, I can only leave regretfully. General, there’s no need to persuade me anymore. In my eyes, your persuasion is just a soft knife that kills without blood. If I agree tonight, tomorrow, you’ll be pointing a gun at my head.\"","The car flew past. The lights swept across the pitch-black night in front of them as they rushed toward the Thailand border.","Ye Jian finally saw the car. She wiped the sweat and blood off her face and looked at the bottomless cliff below. She took a long and deep breath of the fresh mountain air.","If this jump went smoothly, she would be able to jump to the top of the speeding car. If there was a mistake, it would be equivalent to suicide. If she jumped directly into the depths of the cliff, there was a high chance that her body would be gone.","She would never allow anything to happen to her.","Ye Jian clenched her fists tightly. The first car flew past. Just as the second car flew past, Ye Jian jumped over the tree branch that extended to the cliff.","Bang!","The sound of something heavy falling sounded. The people in the car that was hit looked up and could clearly see the roof of the car sinking!"]},{"number":4745,"title":"Chapter 4745: Hurry, Hurry","paragraphs":["The dent in the roof made everyone in the car’s hair stand on end.","An ambush?","This was a mountain road that was hidden by rocks and cliffs. The mountain road was not wide, and it was only wide enough for one Jeep to pass through. Even an ordinary truck could not pass through.","On one side of the mountain road was a mountain, and on the other side was a cliff. The drivers were all experienced drivers who were familiar with the mountain roads. Moreover, their driving skills were quite good. They could drive steadily on the cliff mountain road that would destroy people if they were not careful.","Ye Jian jumped up from the tree, and the huge impact caused the driver’s hands to slide down, causing the car body to shake violently. The faces of the people in the car changed color, except for the driver. The other three people immediately took out their guns and shot at the roof of the car...","However, Ye Jian was faster than them.","Ye Jian didn’t know if there was anyone in the back row. The moment she jumped down from the car, she fired and swept over.","The people in the car at the front didn’t notice anything amiss with the car behind. The sound of the engine drowned out the chirping of the night insects in the mountain stream. The car at the front continued to drive steadily out of the village.","Lina was sitting in the middle car. Hence, when a bang suddenly sounded from the back, as if something heavy had fallen, she turned her head instinctively to look behind. Her beautiful eyes, which were filled with ruthlessness, instantly narrowed!","There was someone on the roof of the car at the back!","At the same time, the driver of the car behind spoke into the intercom. \"Someone’s following us. Speed up!\"","Gunshots were fired.","The driver held the steering wheel tightly. Sweat appeared on his forehead as he shouted, \"Quick, shoot...\" Before he could finish shouting, the gunshots rang out continuously, causing the hair on the driver’s back to stand on end in horror.","The sound of the gunshots wasn’t right.","They weren’t shooting out of the car. Instead, the gunshots were coming from inside!","The driver started to panic. His hands, which were holding the steering wheel tightly, were trembling slightly.","He needed to shake off the person on the roof of the car and confirm if anyone was following closely behind to buy time for Lina to escape.","\"How many people?\" Lina asked sharply.","\"We’ve only found one person so far!\" the driver replied immediately, his voice trembling slightly.","As soon as he finished speaking, he suddenly smelled the thick smell of blood in the car. The sweat on his forehead flowed past his eyebrows and into his eyelashes. The driver, who was holding the steering wheel tightly, gritted his teeth and started to do his best to drive the Jeep in a ’S’ line on the narrow road.","He tried to shake off the person still on the roof of the car.","One person...","Lina, who received a reply, didn’t know that the bodyguards in the car at the back had been killed. The driver’s reply made her feel slightly at ease.","The turbulence in her eyes gradually calmed down. Even the tense expression on her face slowly relaxed. She tightened her grip on her pistol and shouted coldly, \"Drive faster! Get rid of the car behind!\"","She didn’t plan to shoot at the car behind. Instead, she ordered the driver to speed up.","There was a driver in the back car and three of her trusted aides. Naturally, they could deal with the person on the roof and meet up with her. If they couldn’t, she’d only have a moment of regret.","Even if these people were her trusted aides, she couldn’t stay because of them.","She had earned so much money for every family. Now that she was in danger, it was time for the villagers to express their gratitude.","Every family in Lina’s village sold drugs for a living. The youths would be sent to General Minlai’s military unit to train for three years before coming back. If they were stronger, Lina would secretly send them to the black market for training for a year and a half before returning to the village.","It was not just the village she was in. It was the same for all the villages that were involved in drug trafficking!"]},{"number":4746,"title":"Chapter 4746: Unwilling","paragraphs":["The mountain villages in the depths of the mountains of the Golden Triangle overlapped. Green mountains rose and fell. The mountain villages that hid in the green mountains and rivers were isolated from the world. The scenery was beautiful, and there was no city noise. It was like a paradise.","However, when all evil was hidden in a paradise, its dangers and evils became even more unfathomable. No matter how beautiful the scenery was, it was still an evil place.","There were evil people in evil places, and Lina was one of them.","Lina, who thought that her trusted aides in the car at the back could handle it, instructed the driver to accelerate. She didn’t pay attention to the car at the back anymore. She didn’t know that the driver had reported to her, letting her know that it was only one person, before he got shot in the head. He was still holding the steering wheel tightly with both hands.","The vehicle went out of control, and with no one inside to gain control, all of them were shot at. They were killed by the continuous ’Z’ pattern of the bullets.","The two cars turned a huge corner and disappeared into the night in the blink of an eye. Although the car Ye Jian was in was fast, it slowed down a lot to cover Lina’s departure.","The car that was hit by bullets twisted and turned on the narrow mountain road. On the roof, Ye Jian grabbed the luggage pole tightly and kicked the driver’s window with her legs.","Why did she risk her life to jump off the car? It was to snatch it!","All the cars in the village were intentionally blown up by Lina. If she didn’t snatch a car, she wouldn’t be able to catch up to Lina.","As for the undercover agent with the surname Liu who was still in the village, he had taken advantage of the chaos to leave Wu Jinkun. Now that he could still hear the gunshots in the village, he believed that he could definitely take advantage of the chaos to leave.","Ye Jian couldn’t kick open the car window once. Her entire body was drenched in sweat. Even her hair was wet. Ye Jian gritted her teeth and kicked again.","The uncontrolled vehicle twisted in an ’S’ shape. A few times, it was about to rush into the cliff but was brought back to the bumpy mountain roads.","The car stopped rushing toward the cliff. Instead, it rushed toward the side of the mountain.","Ye Jian wasn’t given a third chance to kick the car window!","Ye Jian’s eyes were red. She was forced to abandon the car. The moment she let go, Ye Jian let out a low cry of unwillingness.","Without a car, she wouldn’t be able to catch up with Lina. If she couldn’t catch up with Lina... Lina would run to the ends of the earth!","No!","Even if Ye Jian had to run to the ends of the earth, she would definitely find her. Definitely!","Bang!","The front of the car hit the mountain hard. Due to the huge inertia, Ye Jian rolled twice before she could stabilize her body. She didn’t give herself any time to catch her breath. Her knees, elbows, arms, face... There were bloodstains all over her exposed skin. A ball of fire ignited in her eyes, and she ran over again.","She wanted to know if the car that hit the mountain could still be used.","In front, Lina, who was holding her pistol tightly, turned around and looked behind her. The mountain road was dark, and there was no light... The second car wasn’t behind them.","The bodyguard sitting in the back seat also turned around and looked back. He retracted his gaze and said in a low voice, \"With Kangwu driving, nothing will happen. Since he’s not following us, the general’s men might have caught up.\"","Lina clenched her fists tightly and said sternly, \"Faster!\"","General, general!","She wasn’t afraid of Wu Jinkun. She wasn’t afraid of all the drug lords in the Golden Triangle. She was only afraid of General Minlai... He was someone who could suppress the Burmese government until they didn’t dare to make a move. She was afraid of him!","She was afraid from the bottom of her heart!","\"Faster!\" Lina, whose fingertips were still trembling slightly, lowered her voice again and said calmly, \"Someone will receive us after we leave the village. We’ll take a boat to Thailand and then turn around. We’ll go from Malaysia to Molaban.","\"Trust me, if we manage to get out of the village, I’ll definitely bring you to Molaban too.\""]},{"number":4747,"title":"Chapter 4747: Nightmare","paragraphs":["Lina tried her best to control her emotions so that the people around her wouldn’t notice that she was afraid. Once the people around her knew that she was afraid, it wouldn’t be beneficial for her to lose her composure!","Her calmness helped. The people who followed her out were all bandits from the same village. They were all very capable. Now that Lina said that they would go to Molaban to fight again, these bandits, whose hands were stained with blood, nodded slightly to show that they trusted her.","They really believed in Lina. If they didn’t, they wouldn’t have abandoned the village.","As for the other villagers in the village, they saw that Lina had made thorough arrangements. They didn’t have to worry too much, but there would definitely be casualties!","However, it didn’t matter. Those with guns would do their best to escape. Those without guns... Ha, those weren’t people from their village. They were illegal workers.","Light flashed past the mountain stream. Before they could take a closer look, it suddenly disappeared. Lina looked at the car window and told them that Kangwu was catching up.","She got someone to destroy all the cars in the village, including the motorcycles. Hence, besides Kangwu, Lina didn’t think it could be anyone else.","At least 5,000 kilometers away from the core area of the Golden Triangle, in a restricted military area in China, Xia Jinyuan, who had been busy training for the entire day, placed his feet on his desk. His tall and slender body leaned against the big chair. He was in a light sleep when he suddenly felt a sharp pain in his chest, instantly waking him up from a deep sleep.","\"Little fox!\"","Opening his eyes, Xia Jinyuan clutched his chest in pain.","G3, who had turned on the lights, came in. He didn’t expect Xia Jinyuan to be sleeping in the office. He wanted to apologize, but when he saw Xia Jinyuan pressing his chest, he rushed over with an ugly expression. \"Why do you look so bad? What happened to your chest?\"","Xia Jinyuan, who was pressing on his heart, waited for the sudden pain to subside. He waved his hand and said in a low voice, \"It’s nothing. I...\"","He had a nightmare. He dreamed that... his little fox was covered in blood as she walked in front of him. She walked very quickly as if she wanted to chase something. The more he shouted, the faster she walked. In the end, she actually started running. And the ground... was covered in bloody footprints.","Although he didn’t finish his sentence, G3 knew what he meant.","Seeing that he wasn’t hurt, G3’s expression gradually improved. He picked up the steel cup on the desk and poured a cup of warm water for Xia Jinyuan. \"What you think in the day, you dream at night.\"","He handed him the cup of warm water. \"Have some water to calm yourself down.\"","Xia Jinyuan took the cup of water and drank half of it in one gulp. \"I’ll go to Xiang City tomorrow. Keep an eye on the training in the team.\"","After drinking half a cup of warm water, Xia Jinyuan gradually calmed down. \"The last time two people went out on a mission and were shot, the boss was furious. The boss will personally come over in August to inspect. Don’t let the boss find an opportunity to chase people away.\"","G3 laughed. \"You’re the one who said that you wanted to chase people away. Now, you’re afraid that the boss will chase them away. What’s wrong? Are you really afraid that the boss will chase them away?\"","Xia Jinyuan, who was leaning against the back of the chair, pursed his lips and snorted with a faint smile. \"I’ve been bringing them around for two to three years. If they’re chased away, won’t I suffer a huge loss?","\"If I really wanted to chase them away, I would have done it in the first year! Those who can stay are not cowards. Why would I chase them away? I’ve just been scaring them.\"","\"You’re really narrow-minded. They just said something about your girlfriend possibly wanting to break things off with you behind your back. Why are you keeping it in your heart? You haven’t spoken to Azure Bird for a year and a half. You guys didn’t even exchange a single letter. Do you blame them for being nosy?\""]},{"number":4748,"title":"Chapter 4748: Shot","paragraphs":["G3 half-sat in front of the desk and held a fountain pen in his hand. He glanced at Xia Jinyuan, whose facial expression had darkened a little when Ye Jian’s name was mentioned. He couldn’t help but frown. \"Did you get any news from the boss today? She’s been gone for four to five months. If she doesn’t come back soon, will she be able to make it for her graduation ceremony?\"","\"You’ll leave tomorrow and arrive in Xiang City the day after tomorrow. Ye Jian’s graduation ceremony is in a day. There’s no news about her for now. Aren’t you planning to... go and attend Ye Jian’s graduation ceremony? Boss still didn’t reveal anything to you?\"","At the mention of Ye Jian, whom he had not heard from for four to five months, Xia Jinyuan recalled the nightmare he had just now. His eyes darkened.","\"He just said that there’s no problem and she’s very safe.\" Xia Jinyuan frowned and held the steel cup in his hand tightly. There was a hint of coldness in his mellow voice. \"Some time ago, he said that she could rush back to attend her graduation ceremony, so I applied for leave. When I asked again today, he said that my training is too tiring, so it’s good for me to take a break and go back to my alma mater to take a look. He told me to treat it as a vacation.","\"If Ye Jian is really safe as he said, my surname isn’t Xia. I’ll take his surname, Yang.\"","He placed the cup on the desk. He used so much strength that the water in the cup splashed out.","G3 looked at the trembling cup and pursed his lips. \"If something really happens to Ye Jian, we won’t know if the boss doesn’t tell us.","\"Let’s get Ye Jian to our team as soon as possible. When she’s in our team, everything will be fine!\"","Xia Jinyuan took a deep breath and nodded slowly. He stood up and put on his camouflage cap. \"I’ll wait for her in Xiang City. I’ll tell you if there’s any news. Let’s go and rest early.\"","G3 looked at his chest and secretly restrained his worry.","The two of them were lovers and comrades. Their chemistry was far better than anyone else. If something really happened to one of them, the other party would suddenly sense it... G3, who had turned off the lights, secretly slapped his cheek to prevent himself from thinking too deeply.","Nothing would happen to Ye Jian! Who was Little Ye? Even the male soldiers in the team had to admit defeat to her. Nothing would happen to her!","Every step was huge, and every step felt especially heavy. Xia Jinyuan pressed his chest where his heart was. His black eyes were cold. His little fox... wasn’t safe!","He was very sure!","However, he couldn’t rush to her side. He didn’t even know where she was. He didn’t even have the right to be angry.","A soldier’s duty was to obey orders!","It was the duty of soldiers to obey orders!","It was the duty of soldiers to obey orders!","Xia Jinyuan kept muttering the same thing in his heart. As he went downstairs, he staggered and held the wall with one hand to stabilize himself.","G3 watched silently from behind. The worry in his eyes deepened.","’Ye Jian! Azure Bird! You haven’t joined the Xueyu unit. Nothing must happen to you. You must protect yourself!","’Your lover and comrades waiting for you to come back. We’re all waiting for you in the team!’","In the distance, Ye Jian, who was in another country, grabbed the steering wheel tightly and slammed into the car in front of her again even though she had been shot in the shoulder.","The smell of blood was so strong that she was no longer sensitive to it. It seemed that even the wind that blew in from outside was filled with the smell of blood.","Every time Ye Jian turned the steering wheel, blood would flow out of her wound. The excruciating pain made Ye Jian, who was already pale, break out in a cold sweat.","Bang... Bang...","The bullets shot out from the car in front again. Ye Jian was forced to tense up. She couldn’t observe the road at all. The bullet in her shoulder came from the car in front that didn’t even have a windshield."]},{"number":4749,"title":"Chapter 4749: Angry","paragraphs":["The car in front that was hit by Ye Jian’s car was not doing much better than the car Ye Jian was driving. Moreover, the first thing Ye Jian did when she caught up with the car in front was to shoot the wheels, allowing her to catch up immediately.","The moment the windshield at the front and back of the car shattered, Ye Jian knew that Lina wasn’t in the car.","Half an hour ago, Lina realized that there were headlights coming out of the mountain stream opposite her. At first, she didn’t think too much about it and thought that her trusted aides had successfully escaped and caught up with her. However, when she saw the headlights in front of her, Lina’s expression darkened. She ordered the car in front to stop while she hopped in.","The headlights of the car chasing after them were obviously much weaker. If Kangwu had successfully dealt with the other party, how could the headlights of his car be weak?","There was only one possibility—Kangwu’s escape was not smooth!","The cunning Lina had always been cautious. If not, she wouldn’t have surpassed her lover, Qin Maosheng, and become General Minlai’s subordinate. Just the headlights of the car made her vigilant and quickly change vehicles.","Before changing cars, she ordered her trusted aides to shoot immediately if they noticed anything amiss with the car Kangwu was driving. They mustn’t be soft-hearted.","Just like that, Lina, who was supposed to be in the second car, which was in the middle, was now in the car at the front. Lina was no longer in the car that Ye Jian hit.","Lina, who had changed to the first car, was so angry that her face was distorted. The trusted aides in the car behind told her that the person chasing after her was the ’ant’ that she could’ve easily trampled on in the past!","It was the Chinese girl who survived and whom she kept well and alive right under her nose!","\"Didn’t you and Mozhi check that there’s nothing wrong with her? She’s the one who’s attacking us now. Larner, how dare you tell me that there was nothing wrong with her?!\"","Lina was so angry that the veins on her neck were bulging. She glared at the driver. The driver was none other than Larner, who kidnapped Ye Jian and entered the core area of the Golden Triangle.","On the other hand, Mozhi used fluent Chinese to ’coax’ Ye Jian into the car.","Mozhi and Larna were Lina’s men. The group of drug dealers who used the temple as a cover and disguised themselves as monks were also Lina’s men. Even Wu Jinkun, who entered the temple to trade that night, didn’t know this. General Minlai didn’t know either.","Lina was able to give up the entire drug-making stockade because she had already arranged a path of retreat for herself. She didn’t place all her hopes on General Minlai.","Although her goal wasn’t to be one of the biggest drug dealers in the Golden Triangle, as long as she was given time, with her ruthlessness and intelligence, she would definitely become a big drug dealer in the future.","Now, this brave and scheming female drug dealer stared at the driver, Larner, with a ferocious look in her eyes. Her chest heaved up and down violently from anger. She gritted her teeth and said fiercely, \"Kill her! I want to cut off her head with my own hands!\"","The driver, Larner, drove steadily, unaffected by Lina’s anger. \"As long as she can catch up to us alive, I’ll kill her and let you cut off her head yourself.\"","\"Alright! I’ll give you a chance!\" Lina gritted her teeth until they were about to shatter. She leaned back in the back seat. She was so angry that her face turned ashen. She wouldn’t be able to recover for a while. \"Let the monks deal with Mozhi. He’ll become a huge problem for us if we leave him alive.\"","\"Yes.\"","The person who answered her was Lina’s bodyguard, who had always been loyal to her."]},{"number":4750,"title":"Chapter 4750: Live Well","paragraphs":["As a core member who had always been transporting ’human goods’ to Lina, Mozhi rarely returned to the mountain stronghold to avoid being discovered. Now that the matter was exposed and Mozhi wasn’t around, killing him was the best choice. This was to prevent him from being found by the governments of China, Myanmar, Thailand, and Laos. They could pry out more information from him that was disadvantageous to Lina.","Especially General Minlai. If he found Mozhi, the temple would be exposed!","On the steep mountain road facing the cliff at the back, Ye Jian, who had a sharp gaze, faced the car that suddenly came and tried to hit her back. She held the steering wheel tightly with both hands and stepped on the accelerator gradually. As the sound of the engine got louder and louder, Ye Jian gritted her teeth. The car didn’t reverse but advanced instead. It rushed toward the vehicle that was ramming back at her like a cannonball.","Blood gushed out of the gunshot wound on her shoulder again. There was so much blood that it drenched her entire chest. Even the front of her pants was wet. Ye Jian was still secretly glad that this was a small-caliber bullet and not a penetrating wound.","It was a blessing in disguise!","The person in the car in front was still alive, but his right wrist was penetrated by bullets. The Burmese man, who was in so much pain that his face was pale, shouted at the driver, \"Damn it! Knock her back! Knock her back! Knock her off the cliff!","\"She killed Kangwu and the rest. Let’s avenge Kangwu! Kill her! Kill her!\"","The driver had a fierce look on his face too. This was a life-or-death battle. They would see who would be the first to die!","He was reversing while Ye Jian was moving forward. The undercover agent with the surname Liu rushed out of the mountain on his motorcycle and saw this scene. His eyes widened as he shouted, \"Ye Jian!\"","All the diesel in the mountains was poured out by Lina. Officer Liu, who secretly took care of Wu Jinkun, rushed to the drug factory and found a barrel of gasoline that was usually used for cleaning and dissolving.","This was a must-have in every drug factory. It was with this barrel of gasoline that Officer Liu was able to follow Ye Jian all the way out of the village on his motorcycle.","The female soldier wasn’t in the village, and Lina was escaping. If he were the female soldier, what choice would he make?","Of course, it was to attack Lina!","However, Officer Liu never expected that when he rushed out of the village, he would see the scene of ’mutual destruction’.","He accelerated and sped toward the two cars that were about to crash into each other.","Ye Jian heard the sound of the motorcycle behind her and the voice of the undercover agent from the Narcotics Brigade. She didn’t turn around. Instead, she stepped on the accelerator and rushed up resolutely.","\"Kill her! Kill her!\"","A brutal roar came from the car in front. It was so loud that Ye Jian seemed to be able to hear it vaguely.","Kill her?","Hah!","Sorry!","She didn’t want to die yet!","She still needed to bring Lina to justice... No, wait, she needed to kill Lina on the spot.","The two cars got closer and closer. Neither side had any intention of stopping. The ferocity of the driver in front was stimulated. His eyes were as red as blood. He gritted his teeth and stepped on the accelerator again.","Who would be sent flying? Who would be thrown down the cliff? They would see the results soon!","Five meters, four meters, three meters, two meters...","\"Ye Jian! Stop! Stop! Stop!\"","Officer Liu, who was in his early 30s, had experienced the sorrow of his comrades dying in front of him countless times. This time, he seemed to see something he didn’t want to see at all.","Ye Jian, who didn’t reply, heard the roars of the man from the car in front. Suddenly, she grabbed the steering wheel with both hands and hit the left side agilely...","She would go back alive!","She wanted to go back alive!"]},{"number":4751,"title":"Chapter 4751: Difficult","paragraphs":["\"Do you know how to get over a sidecar? Remember, first find a fulcrum so that both sides of the car lose balance, with one wheel higher than the other. Then, step on the accelerator, hold the steering wheel tightly, and let one wheel fly off the fulcrum while the other wheel supports the entire car.\"","In the basics of automobile soldier training, Xia Jinyuan had a cold and handsome face and spoke in a serious tone. He taught her step by step and explained carefully so that she could learn the trick as soon as possible and get used to it.","The man Ye Jian loved deeply was still waiting for her to go back. Hence, how could she let them kill her?","Her good times had just begun. Her journey had just begun. She had not found Uncle Chen’s murderer and had not contributed more to the military uniform. How could she be killed by her enemy?","Hence, this was definitely not the place where she would die!","She would be the one killing them!","One side of the car was rolling on the mountain while the other side was rolling on the ground. Ye Jian turned her head and glanced coldly at the car that was rushing over from the other side. Under the other party’s incredulous gaze, Ye Jian steadily turned the steering wheel outward.","\"No, no, no...\"","\"Ahhh...\"","Bang... Bang... Bang...","Two shocked voices came from the car that was forced to the cliff by Ye Jian.","They thought that they would definitely be able to deal with the Chinese girl who was attacking them. They were very confident.","As for the result?","Their car crashed off the cliff. The entire car toppled over, making the world spin. It was too late to do anything.","Behind, Officer Liu, who suddenly braked, narrowed his eyes and looked at the scene less than three meters away from him. The mountain wind blew, and his back was drenched in cold sweat.","She... actually... succeeded!","She actually squeezed the other car until it fell off the cliff!","No wonder Captain Deng told him that the female soldier would make her own arrangements and he didn’t have to interfere.","No wonder Captain Deng told him that since Wu Jinkun was dead, he could leave everything to the female soldier. He also reminded him to trust the female soldier and not underestimate her just because of her gender and age.","Now, he understood!","The car fell into a bottomless cliff. The trees and bushes growing on the cliff broke with a large number of cracking sounds. The sound of metal hitting rocks shook the ground until it trembled. It lasted for a long time.","Ye Jian pushed open the car door, and a pair of strong hands held her staggering body tightly. She looked up and saw who it was. Ye Jian smiled.","Officer Liu held her arms tightly. He wanted to ask if she was okay, but Ye Jian quickly retracted her arms. The girl who was standing in front of him just now had already moved behind him.","\"Lina is in front. We can’t let her escape from the Golden Triangle.\" Ye Jian held a headscarf in her hand as she stood firm. After she finished speaking, she sat on the back seat of the motorcycle. \"You came at the right time. After killing her, we can return to the country together.\"","Ye Jian sat down quickly because she didn’t want the other party to see the gun wound on her shoulder.","She didn’t have time to deal with it. She needed to hurry up and catch up with Lina.","Once Lina escaped from the Golden Triangle, she might abandon her car and escape into the vast forest. Finding Lina then would be like looking for a needle in a haystack.","Officer Liu looked at the blood on his palm. His lips trembled slightly. He hadn’t recovered from the shock just now and wanted to say something. However, the female soldier sitting behind him said calmly, \"It’s not my blood. It’s the blood of the people in the car.\""]},{"number":4752,"title":"Chapter 4752: Pursuit","paragraphs":["Ye Jian, who was sitting steadily at the back of the motorcycle, didn’t even look at her wound. She said in a calm voice, \"We can’t give Lina a chance to escape. There’s a certain distance between us and her now. We can’t delay any longer. Hurry!\"","She didn’t want to give Officer Liu a chance to look at her again.","If he looked at her again... she might expose herself!","Officer Liu closed his eyes lightly and said in a low voice, \"Sit tight!\"","\"Liu Cheng, Lina is the second most important target of the Yun Province police. If possible, you must kill her while protecting yourself!\"","This was the short two-minute conversation he had with Captain Deng before he chased after Ye Jian on his motorcycle. In those two minutes, he told Captain Deng that he had secretly taken care of Wu Jinkun and that the whereabouts of the female soldier, Ye Jian, were unknown. It was very likely that she was chasing after Lina.","Captain Deng told him to believe in the female soldier’s ability and cooperate with her to kill the second most important target.","Now was the time to kill the second most important target.","\"I’ve already contacted Captain Deng. After dealing with Lina, we’ll immediately go to the border of Yun Province. With the helicopter patrol, we’ll be able to return to the country immediately.\"","\"Lina needs to be taken care of. Captain Deng reminded us that we must take care of ourselves and not force ourselves. If Captain Deng was here just now, he would’ve criticized you.\"","Officer Liu’s deep voice was distorted by the wind. Ye Jian, who was secretly bandaging her shoulder with the headscarf to stop the bleeding, smiled and said, \"I only did that because I was confident. These are all subjects that I trained for in the past. It looks dangerous, but it’s not very dangerous for us.","\"We’ve all done more dangerous actions. Driving on one side is simple.\"","Her relaxed reply caused a faint smile to appear on the corner of Officer Liu’s lips. \"You’re a special forces soldier. There are very few female special forces soldiers, especially an outstanding special forces soldier like you. You’re like a rare treasure. Hence, nothing must happen to you. Captain Deng has ordered me to bring you back to the country safely.\"","\"Captain Deng, don’t worry. I want to return to the country safely too. After dealing with Lina, we’ll return to the country immediately. We won’t delay.\"","\"No problem.\"","\"Alright!\"","They were from different systems, they were on a mission together, so the narcotics police officer and the special forces soldier agreed to return to the country together.","Officer Liu accelerated and chased after Lina. They did not doubt whether they could catch up or not. They only had one goal—they had to kill Lina!","Less than ten kilometers away from the motorcycle, a Jeep drove steadily and quickly out of the vast mountain along the narrow mountain road.","All the movements behind them were far away from them. They didn’t know what was happening behind them, nor did they know that someone was chasing after them.","The mountain roads in the hidden forest kept winding, leading to the place of hope.","Ten minutes later, the driver, Larner, looked at the mountain stream opposite him. There was a hint of coldness in his eyes.","\"There are lights flashing over there,\" he said in a low voice, waking up Lina, who was resting with her eyes closed.","Opening her eyes, Lina asked quickly, \"What lights? Car lights?\"","\"They don’t look like headlights,\" Larner replied. \"It’s a single beam that’s slightly brighter than individual headlights. It might be from a motorcycle.\"","\"That’s impossible! All the gasoline has been poured out. It’s impossible for there to be a motorcycle here.\" The Burmese man sitting in the passenger seat pressed the edge of the car window with one hand and leaned his head out of the car window for a while. He gritted his teeth and replied, \"Are you mistaken?\""]},{"number":4753,"title":"Chapter 4753: Pursuit","paragraphs":["Lina didn’t think that it was a motorcycle chasing after them.","The cars in the village, including the three cars that Wu Jinkun drove over, were all destroyed. And all the gasoline had been dumped. How could there be a motorcycle here?","\"Oil barrels in the factory.\"","After saying that coldly, Larner stepped on the accelerator slightly and sped up again. The expressions of the other people in the car, including Lina, changed.","Lina looked up at the trusted aide sitting in front of her. From the other party’s expression, Lina knew that Larner was right.","The oil barrels in the factory... Her people forgot to dispose of them!","Lina took a deep breath and said calmly, \"The people chasing us should be Wu Jinkun’s men. Only they know that there would be oil barrels in the factory. We can’t rule out the possibility that they’ve escaped.\"","Lina looked at the mountain stream from the corner of her eyes and said, \"If we go further, we can enter the mountain directly. Larner will accompany me. The three of you stay behind to see who’ll come over.","Her eyes were dark and cold. \"No matter who it is, kill them all! If it’s that Chinese girl who’s chasing after us, keep her alive and bring her over.","\"You know the place. After you finish dealing with the people following us, come over and meet up.\"","Lina planned to abandon the car and enter the mountain.","It was not safe to drive at a time like this. It was easier to escape by running into the mountains.","It was not a problem to hide a few people in the vast mountains. Moreover, this was her territory. These mountains... Whether it was Wu Jinkun’s men or the people sent by General Minlai, no one was more familiar with this territory than her!","Larner nodded, indicating that he had no objections.","The other three people in the car nodded. They were familiar with this place too.","As for the Chinese girl... They would only know if she was alive when they saw her.","Lina closed her eyes to hide the trembling.","She had to calm down! Even if the person chasing her was... the general’s capable assassin, she would definitely be able to escape successfully!","Lina didn’t take Wu Jinkun’s people seriously. She didn’t even take Ye Jian seriously. Only General Minlai’s people scared Lina the most.","It was normal to be afraid of someone who once controlled her life.","The motorcycle was very fast. The narrow mountain road was relatively narrow for cars, but it was very spacious for motorcycles. The undercover officer, Liu Ning, stared ahead coldly and drove the motorcycle steadily into the darkness.","After turning a huge corner, Ye Jian, who was watching the commotion in front, suddenly tightened her grip. \"The target vehicle has stopped.\"","\"Remember the approximate location,\" Liu Ning said in a deep voice. At a time like this, their minds needed to be clearer. They couldn’t make any mistakes. \"There are three situations. First, Lina will get out of the car and enter the mountains. Second, someone will get out of the car halfway and lay an ambush. Third, Lina will get out of the car and the car will continue moving forward...\"","Ye Jian saw the car disappearing among the trees again. She smiled slightly. \"I choose the third possibility. The target gets out of the car and enters the mountains, and the car will continue moving forward.\"","Liu Ning asked, \"Are you sure?\"","Ye Jian nodded. \"I’m sure.\" After all, she had been with Lina for a few months. If she didn’t even know Lina’s personality by now, she would be too useless.","The disappearing lights suddenly returned, but they were not headlights. It was the car’s back lights.","The two of them saw it clearly, and their expressions darkened.","It was the fourth possibility. Lina escaped into the mountains, and the car was blocking their way. She wasn’t trying to lure the enemy away."]},{"number":4754,"title":"Chapter 4754: Not Letting Go","paragraphs":["\"Target Two is very cautious.\" Liu Ning, whose back was slightly hunched, said in a low voice. The strong wind blew his voice into Ye Jian’s ears.","\"Since we’re turning back, why don’t we...\" In the wind, Ye Jian’s cold voice floated into the ears of Liu Ning, the undercover police officer who had been by Wu Jinkun’s side for three years. When her cold voice disappeared, Liu Ning smiled faintly.","\"Okay.\"","He replied to Ye Jian with one word, indicating that he trusted Ye Jian completely and would cooperate with all the arrangements.","As the motorcycle accelerated again, the Jeep had to stop before it reached the most suitable place.","If they didn’t stop, they would meet the people chasing them before they could prepare!","\"Get off!\"","The driver stopped the car and quickly pushed open the door.","The other two people in the Jeep got out. The driver, who got out quickly, had already opened the trunk. He took three items with one hand. The next second, the three of them were holding guns.","They were very fast. The Jeep that was hiding at the corner opened its four doors. The three of them hid behind the opened doors and looked ahead coldly. They were waiting for the motorcycle to come over. No matter who it was, they would shoot immediately.","Three minutes later, the sound of a motorcycle engine came closer. The lights suddenly disappeared. The three people hiding behind the door were stunned.","What was going on?","No one dared to easily cross the line between the two sides. They could only guess what the other party would do. At the same time, they were vigilant of their surroundings to prevent sneak attacks.","The motorcycle lights that lit up the mountain road were extinguished, and the sound of the engine sounded on the spot. The three of them tightened their grip on their guns and gritted their teeth.","The Burmese man, who was hiding behind the car door, said in a low voice, \"How many people will there be?\"","\"I’m not sure. Did they suddenly stop because they noticed us?\" The Burmese man, who was hiding behind the car door on the left, said viciously, \"Damn it, will they turn around?\"","They deliberately turned around and turned off the engine to guard the place. They wanted to deal with the other party immediately.","Now, the motorcycle wasn’t moving and even the engine was turned off. Damn it! The other party might have discovered them!","\"Let’s wait first. If needed, we’ll give chase!\" The Burmese man hiding behind the driver’s door said coldly. Although his voice was hoarse, his ruthlessness was incomparable to the other two.","Besides the driver, he was Lina’s most trusted and capable confidant. He would always deal with some people outside.","Lina asked him to stay because she was afraid that the people chasing after her were the people around General Minlai.","His expression was bloodthirsty and fierce. He was like a wild beast pouncing on its food. Even his breath was filled with bloodlust.","The sound of the motorcycle engine suddenly became louder. It rushed forward. The man smiled coldly. \"One, two, three... Shoot!\"","Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!","The bullets from the guns rained down on the motorcycles that didn’t slow down at all. Their fingers tightened around the trigger, and they didn’t stop even when the muzzles were hot and smoking.","Such a dense barrage of shots could directly break a person’s limbs and kill them on the spot.","However, the motorcycle didn’t slow down. It maintained its speed and crashed into the Jeep. At the same time, bullets fired at the Jeep.","On the mountain, Ye Jian passed through the dense forest. Even when the tough branches hit her wound that she had painstakingly bandaged, she didn’t stop. It was so painful that the tissues around the wound trembled. She carried the rifle that Liu Ning gave her and climbed up a tree with agility.","She quickly placed the rifle on her shoulder in her hand. She placed the barrel on a branch and moved it along with the high-speed driving of the motorcycle."]},{"number":4755,"title":"Chapter 4755: Flesh And Blood","paragraphs":["The motorcycle, which was being fired at by dense bullets, remained in the same spot and continued to rush over.","\"Damn it! Move! Move! Retreat!\"","The Burmese man who was filled with bloodlust finally noticed something amiss and shouted loudly.","There was no one on the motorcycle! They had done something to the motorcycle! Even if they finished firing their bullets, the motorcycle wouldn’t stop!","There was only one motorcycle with its tail lights lit up. No one was riding it. The motorcycle couldn’t turn on its own. When it rushed out of the corner, it would fall down the cliff.","Bang!","A bullet was fired from the rifle in Ye Jian’s hand. It cut through the air and headed toward the motorcycle fuel tank.","Bang!","Another bullet rushed out of the barrel and followed the first bullet.","The first bullet hit the motorcycle’s fuel tank. The second bullet, which was less than 0.01 seconds slower, also hit the fuel tank.","Boom!","The fuel tank exploded. The second bullet passed through the fuel tank, and sparks flew. The sparks ignited the engine oil in the tank, and an explosion sounded. The flames instantly exploded into a cloud of light, illuminating the surroundings.","Target found!","The gun barrel on the branch moved. Ye Jian aimed at her target with a sharp gaze.","Bang!","The third bullet rushed out of the barrel and went straight for the target.","It hit the target on the back of the head.","The bullet pierced through the hard skull and shattered it, causing brain matter to explode. Then, bloody broken bones sputtered out from the middle of the person’s eyebrows.","The person who was shot fell to the ground before they could even ask for help. His head was blown up, and he died on the spot. Blood slowly flowed out and wet the small rocks on the mountain path.","\"Gong! Gong!\"","Another Burmese man who rushed into the glaring fire cloud realized that his companion had been shot. He shouted at the top of his lungs, \"There’s someone on the mountain! There’s someone on the mountain!\"","He raised the gun in his hand and fired blindly up the mountain.","Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!","The bullets were so dense that they broke countless branches. He swept crazily, not caring if the bullets he fired hit their targets.","Ye Jian wasn’t in the direction he was shooting at. The other party’s crazy actions gave her a chance.","The motorcycle, which had its fuel tank detonated, had already fallen off the cliff. The glaring fire had gradually disappeared, leaving only the flickering light below the cliff.","The leaves in the forest ignited by the fire cloud crackled as they burned. The smell of burning trees mixed with fuel and gunpowder floated away with the mountain wind.","The bloodthirsty Burmese man was the fastest to hide. He stuck close to the mountain and looked up at the densely-leaved mountain. The bullets were being fired so quickly that he didn’t notice where the person hiding on the mountain was.","There were at least two people!","There was one person on the mountain and one person in front!","It shouldn’t be the Chinese girl that Lina wanted to kill. It was very likely that it was an assassin sent by the general. Only the general had such capable people!","Then, he saw his companion standing in the middle of the mountain path and firing crazily. In front of him, there was no movement on the mountain. The bloodthirsty Burmese man shouted in a low voice, \"Yaye, Come over! Come over quickly!\"","\"They killed Gong, they killed Gong! I want to kill them! I want to kill them!\" The man called Yaye started to retreat, but he didn’t stop shooting.","No matter how many bullets there were, they couldn’t withstand his crazy shooting. He retreated because it was time to change the magazine.","Hiding at an angle, Ye Jian moved the muzzle of the gun as the other party moved. When the muzzle was slightly deviated from the right side of the target’s heart, she pulled the trigger with her hands that were stained with either her blood or other people’s blood."]},{"number":4756,"title":"Chapter 4756: Crazy","paragraphs":["Bang!","The sound of bullets rang out. A dull and monotonous sound rushed out of the throat of the Burmese man who had been shot in the chest. The shooting stopped, and he fell forward.","In the light of the flames, the Burmese man, who was hiding close to the mountain, saw with his own eyes that his companion had been shot. He fell in front of him. His bulging eyes shone fiercely as he picked up the submachine gun and fired in a diagonal direction.","He knew where the person who shot him was hiding!","It was at a diagonal angle!","Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!","The bullets fired crazily again. Liu Ning listened to the gunshots that were shooting toward the top of the mountain. He hunched his back and rushed to the front of the Jeep.","Without any hesitation, he opened fire.","Ye Jian, who jumped down the tree, was scratched by the stray bullets again. The bullet grazed the outside of her thigh, leaving a bloody mark on her leg.","\"F*ck!\"","Ye Jian, who was lying in the bushes, cursed. Solo combat... was really difficult. If she was careless, she would lose her life!","Now, it was up to her partner!","Ye Jian couldn’t get up at all. She even bit down on the bushes. It hurt. Every wound hurt. She bit down on something to divert her attention.","Shards of rock fell from the sky after being exploded by bullets. Some of them hit the back of Ye Jian’s head. It didn’t feel good to have sharp shards raining down from the sky. Ye Jian endured the pain and slowly crawled forward while Liu Ning was shooting.","She didn’t retreat. Instead, she advanced.","If Liu Ning couldn’t hit the opponent, she would sandwich the opponent from the front. The two of them would definitely be able to win this way.","She just didn’t know... how far Lina had run.","As for whether they could find Lina, they weren’t worried. There would be traces left behind by her in the mountains. As long as there were traces, they would be able to find Lina.","No matter where Lina ran to, Ye Jian would find her!","Ye Jian twisted her body and moved. She even held her breath. Multiple bullets were fired. The bullets hit the hard rocks that were covered with green moss, and sparks flew. Ye Jian, whose head was nearly buried, took a deep breath of the smell of mud and rotten leaves. She temporarily stopped crawling.","In front of the Jeep, Liu Ning opened fire again.","He had limited ammunition and couldn’t shoot crazily like his opponent.","Ye Jian crawled again. She grabbed the bushes with both hands and pulled her body forward forcefully. The gunshot wound on her shoulder was pulled. The stuck bullet seemed to have moved lower. It was so painful that Ye Jian’s abdomen was tense and her face was as pale as paper.","There were no vital points in the wound, but it would be dangerous if she lost too much blood.","But she couldn’t stop!","When the other party needed to change his magazine, Ye Jian heard a low curse from below. Her black eyes lit up as she jumped up. She grabbed the bushes with both hands and passed through the gaps between the trees to land on the mountain path.","A cold voice floated into Liu Ning’s ears. \"He hasn’t replenished his magazine! Hurry!\"","The expressions of the two people on the mountain road changed.","Liu Ning was elated while the Burmese man had a cold expression on his face.","A woman’s voice!","It was the woman from China!","She wasn’t dead!","Liu Ning’s expression turned cold. The other party couldn’t replenish his magazine. Similarly, he... had no bullets in his gun!","Damn it!","He would just fight!","Liu Ning threw away the gun and rushed out. With a vicious look in his eyes, he went up bare-handed.","The Burmese man, who had lost his magazine, quickly reacted. With a fierce facial expression, he raised his fist and punched the black shadow that was pouncing on him."]},{"number":4757,"title":"Chapter 4757: Fierce Battle","paragraphs":["A submachine gun without a magazine was a piece of scrap metal. The Burmese man didn’t even bother to use a piece of scrap metal to defend himself. He clenched his right hand into a fist and pulled his left hand back. He held a dagger with a sharp blade in his left hand and stabbed it at Liu Ning.","Liu Ning knew a thing or two about the brutal thugs around drug dealers. He was a thug around drug dealers too. Daggers were cold weapons that they wouldn’t leave behind. If the other party had them, he had them too.","The difference was that the other party wasn’t injured and his movements weren’t affected. On the other hand, he had been shot in the arm, so his movements were definitely affected. His movements couldn’t help but stagnate.","Clash!","When the two of them met in the first round, their daggers clashed. At the same time, they realized that they were both holding a dagger. Liu Ning bent down and barely avoided the dagger in the other party’s left hand. However, he didn’t manage to avoid the other party’s fist.","The opponent’s fist smashed into his shoulder. The strength was so great that it was like a huge rock that fell from the sky. Liu Ning’s entire right arm trembled from his shoulder. The blood on his right arm that was shot flowed down his arm.","Left-handed!","The other party was left-handed.","\"Who are you?!\" the Burmese man asked coldly. He maintained the posture of stabbing forward with his dagger and slowly touched his waist that was slashed.","Liu Ning bent over to avoid the other party’s dagger and slashed his waist in a strange posture. He held the dagger that was stained with blood. Liu Ning glanced at the other party’s pants pocket that had a blue flash. He said coldly in the local dialect of Myanmar, \"You used Brother Kun’s money to honor Brother Kun’s enemies and even killed Brother Kun’s men. Who do you think I am?\"","Wu Jinkun’s men!","The Burmese man’s lips twitched coldly. \"So, you’re someone close to Brother Kun. Brother Kun is so capable. He even sent the people around him to Lina’s side. No wonder Brother Kun brought people up the mountain this time. It turns out that there’s a spy among us!\"","\"Wrong. She has been Brother Kun’s subordinate from the start. How could she be a spy?\"","As Liu Ning spoke, he took the initiative to attack. The other party’s constant questioning was obviously to stall for time for Lina. Lina must have heard everything on the cell phone. He had already cooperated to the best of his ability, so he should be able to resolve this problem!","Both of them had daggers in their hands. At the same time, they thought of ways to send the sharp weapons in each other’s hands flying. Under the cover of the night, their fists and daggers stabbed at each other’s vital points.","It was a life-or-death battle. Every move was vicious.","In the mountains, Lina held her phone tightly. Her eyes were bloodshot. Wu Jinkun’s men!","The Chinese girl who had been with her for a few months was someone close to Wu Jinkun!","\"No wonder she could learn the Burmese dialect in less than three months. As it turns out, she knew how to speak from the start! No wonder she could always do things well without getting beaten up. As it turns out, she had already undergone special training!\"","Lina, who was holding her cell phone tightly, gritted her teeth. Her gloomy voice was squeezed out from her lips. \"No wonder Wu Jinkun started to make cheap shots after coming back from Laos. As it turned out, he already knew that I was the general’s subordinate...\"","The driver, Larner, didn’t expect this either. However, when he thought about it, he didn’t find it strange.","After saying a few low and ruthless words, a cold smile appeared on Lina’s face. \"Since she’s Brother Kun’s subordinate, there’s nothing to be afraid of.\"","\"Yes, the people around the general are a little afraid of Unwin’s ability. Wu Jinkun’s men are overestimating themselves if they think they can face Unwin.\" The driver, Larner, bent over slightly. His cold voice was like a venomous snake sliding through rough bark. It was hair-raising."]},{"number":4758,"title":"Chapter 4758: No Way Out","paragraphs":["Larner was right. As long as General Minlai’s men weren’t the ones chasing after Line... She tore off a leaf and rubbed it in her palm. She hung up the cell phone and walked deeper into the mountain.","She was waiting for Unwin to come and meet her.","The fight on the mountain path continued. The daggers in their hands were sent flying. The two of them fought like two wild beasts. Fists met fists, and kicks met kicks. Every attack was a fatal one.","More and more blood flowed out of the gun wound on Liu Ning’s arm. The smell of blood mixed with sweat wafted into Unwin’s nose. He revealed a ferocious smile.","Clash!","Liu Ning’s fist was about to hit Unwin’s chest. Then, his arm was restrained by Unwin. A cold and sinister voice sounded in the night wind. \"You were shot here, right?\"","\"Ah!\"","The bullet wound was pressed tightly by Unwin’s rough thumb. His thumb dug into the wound that was rolling with blood and flesh. Even though Liiu Ning was an unyielding man, he was so miserable that he screamed!","It hurt!","It hurt!","The pain was heart-wrenching and painful!","Hearing Liu Ning’s scream, Unwin laughed coldly. \"Does it hurt? Does it hurt?\" His thumb moved as he dug into the wound. He dug even harder into the flesh. In the darkness, his gaze was ferocious like that of a beast.","Liu Ning, who was screaming, only allowed himself to lose his composure only once. He then raised his leg and kicked Unwin’s abdomen fiercely. \"It hurts. But I’ll kill you too!\"","As he kicked out, he grabbed Unwin’s left hand that was holding onto the gun wound on his arm and twisted it forcefully. A roar came from his throat as he clamped Unwin’s left hand. As he kicked out, Unwin fell back.","The sound of dislocation was crisp. The joint of Unwin’s left elbow was dislocated by Liu Ning.","Unwin took a few deep breaths. It was painful, but to Unwin, who was like a beast, he could still laugh softly. Even though his arm was still being gripped by Liu Ning, he buckled his knees and kicked Liu Ning’s abdomen with his bent knee.","Liu Ning let go. His entire right arm was trembling in pain. The strength in his body seemed to be gradually disappearing along with the blood that was flowing out of the wound.","Unwin took a step back and panted. After moving his shoulder, he easily reset his dislocated elbow and spat out a mouthful of blood. He mocked coldly, \"The people around Brother Kun are all useless, huh? Is dislocation considered an injury? You want to kill me? Can you kill me?\"","He swung his left arm slightly and moved freely. The muscles on his arm bulged inch by inch. His strong muscles and bones made people feel afraid.","Liu Ning couldn’t see how strong his muscles were at night, but he could feel how strong Unwin was.","Liu Ning’s right arm was twitching. He panted heavily. His abdomen hurt so much that he couldn’t even stand up straight. His ears were buzzing. He was aware of who his opponent was.","Unwin.","He was one of the professional assassins around Lina. He was the one who handled all the bloodshed outside. Four years ago, there was a temple tragedy in the Golden Triangle, and he was the perpetrator.","Liu Ning didn’t have much confidence in facing Unwin.","These professional assassins had all undergone perverted training. They no longer felt pain. Even if they were shot, they wouldn’t feel any pain. Dislocation was nothing to them.","Liu Ning slowly stood up. He had no way out. He had to deal with this person!","’Ye Jian, I’ll leave Lina to you!’"]},{"number":4759,"title":"Chapter 4759: Die Together","paragraphs":["It seemed that it wasn’t just Unwin who couldn’t feel pain; it was the same for Ye Jian. Ye Jian, who had also undergone extreme training, pulled an old vine down from the mountain and heard Liu Ning scream.","Ye Jian tightened her grip on the vine and landed. She bent her legs and adjusted her breathing slightly as she ran toward him.","According to the plan, if there was only one target left, Liu Ning would take care of it. She would chase after Lina immediately. However... Liu Ning was no match for Unwin. She had to turn back.","Unwin attacked again. He was in a hurry.","Liu Ning wanted to kill him, and he wanted to kill Liu Ning too.","The ’snitch’ who had stayed by Lina’s side for four to five months had not shown any signs of movement. She must have gone to chase after Lina!","She could lurk around Lina for four to five months and pretend to be under their watch the entire time without anyone suspecting her. Unwin subconsciously treated Ye Jian as a strong opponent that was difficult to deal with.","Liu Ning used one arm to block Unwin’s leg. The fist that was aimed at his face made him hurriedly turn his head to avoid it. Even so, half of his cheek was still hit by Unwin’s fist.","Even though it brushed past him, Liu Ning felt that half of his face had been cut by a knife. The bone in his face hurt so much that it affected his eye nerves. He had to close his eyes, and his speed of resistance was temporarily sluggish.","He heard Unwin sneer. With a bang, Liu Ning’s chin was hit by the iron fist. His face was distorted from the pain. His head was buzzing from the punch. Half of his teeth were knocked out by the punch.","Liu Ning, whose eyes were bloodshot, knew that he had no chance of winning. He raised his knee and kicked Unwin again. Liu Ning roared and clashed with Unwin. He grabbed Unwin’s waist tightly and shoved him onto the mountain road...","On the other side of the mountain road was a cliff. If they fell, nobody would be able to retrieve their corpses!","Ang Wen noticed Liu Ning’s intention. After shouting twice and struggling to escape, he used his elbows to hit Liu Ning’s back again and again.","Liu Ning spat out a mouthful of blood on his legs. He gritted his teeth. He was unyielding and fearless. Even though his ribs were cracked, he didn’t let go. He hugged Unwin tightly and chose to die with him.","Even if he had to die, he would drag Unwin down with him!","He couldn’t let Unwin chase after the female soldier, Ye Jian!","Besides Unwin, there was also a mysterious professional killer who rarely appeared. Now that Lina was escaping, the other party had to be beside her. If Unwin joined them, even Ye Jian, who was from the special forces, would not be able to resist.","The worst-case scenario... he and Ye Jian would both die here!","He couldn’t allow the worst outcome to happen. At least one of them had to go back alive!","’Ye Jian, it’s up to you now!’","The cliff was right in front of them. Unwin, who had not yet broken free, attacked Liu Ning even more crazily. Ye Jian, who was running over, had already seen two black shadows fighting at the edge of the cliff. Unwin wouldn’t choose to court death. It was Liu Ning who chose to die with him!","Ye Jian ran over and pounced on Unwin, using her elbow to strangle his neck. Then, she threw him to the side forcefully. \"Leave it to me!\"","Unwin felt a strong wind blowing behind him. At that moment, due to his professional sensitivity, all the cells in his body tensed up. He knew he was facing a great enemy!"]},{"number":4760,"title":"Chapter 4760: It’s Good To Be Alive","paragraphs":["However, he couldn’t free himself at all. The moment his neck was strangled and he fell to the side, he heaved a sigh of relief.","He wouldn’t be dragged to death by that lunatic. The heavy stone in Unwin’s heart instantly fell.","Ye Jian, who was strangling his neck with one hand, didn’t let him relax for long. She stabbed the dagger in her left hand toward him like lightning...","It was already difficult for him to breathe when his neck was strangled. With Liu Ning hugging his waist, his hands instinctively resisted behind his back. Suddenly, a sharp pain came from his arm. Something sharp had stabbed his arm and was moving toward...","\"Ahh!\"","His pupils constricted as he struggled with all his might. He kicked Liu Ning, who was still hugging his waist tightly. He waved his bleeding arm and tried to hug Ye Jian, who was behind him.","His palm was quite big. Once he grabbed Ye Jian’s head or neck, her fragile throat would collapse.","Ye Jian didn’t give Unwin a chance to resist. Her gaze was sharp as she stabbed the dagger she snatched from the dungeon into Unwin’s temple.","Crack!","The hard skull didn’t stop the sharp tip of the dagger. The sharp tip of the dagger stabbed into the skull. Unwin’s eyes were bulging, and a gravelly noise came out of his throat. The moment Ye Jian lowered her head and pushed the knife in, Unwin grabbed Ye Jian’s hair with his struggling hands and launched the last attack.","He grabbed Ye Jian’s hair tightly. The skin on Ye Jian’s temples was so tight that it seemed like it was going to break.","\"Ha!\"","Ye Jian shouted in a low voice. She twisted the dagger that was stabbed into Unwin’s temple twice.","Unwin’s abdomen suddenly twitched. A breath rushed out of his throat from his muscular chest. His vicious bulging eyes gradually lost their luster as his chest stopped heaving. Only the viciousness on his face remained.","Liu Ning was still hugging Unwin’s waist tightly. He had become as stiff as a robot. Ye Jian used the bloodstained dagger to cut her black hair that was grabbed tightly by Unwin. She then used a lot of strength to pry Liu Ning’s hands away from Unwin’s waist.","Cough, cough, cough...","Liu Ning’s hands were trembling. He kept coughing. Every time he coughed, blood would gush out of his throat. He fell to the ground and smiled bitterly at Ye Jian. \"I’ve caused you trouble!\"","Ye Jian, who was panting heavily, looked at the warm body beside her. She pressed down on the gunshot wound on her shoulder and tried her best to calm down. \"What are you talking about? I didn’t expect it to be Unwin. If I had known, I wouldn’t have left you alone.","\"Unwin is a famous professional assassin around Lina. He’s a very tough character. I knew it was going to be difficult to kill him.\"","Ye Jian panted and sat up with one hand on her knee. \"How are you? Can you persevere?\"","\"I can.\" Liu Ning, who was trying to sit up, fell back to the ground and lay down. He panted heavily. \"Please help me. The car isn’t broken. Let’s drive to the place where Lina got off.\"","His ribs were probably shattered, and his internal organs were injured. But Liu Ning didn’t plan to tell Ye Jian anything.","Ye Jian stood up. She could tell that his voice was trembling. She walked over and helped Liu Ning up. \"Wait for me in the car. Leave Lina to me.\"","\"No!\" Liu Ning, whose legs were still fine, swallowed the taste in his throat and said in a low voice, \"Besides Unwin, there’s another professional assassin beside Lina. His ability is definitely not inferior to Unwin. Let’s... get up...\""]},{"number":4761,"title":"Chapter 4761: Agreement","paragraphs":["Before Liu Ning could finish his sentence, Ye Jian suddenly pressed his back. Caught off guard, Liu Ning gasped in pain.","\"Your ribs are broken. It’s not suitable for you to climb a mountain. Wait for me in the car.\" Ye Jian smiled and retracted her hand. \"I’ll try my best to avoid the people around Lina. After dealing with Lina, I’ll retreat immediately.\"","She turned around and fished out a black cell phone in Unwin’s pocket. It was a military satellite cell phone.","That made sense. It was impossible to cover all the cell phone signals in the depths of the mountains in the Golden Triangle. If they wanted to contact each other at any time, they definitely couldn’t use ordinary cell phones.","It seemed that the military satellite cell phone was provided by General Minlai.","Since she wanted to escape, why would Lina use the military satellite cell phone that could allow her whereabouts to be tracked at any time? Wasn’t she afraid that General Minlai would send a helicopter into the mountain to destroy her?","With Lina’s cunningness, it was impossible for her not to have thought of it.","Unless...","Ye Jian moved her wrist and kept the phone in her pocket. Then, she walked toward the other Burmese man who had been killed. She searched for a second military satellite cell phone but couldn’t find it.","Time was tight, so Ye Jian didn’t delay any longer. She helped Liu Ning up and walked toward the Jeep parked by the roadside.","Unless Lina had no choice but to use the military satellite cell phone. No matter how afraid she was of General Minlai, she had to use it for the time being.","After helping Liu Ning into the car, Ye Jian started the car and asked, \"Can you contact Captain Deng? I have something to trouble him with.\"","It was a personal matter. Ye Jian could only contact Captain Deng during the short drive.","Captain Deng was overjoyed when he received Ye Jian’s call. After listening to Ye Jian’s request, he said seriously, \"Okay, as long as you can reach the border tomorrow night, I’ll definitely arrange for you to return to Xiang City that night! But you have to do it in advance. And you can’t get hurt.","\"If you’re injured, you must stay in Cheli City for treatment.\"","\"Okay.\" Ye Jian smiled sweetly. Liu Ning, who was sitting beside her, closed his eyes slightly. He couldn’t bear to look at her anymore.","How could she not be injured?","She was already injured. She had been shot in the shoulder. She had bandaged it with a headscarf that she had picked up from somewhere. The headscarf was soaked in blood.","Ye Jian’s call quickly reached the military headquarters. Major General Yang knew that Ye Jian was safe and pursuing the second target. After killing her, Ye Jian could return to the country. At that moment, Major General Yang’s tense heart finally relaxed.","Tomorrow, if Xia Jinyuan asked him when Ye Jian would come back, he could reply that Xia Jinyuan could go to Xiang City and wait for her. He could see her!","Major General Yang, who was questioned by Xia Jinyuan every few days, had developed a phobia for answering the phone these days. Every time the landline phone rang, he had the urge to escape, afraid that it would be Xia Jinyuan again.","Now that he could finally give a definite answer, he was no longer afraid of the landline phone ringing.","Ye Jian returned the phone to Liu Ning and looked around the car. She said in a low voice, \"Find anything useful in the car. I plan to treat the gunshot wound briefly first.","\"Lina had planned to leave with these cars. There should be useful supplies in this car too. She’s also used to preparing some things for emergencies.\"","Liu Ning took the cell phone and placed it in his pocket. He stared at the gunshot wound on Ye Jian’s shoulder. \"How long can you last?\"","\"I’m able to persevere until I return to the country. Don’t worry, it’s just scary to look at. It’s a small-caliber bullet. It didn’t pierce through my body. The bullet is stuck in my flesh. It didn’t touch the bones. Although it hurts a little, I can bear with it.\"","She held the steering wheel with both hands and operated it agilely. If not for the blood on her body, Liu Ning wouldn’t have realized that she had been shot in the shoulder.","She was able to act as if nothing had happened even when she was shot. She was someone who would risk her life."]},{"number":4762,"title":"Chapter 4762: Hooked","paragraphs":["Liu Ning put down the seat and slowly climbed to the back seat to look for usable supplies. Soon, he found the secret compartment in the middle of the back row. He managed to retrieve iodine used to bandage wounds, painkillers, and disinfectant that had never been opened.","Liu Ning’s expression was extremely complicated when he retrieved these simple medical products. He held the iodine bottle tightly and sat in the back seat. His expression was dark as he asked, \"Did you know that these things were in the car from the start?\"","\"As long as the people around Lina went out, they’d commit murder and arson. It’s normal for them to keep these in the car. They haven’t even opened the bottle of iodine. It looks like the people who often use this car are quite powerful.\"","The last time she came back from Laos, the car she was in had a medical kit. If she hadn’t seen it before, she wouldn’t have asked Liu Ning to look for it.","As expected, she knew about it, but she didn’t ask to treat her injury immediately. Was she afraid... that Liu Ning would stop her from chasing after Lina when he saw her injury?","If he found out that she was shot like him before they got into the car, he would’ve definitely stopped her. He wouldn’t even let her get into the car.","Ye Jian didn’t let Liu Ning look at her wound. Unfortunately, there weren’t any strong painkillers. She disinfected the wound simply and used sterile gauze to stop the bleeding. She then asked Liu Ning to bandage it. She also took two regular painkillers. The entire process took less than three minutes.","It took six more minutes to bandage the gun wound on Liu Ning’s arm.","Then, Liu Ning saw her taking out two submachine guns and several magazines from the trunk of the Jeep. Liu Ning’s chest hurt.","\"It’s not safe to stay in the car. Take this and find a place to hide. I’ll definitely come back!\"","She handed the submachine gun over. Liu Ning, whose chest was in pain, grabbed her wrist tightly and said slowly, word by word, \"Little Ye, Captain Deng said that you must ensure your safety first. It’s not suitable for you to chase after Lina now!","\"If you really want to chase after Lina, I’ll go with you!\"","Ye Jian looked at the hand that was holding her tightly. There were small wounds on her face. She smiled slightly. \"Brother Liu, Lina must be killed. This is a mission I have to carry out. You can’t stop me.","\"It’s been 40 minutes since Lina entered the mountain. I have to take the opportunity to chase after her.","\"But you don’t know where she escaped to!\"","\"No, I do.\" She took out the cell phone from her pocket. \"I’ll know through this.\"","At this moment, Ye Jian spoke in Unwin’s voice. Liu Ning was so shocked that he released his grip. Ye Jian took the opportunity to retract her arm. \"Brother Liu, wait for me to come back!\"","\"Wait!\"","Liu Ning, who was shocked, got out of the car and handed over a small and short flashlight. \"You’ll need this.\"","\"Thank you.\" Ye Jian took the flashlight and waved her hand. Then, she carried the submachine gun and entered the mountain.","She didn’t have a flashlight. With this, she could save the battery on the cell phone.","On the mountain, Lina received a call from ’Unwin’. ’Unwin’ told her that he had already killed the two people sent by Wu Jinkun, but he was the only one alive.","When Lina knew that it was Wu Jinkun who sent them and not General Minlai’s men, she didn’t go too deep into the mountain. Now that she knew that the people following her had been dealt with, Lina’s tense expression eased a little.","She and Larner got out of the car and prepared to leave. They would get ’Unwin’ to pick them up in the mountains.","After ending the call, Ye Jian didn’t expect Lina to go down the mountain again. Her face was a little pale as she smiled slightly. After finding a rock, Ye Jian set up the submachine gun and waited for Lina to walk into the trap."]},{"number":4763,"title":"Chapter 4763: Chain","paragraphs":["Ye Jian didn’t plan to force herself. If she could solve a problem with weapons, she wouldn’t choose to solve it with her fists. Now that Lina was coming down the mountain, Ye Jian thought of using a submachine gun to deal with Lina.","Ten minutes later, the military satellite phone beside her vibrated. Ye Jian turned her head and saw that it was Lina.","She took it calmly. Then, she flashed the flashlight that Liu Ning gave her three times at the crown of a tree beside her. Lina’s cold and snake-like voice came from the phone. \"Pay attention to your surroundings. We’ll be there soon.\"","She said ’we’. Obviously, there was someone beside her.","However, Ye Jian didn’t know who it was.","She had seen all the bodyguards around Lina. The most loyal one was Unwin. They were inseparable. Those who didn’t know better would think that the two of them were in a romantic relationship. In fact, that was far from the truth. They were just loyal partners.","However, Liu Ning mentioned that there was a professional assassin beside Lina. He rarely appeared, but he would clean up some of Lina’s loose ends. He never gave Lina a headache.","If he rarely appeared... Ye Jian wasn’t sure if she had seen him before.","Professional assassins were harder to deal with than mercenaries. They were good at hiding their identities. The special training they underwent was comparable to the special forces. These people rarely showed their faces. They hid their identities and wouldn’t be easily discovered.","Normally, the people who found them were people who were about to die.","Ye Jian turned off the flashlight and hid on the side of the rock. She waited patiently for Lina to come over.","After another ten minutes, Ye Jian heard the sound of someone stepping on dead branches. They approached patiently.","Ye Jian coughed softly. Her cough was disguised exactly. Even if the other party listened carefully, they wouldn’t be able to tell the difference.","\"Unwin...\" The voice came from the 11 o’clock direction. Ye Jian turned on her flashlight again and shone it in the 11 o’clock direction. She saw Lina lowering her head and prying open the bushes that prevented her from walking.","Without a second’s pause, Ye Jian pulled the trigger.","Bang, bang, bang, bang... Bang, bang, bang... She was firing automatically. The bullets were dense as they shot forward one after another.","Although Lina said ’we’, Lina was the only one in front of Ye Jian. Ye Jian didn’t think too much about it.","Her first target was Lina. After dealing with Lina, she would end the entire mission.","As for the others, she would naturally take care of them if she saw them. If she didn’t see them, she wouldn’t enter the forest to look for them and delay her return to the country.","Dealing with Lina was the most important thing. It was the final Chapter of the entire mess.","Cheli City’s narcotics police had locked onto Lina as their second target. General Minlai was their first target. The Golden Triangle drug lord had died in Lina’s village, and Lina was General Minlai’s subordinate. That night, General Minlai happened to send people up the mountain to kill Lina. The three sides triggered a huge battle, and Wu Jinkun was killed by General Minlai’s subordinates. Someone would naturally tell General Minlai that she was killed by Wu Jinkun’s subordinates.","The entire scene was chaotic. China was just watching from the sidelines. No one would suspect that China was involved. No one would expect that General Minlai would be so busy for the next half a year because of the Chinese narcotics police.","As a warlord of Myanmar, the Chinese couldn’t do anything to General Minlai, but they could still keep him busy."]},{"number":4764,"title":"Chapter 4764: Devour","paragraphs":["Liu Ning, who was hiding in the bushes by the roadside, was so shocked by the gunshots that she opened her eyes. She deftly pressed down the long grass that covered her vision with her hands and raised her bloodshot eyes to look up the mountain.","They opened fire, and it was a unilateral fire!","Did Ye Jian open fire? Or did the people around Lina open fire alone?","Liu Ning, whose back was in dull pain, took a bite of the grass and hurt his tongue. As he bit down, he looked at the top of the mountain intently.","In the mountains, when Ye Jian fired, Larner fired at the same time, cutting off Ye Jian’s shot.","The two sides exchanged fire. Liu Ning spat out the hard grass that he had chewed until only its roots were left. He grabbed the weeds on both sides tightly and breathed heavily.","Damn it!","Nothing could happen!","If his shoulder wasn’t injured, with his ruthlessness, he would have a high chance of winning against the professional assassin beside Lina. However, he was injured!","In the mountain, Lina, who had fallen among the bushes, widened her eyes and stared in disbelief at the pitch-black front.","\"U-Unwin...\"","Her voice was low and out of tune. It was difficult for her to breathe intermittently. \"You... betrayed... betrayed... me, you...\"","Before she could finish her sentence, the continuous gunshots swallowed her voice again.","This was Larner’s second retaliation.","Hiding behind a rock, Ye Jian moved her body agilely and fired blindly at the ten o’clock direction in front of her. The bullets were fired from the ten o’clock direction, so the person who fired was the assassin beside Lina!","There was only one person!","Lina only brought him along when she escaped into the mountains. That meant Ye Jian had run into the mysterious professional killer beside Lina!","Amidst the gunshots, Ye Jian heard the sound of something heavy being dragged. Someone was dragging the heavily injured Lina and wanted to hide. Ye Jian, who was hiding sideways, rushed out and fired in all directions!","The gunshots stopped, and the mountain was silent. Only the rustling of leaves could be heard.","Larner dragged Lina to the side of the slope of the mountain. He wanted to cover the three bloody holes on Lina’s body with his hands, but he knew that his actions were useless. He couldn’t save Lina at all.","He took off his T-shirt and tore it open to bandage Lina’s leg, which had been shot twice.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","The bullets seemed to have cut through the treetops. Dead leaves flew up, and a few landed on Lina.","Larner, who was sweating profusely, didn’t stop his act of bandaging. \"He’s not Unwin. He should be someone around the general.\"","\"The voice... The voice...\"","Lina knew that she didn’t have long to live. Her hands, which were stained with her own blood, grabbed the corner of Larner’s shirt tightly. Her slightly tanned hands, which weren’t carefully maintained, were clenched tightly. It seemed that this was the only way she could survive.","She wanted to ask why it wasn’t Unwin. Their voices were the same.","Larner couldn’t answer because he didn’t know either.","It sounded like Unwin, but he was sure it wasn’t.","Since it wasn’t Unwin, how could they explain the voice?","\"Kill them, kill them...\" Lina, whose mouth was bleeding, instructed with a hideous expression. \"Kill them all! Kill them all! I’ll wait! Wait!\"","She did not want to die. She did not want to die!","She would wait for the person who killed her to die first! She would wait!","Larner took out the pistol from Lina’s waist and pulled the holster. \"Hold it and kill them.\"","Lina had been shot three times, but it wasn’t at her vital points. The moment Ye Jian’s flashlight shone on her, the cunning Lina suddenly felt a huge shock and subconsciously bent over."]},{"number":4765,"title":"Chapter 4765: Last","paragraphs":["Ye Jian was afraid of the other professional assassin beside her. When she realized that Lina was alone, she immediately chose to shoot blindly. This allowed Lina to survive temporarily.","That meant that she was still alive for the time being. She was shot in the abdomen and twice in the leg. If she couldn’t be saved immediately, she wouldn’t be able to survive the night.","Ye Jian, who was shooting along with the sound of clothes tearing, had already left the original shooting point. She didn’t want to continue fighting, but she needed to confirm if Lina was still alive.","Was the sound of clothes tearing meant to stop the bleeding?","In that case, she couldn’t leave immediately!","Larner wanted to lure Ye Jian away. Both times, he failed to lure the enemy. There were no more submachine gun bullets left in his hand. With a sinister gaze, Larner chose to fight.","After giving up on shooting, he bent his body and approached step by step. He was a professional assassin while Ye Jian was a professional soldier. If the two sides fought, it would definitely be a bloodbath.","Hence, Ye Jian didn’t want to fight.","She had a gun and two magazines. Why did she have to choose the lowest combat method?","When the gunshots in front stopped, Ye Jian flashed out and fired continuously as she approached the slope of the mountain.","Larner had no choice but to pounce away from her suppressive shooting. The commotion he caused undoubtedly told Ye Jian where he was now. Larner’s breathing was chaotic because Ye Jian was chasing after him.","Ye Jian was very difficult to deal with! He had met a very difficult fellow!","The other party knew him, but he didn’t!","Larner’s eyes were as dark as water. He closed his eyes slightly and took out the curved sword that the Kachin always carried with them. He would take the bet!","Ye Jian rushed out of her hiding spot again. Hearing the commotion, Ye Jian fired again. At the same time, a sharp sword passed through the bullets and shot in Ye Jian’s direction.","Larner didn’t have to hit any vital points. He just needed to stab any part of the other party’s body.","The sword spun and flew over. Ye Jian felt a whooshing sound in the air and the sound of leaves being cut by something. She subconsciously moved her body. The next second, she heard something cutting into the tree.","A knife! It was a knife that flew over and stabbed into a tree.","Although the knife was fast, it couldn’t be faster than bullets.","With a cold look in her eyes, Ye Jian fired the last few bullets from the submachine gun. When she flipped over and hid behind the tree, she had already finished changing the magazine.","Ye Jian, who was used to fighting in the dark, had extremely sharp senses. She heard weak but persistent breathing from afar and smelled the strong smell of blood in the mountain wind.","The professional assassin beside Lina had been shot!","It wasn’t that the other party wasn’t powerful. It was just that they didn’t expect Unwin to be fake, hence giving Ye Jian the initiative.","Larner covered the area below his rib cage where he was shot. His face, which had no expression at all when he killed someone, revealed a look of pain. This time, he was probably going to die!","There were still a few bullets left in the gun. He wanted to keep them and fight for his life, but now, he was facing a big problem.","While she was panting, Ye Jian moved toward Lina, who was holding her breath.","Lina, who didn’t even have the strength to hold the pistol, heard very soft footsteps. She leaned against the tree and smiled strangely. She used her last bit of strength to raise the loaded pistol.","\"Go to hell!\"","Her face was distorted as she gritted her bloodshot teeth and fired forward.","\"You haven’t died, so how can I die?\" A cold voice floated over. Lina’s pupils constricted. At the same time, her hand that was holding the pistol was clenched tightly and she shot up the mountain.","\"The piles of white bones in the cave at the back of the mountain are waiting for you to join them. I haven’t sent you in personally. How can I die?!\"","Lina’s voice was cold and sharp. \"It’s you!\"","It was her!","The girl kidnapped from China!"]},{"number":4766,"title":"Chapter 4766: Not Letting Go","paragraphs":["Lina was panicking.","In the past, she was the master of the lives of these ’humans’. If she wanted them to live, they could live. If she wanted them to die, they had to die. She had the final say throughout.","She had the final say in the rules of the entire stockade. Even if she had already made arrangements for who could leave and who had to stay, it was all up to her. No one dared to question her. Everyone listened to her arrangements obediently.","However, in just a few hours, the entire world seemed to have been overturned.","A ’human goods’ that she could hit and scold whenever she wanted was actually standing in front of her and wanted to take her life!","Hahaha...","Lina smiled. Every time she smiled, blood would gush out of the wounds. The three gunshot wounds were all caused by the ’human goods’ in front of her.","\"You’re not Wu Jinkun’s subordinate. Speak! You... Who are you? Who sent you... to... me?!\"","After laughing, Lina’s breathing became much weaker. She held her last breath and moved her hands toward her waist.","\"Closer... Closer... Tell me... Who... are you?!\"","There was a Kachin knife at her waist. Lina, whose fingers had already touched the handle of the knife, spoke intermittently. Her usually charming voice was like a torn cloth fluttering in the wind.","Ye Jian slowly bent her back and moved her hand together. She pressed Lina’s unruly right hand accurately. \"Of course, I’m Brother Kun’s subordinate. If not, how would Brother Kun know that you’re the general’s subordinate?","\"Do you think that Brother Kun never suspected anything? No, Brother Kun suspected it a long time ago. He just didn’t have any evidence. That time in Laos, you killed 30 of Brother Kun’s subordinates. The evidence was sent to Brother Kun.\"","\"You’re one of Brother Kun’s?\" Lina, whose hand was pressed down and couldn’t move, had a twisted expression on her face. \"Brother Kun’s subordinate is standing... in front of me... and telling me to join... the white skeletons in the cave behind the mountain?","\"Who are you lying to?!\"","\"I’m not lying to anyone else. I’m just lying to you.\" Ye Jian smiled. Her eyes were still cold. \"I’ll just lie to you.\"","She moved Lina’s right hand and touched her waist. She felt something hard. \"I can just tell you now that I’m closer. I was sent by Brother Kun.\"","Ye Jian pulled the knife out from her waist. The sharp tip of the knife moved and stopped at Lina’s injured leg. \"Did you want to stab me with this knife?\"","\"I’ve been by your side for almost five months. How can I not know what you have? You wanted me to come closer so that you could use this knife to stab into my body.","\"In my opinion, it’s better to stab it into your body!\"","In the dark, the branches and leaves were like monsters baring their fangs and brandishing their claws. They wanted to drag Lina, who was screaming in pain, into hell bit by bit.","\"So many girls have died in your hands. The bones in the back of the mountain are all evidence of your acts of murder. Even if you were stabbed a million times with this knife, it won’t be enough to appease the hatred of those innocent lives!\"","Lina was in pain. It was so painful that her neck straightened. It was so painful that her breath was stuck in her throat. It stuck in her throat, and she made a strange sound. It was so painful that Larner, who was bandaging himself to stop the bleeding in the dark, tightened his grip on the gun that only had three bullets left.","He had met a strong opponent—a strong opponent that he had to deal with carefully and not be careless.","This was a chance to kill a strong opponent. He had to grasp it!"]},{"number":4767,"title":"Chapter 4767: Blood","paragraphs":["Ye Jian slowly twisted the knife that was stabbed into her thigh. She started clockwise and then counterclockwise. Ye Jian, who was holding the knife, listened to Lina’s scream that was stuck in her throat. Her eyes were cold.","\"It hurts, right? I know that it hurts. So many girls have lost their lives to you. Just endure the pain!\" She exerted strength on her wrist and stabbed the knife into Lina’s thigh. The sharp tip of the knife was pressed against the bloodstained ground that was covered with a thick layer of fallen leaves.","\"Kill me... Kill... Kill me... B*tch... B*tch! Kill me!\"","It was too painful. No matter how unwilling Lina was, she didn’t want to live in pain. Her breath was stuck in her throat.","How hateful. How hateful! How hateful that she didn’t see through this person and got bitten in the end!","Hate!","How hateful!","’Larner, kill her! Hurry up and kill the b*tch!’","Larner, whose limbs were twitching, moved his lips. His eyes, which were no longer bright, were filled with hatred again because of his unwillingness.","’Kill her!","’Larner!","’Hurry up and kill her!’","At first, Ye Jian only wanted to fight quickly. However, when she mentioned the cave filled with white bones at the back of the mountain, she couldn’t control her desire to use violence to curb violence. She couldn’t control her desire to torture Lina and let her have a taste of how painful it was!","\"Of course, I’ll kill you. My mission is to kill you.\"","Ye Jian, who was whispering coldly, didn’t focus all her attention on Lina. She was as vigilant as ever and kept an eye on her surroundings.","The professional assassin who was supposed to be guarding Lina hadn’t left. Instead, he was hiding around and waiting for an opportunity to shoot.","Why was Lina saying so much nonsense before she died?","Besides wanting to know who she was, Lina also wanted to use her as bait. If she succeeded, she would be able to leave alive. If not, they would die together!","\"And your subordinate definitely can’t kill me. So what if you use yourself as bait? I can kill you, but you can’t kill me!\"","Her hand that was holding the handle of the knife stabbed deeper. Lina, who didn’t have much time to breathe, vomited blood because of Ye Jian’s words.","B*tch!","B*tch!","She actually knew what she and Larner wanted to do!","This damned b*tch!","The strange sounds in her throat became more and more frequent. Ye Jian smiled coldly.","The long knife of the Kachin race was similar to a watermelon knife, but it was slightly curved. It was handmade and sharp enough to kill cows and tigers, let alone kill people.","Ye Jian pierced through Lina’s leg forcefully. She only slowly pulled it out when the entire blade was about four centimeters deep.","At this moment, Lina was in so much pain that her limbs were spasming. Blood flowed out of her mouth one after another. Her eyes, which were always smiling, were glaring at him. She was unwilling. She was really unwilling.","Lina didn’t die at Wu Jinkun’s hands. She didn’t die at the hands of the general. She thought that she would escape tonight. Next, she would go overseas to hide for a while. After the news subsided, she would contact the country. She had arranged all her escape routes and was just waiting for her to complete them step by step.","In the end... In the end...","Unwilling to accept this, Lina widened her eyes and let out the last terrifying howl from her throat. She had actually died in the hands of a ’human goods’ that she could kill with a raise of her hand!","How could she die in the hands of a ’human goods’?!","How was that possible?","\"Who... are you? Who... are you...\"","She wanted to know who killed her. She wanted to know who the ’human goods’ who killed her was. Only then would the unwillingness in her heart fade a little."]},{"number":4768,"title":"Chapter 4768: Fight","paragraphs":["A weak voice came from the slope. Ye Jian, who had been hiding behind Lina, drew out the long knife and pressed it against Lina’s bloodstained neck. \"You’ve done bad things. Even if you die a hundred times, it won’t be enough to vent all your victims’ anger! Who am I? Don’t you know best?\"","The long knife slashed quickly, and the sharp blade cut across Lina’s neck.","Even until her death, Lina couldn’t be at peace. She didn’t know who killed her.","The Burmese drug dealer, Lina, who left no clues for the Chinese narcotics police and didn’t even know about her existence but caused the Chinese narcotics police to investigate her day and night for more than half a year, died silently in the vast mountains of the Golden Triangle.","Lina, who was lying in a pool of blood, was just one of the many drug dealers in the Golden Triangle. She didn’t even have the right to be called a ’drug lord’. If it weren’t for General Minlai, she wouldn’t even have the right to know Wu Jinkun.","Ye Jian avoided the shooting in front of her. She laid in the uneven forest and took in the smell of rotten leaves. She fired continuously in the direction of the bullets.","She still had a magazine. Including the magazine she was using now, there were at least 40 bullets left. The other party only fired single bullets so he didn’t have many bullets left!","Ye Jian was very calm, but she didn’t let down her guard.","Even if the other party didn’t have a gun, she couldn’t let down her guard when facing a professional assassin with a gun.","Even without a gun, there were thousands of ways to kill someone.","She needed to be wary of enemies hiding in the dark. Her shoulder was injured, so it was not suitable for close combat. Once the other party closed in, it was unknown who would die.","Now, at least she had a high chance of winning.","Ye Jian didn’t want to fight in close combat, but it was the only chance for Larner to leave alive. Every time this Burmese man shot, he would approach Ye Jian. When all three bullets were fired, he was already very close to Ye Jian.","Large amounts of leaves whipped toward Ye Jian. The leaves were knocked away violently by the submachine gun. Larner, who was hiding behind the leaves, was like a huge beast. He pounced on Ye Jian with a brutal killing intent.","This was a professional assassin. The mercenaries couldn’t compare to him. Ye Jian was sent flying and slammed into a tree. Then, she slammed back. Her chest hurt, and her organs seemed to have shifted.","Without giving Ye Jian any time to catch her breath, Larner swept over again. His brutal attack was aimed at her. Ye Jian raised her leg and kicked him. Her leg actually hurt slightly.","The mountain was filled with trees, bushes, and slopes. The sound that came from it was like two ferocious tigers pouncing on each other. Liu Ning heard the commotion and couldn’t wait quietly anymore. He gritted his teeth and picked up the submachine gun that Ye Jian gave him. He rushed into the mountain without any hesitation.","It was the sound of combat. The professional assassin around Lina was already used to killing in the forest. Little Ye was injured, so he had to go over and help her!","The mountain was filled with trees, bushes, and rocks. They cut her skin crazily. There were even branches that were cut down and stabbed into her flesh. Ye Jian’s eyes were red as she blocked the hands that were trying to strangle her. She bent her leg and kicked the other party’s crotch.","Once, twice, thrice... She had clearly kicked the most painful part of the man’s body, but the other party’s defense was too strong. The strength of his arms was still the same. He was completely unaffected.","There was a huge disparity in strength. Ye Jian couldn’t use brute force to block the attacks. She suddenly released her grip and stabbed at Larner’s eyes. No matter how dark it was on the mountain, one could see a fierce glint in them."]},{"number":4769,"title":"Chapter 4769: Glory","paragraphs":["Thud.","She stabbed Larner’s left eye like a dagger. Ye Jian could even feel that her fingers were smooth and wet.","This time, it was finally painful. It was so painful that he produced a sound from his throat. He raised his hand that was strangling Ye Jian’s neck and tried to break Ye Jian’s hand that was digging out his eyeball.","Ye Jian bent down again and kicked his crotch. She raised her head abruptly and used her head to hit Larner’s nose.","\"You’re courting death!\"","Rustling sounds could be heard. Ye Jian knew who it was.","The driver, Larner!","Unexpectedly, the other mysterious professional assassin beside Lina was the driver, Larner!","Ye Jian took advantage of her two consecutive painful strikes and managed to escape from under Larner. Similarly, she didn’t give Larner a chance to breathe. She grabbed a rock that she grabbed when she was escaping and smashed it toward Larner’s face!","After two consecutive painful strikes, Larner roared. His right eye was completely blinded by Ye Jian’s fingers. If he reacted three seconds slower, Ye Jian would have dug out his eyeball.","Ye Jian, whose back was badly mutilated by the thorns, was kicked in the chest by the other party before she could smash the rock into Larner’s face. Her swift actions carried the strength of a beast and landed on his chest.","\"Pfft...\"","This vicious kick made Ye Jian’s organs dislocate. Her chest felt as if it had been hit by a heavy hammer. At the same time, there was a metallic taste in her throat. She was sent flying and fell heavily.","Ye Jian’s chest was hit by the uneven rock again. Her vision turned black. The taste of blood that was suppressed in her throat surged into her mouth.","His mouth was filled with blood.","Ye Jian stood up. The leaves on the mountain swayed as she pounced on Larner. She punched Larner’s temple forcefully. It was a death move from the Xueyu unit.","Blood kept gushing out of the wound on her shoulder. The wounds from the thorns seemed to stop hurting. She attacked fiercely as if she didn’t know any pain.","A special forces soldier from the special forces would never admit defeat!","Larner, who was blind in one eye, endured the pain and avoided it. If there was light shining on him now, one would definitely be frightened by Larner’s face that was covered in blood and his ferocious expression.","He covered his injured right eye and gritted his teeth. \"You’re not Wu Jinkun’s subordinate. You... were sent by the Chinese!","\"A drug enforcement officer? A border defense armed police officer?\"","Ye Jian, who was full of killing intent, spat out the bloody foam in her mouth. Her hand trembled as she touched her back. When her fingers touched a long hard object, Ye Jian’s expression turned vicious. She grabbed the wood splinter that was stabbed into her back.","A splinter about six centimeters long and three centimeters wide was stained with blood. Ye Jian pursed her lips and pulled it out violently.","The bloodstained splinter was thrown aside so that she could welcome Larner’s fierce attack.","At this moment, their ferocity was stimulated. If they wanted to live, the other party had to die!","Bang!","Clash!","Bang!","The leaves in the mountain swayed crazily. Two figures with different physiques were fighting. As a female soldier, Ye Jian was being beaten to a pulp. However, Larner didn’t gain much advantage.","Ye Jian also hit Larner until all the bones in his body creaked.","\"Who’s courting death? Who’s courting death?!\" She shouted in Burmese and elbowed the other party’s chin. Larner’s face was distorted, and Ye Jian broke several of his teeth. Ye Jian was no different from a beast now."]},{"number":4770,"title":"Chapter 4770: Let’s Return To China","paragraphs":["Fists rained down on Larner’s face and chest. When she waved her hand again, Larner grabbed her wrist. He shouted, \"You are a Chinese special forces soldier!\"","\"Wrong! I’m Brother Kun’s subordinate!\" Ye Jian replied viciously. Her wrist was about to be broken by Larner. Suddenly, in an extremely strange posture, she jumped onto Larner...","She positioned her body on Larner’s shoulder like a monkey and clamped her legs around Larner’s neck. Her waist was bent at an unbelievable angle. She shouted loudly and used her legs to grab Larner until he fell.","She used all her strength to clamp Larner’s neck. She used the strength of her legs to break his neck.","With a fierce look in his eyes, Larner dug into Ye Jian’s legs. His hands were like steel bars, digging into Ye Jian’s legs until they were dripping with blood.","His throat was filled with anger. Larner, who had been walking on the edge of a blade for many years, knew that he was in a predicament. If he didn’t escape now, his neck would really be broken.","Ye Jian’s legs were pulled apart by him bit by bit. Ye Jian, who was covered in blood, didn’t give him a chance to escape. She twisted her legs forcefully. Even when the flesh on her calves was dug and torn off by Larner’s fingers, she didn’t let go.","Her moves were completely different from Liu Ning’s. Liu Ning focused on defense while Ye Jian’s moves were all lethal.","Ye Jian gritted her teeth. Her calves were badly mutilated. She grabbed her sides with her free hands. She needed a fulcrum where she could twist her legs.","Ye Jian grabbed the bushes that had deep roots and shook them violently. Her entire body suddenly spun, and an extremely crisp clicking sound was heard.","The thin and small leaves of the bushes were still swaying, causing countless leaves to fall. She could clearly hear the rustling of leaves, but she felt that the mountain was extremely quiet. It was so quiet that she could even hear the quietest whispers.","\"That’s right. I’m a Chinese special forces soldier.\"","A low and soft voice was heard speaking to Larner, whose head was at a strange angle.","\"...I’ll fight bravely and not be afraid of death. I’ll protect the motherland and the peaceful work of the people. Under no circumstances will I betray the motherland. I’ll fulfill the pledge and never violate it.\"","This was her faith and her persistence! She would not regret it even if she died!","Liu Ning, who climbed up the mountain with difficulty, heard the oath she made on the day she joined the army. It was different from the oath he took when he joined the police, but the meaning was the same.","Ye Jian raised her head and looked at the place where the branches were swaying. She used her hands to pry open her legs that were so stiff that they couldn’t listen to her brain. She said in a serious and cold voice, \"Target Two, Lina, has been taken care of.\"","Liu Ning stopped and saluted the female soldier in front of him. \"Cheli City’s narcotics police, Liu Ning, has received the report!\"","It was easy to go up the mountain but difficult to go down. Moreover, both of them were injured. Ye Jian didn’t ask Liu Ning to help her up. Instead, she held onto the tree and slowly got up.","Her legs were shaking violently. Her knees were so weak that she couldn’t support all her weight. She was relying on her tenacious willpower to support herself.","\"We’ve completed our mission. We can return to our country now.\"","The mountain breeze blew over. Every word was clear and filled with bloodlust. She was relaxed, calm, and fearless.","Liu Ning patted the young female soldier’s shoulder lightly. \"Yes, let’s go back.\"","She was covered in injuries and blood. From the top of the mountain to the bottom of the mountain, her entire body was exhausted. She was sweating profusely.","The car parked at the side of the road started moving. The headlights were like sharp swords that split the darkness as they drove bravely into the distance. In the distance was their hometown. In the distance was their family. In the distance was their home."]},{"number":4771,"title":"Chapter 4771: Gentle","paragraphs":["At 10:00 pm, Xia Jinyuan, who never smoked, lit up one cigarette after another. He sat alone on the sports ground of the base.","There were at least 20 cigarette butts beside his feet.","He didn’t smoke much. He just put it to his mouth and lit it up. Then, he held it in his hand and let the cigarette burn out.","G3, who was invited out by the sentinel, looked at the scene for at least half an hour. The commander of the Xueyu unit, Lieutenant Colonel Xia, didn’t notice him. Xia Jinyuan only noticed him when he walked in front of him.","The red cigarette flickered a few times between his fingers. He threw it on the sports ground and extinguished it with the tip of his shoe. Xia Jinyuan looked up. \"Why aren’t you asleep yet? Don’t you plan to go for exercise tomorrow?\"","Her voice was so hoarse that G3 jumped in fright.","G3 walked closer, and his nose twitched slightly. \"Why does it smell like shampoo? Did you drink shampoo instead of alcohol?\"","\"Get lost.\" Xia Jinyuan raised his leg and kicked him. \"You’re disturbing my peace.\"","G3 sat down. The smell of shampoo got stronger. He stared at Xia Jinyuan’s unruly hair that was cut into a crew cut. He laughed. \"Don’t tell me you didn’t rinse your hair after putting on shampoo?\"","G3 was right.","It was rare for Xia Jinyuan to freeze. He raised his head and touched his hair that was a little prickly. \"Yeah, I think I rinsed it. I remember rinsing it.\"","\"Rinse, my ass. It smells like shampoo.\" G3 smiled until the corners of his mouth twitched. He even rubbed Xia Jinyuan’s head. \"It’s still sticky. It’ll definitely foam up if you pour water over your head.\"","He probably didn’t rinse it.","Xia Jinyuan touched his sticky hair and smiled. That smile made G3’s heart tighten.","\"At first, I really thought that you were asleep. After walking around, the sentinel realized that it was you and didn’t dare to approach. After walking another round, you were still here. He was worried, so he ran over to look for me. He was afraid that you would take things too hard and commit suicide.\"","G3 looked at the captain carefully. He lowered his voice and said, \"Why? Do you still miss Ye Jian? Aren’t you going to her school tomorrow? You can recover from your lovesickness by then.\"","\"I was washing my hair. Halfway through, I suddenly saw her standing there covered in blood. I don’t know what she was muttering. The bloody sight was frightening. After bleeding for three minutes, all the blood on her body dried up.\"","This scene suddenly flashed past Xia Jinyuan’s mind. His heart hurt so much that he almost thought that he would die young. The hooligan froze at that moment and forgot about rinsing off the shampoo.","This was the first time he didn’t know what to do.","G3, who was called out by the sentinel and was so frightened by the sentinel’s anxious look that his knees turned weak, thought that the captain was really going to commit suicide and ran all the way here. When he saw the scene before him now, he was relieved.","He didn’t disturb them. He even asked the sentinel to go around this area and stand at the side.","He didn’t dare to disturb them. He was afraid that if he disturbed them too much, he would shock the soldier who always stood straight no matter how heavy the wind and rain were.","They accompanied each other until the night dew was deep.","\"We might be able to see each other tomorrow. How can we not attend her graduation ceremony?\" G3 didn’t know how to comfort Xia Jinyuan, but he had to say something. How could he just accompany her?","Xia Jinyuan smiled faintly. His handsome and elegant face showed a hint of sadness. Even his eyes were filled with bitterness. \"I feel that I’m being a little pretentious. You’re right. I might seem ruthless to her, but I’m actually only ruthless to her when she’s right under my nose.","\"When she’s out of my sight and out of my range, I’m afraid. I’m really f*cking afraid. I’m so afraid of her dying.\""]},{"number":4772,"title":"Chapter 4772: Admit It","paragraphs":["This ’fright’ made G3’s heart tremble.","He asked in a trembling voice, \"Are you going to tell me that you don’t plan to let her join our team?\"","\"Hey, don’t say that. I really thought about it just now.\" Xia Jinyuan laughed until G3 felt his heart hurting.","G3 held his breath and retorted, \"Don’t make such decisions! It’s not up to you!\"","\"Yes, it’s not up to me. That’s why I’m just thinking about it. Putting aside my identity as a soldier, I’m just having thoughts as an ordinary man, though it’s a selfish thought.","\"I’m the one who brought her along this path. If I’m afraid, who will be her backer in the future?","\"I can’t be afraid. Even if I’m afraid, I have to bear with it. I can’t let her see that I’m afraid. She chased after me wholeheartedly and now wants to fight alongside me. As for me, I kept telling her that I’d wait. I can’t turn around now and tell her that I’m f*cking afraid. Heh, she’d definitely raise her hand and slap me.","\"That’s why I have to bear with it. I have to tell her that she’s really brave. I have to tell her that special forces soldiers are like her. What’s there to be afraid of when we bleed? Our clothes are thick, and we can cover the blood that flows out. After resting for a few days and drinking a few bowls of soup, we can replenish what we lost.","\"Yin, I’m not afraid of her bleeding. I’m just afraid... afraid that she’ll lose her life...\"","His voice was weak. It was like a bubble that couldn’t be poked. The wind couldn’t blow it, and the sun couldn’t shine on it. With the slightest touch, it would shatter into pieces.","G3 felt as though his heart was pricked by thorns. He closed his eyes and buried his face in his rough palms. He rubbed his face fiercely, wanting to peel off the skin on his face.","Xia Jinyuan lowered his eyes and glanced at him. When he heard the sound of G3 rubbing his face, he nudged G3 with his elbow. \"Are you using a wire sponge to wipe your face? Will Sister-in-law still acknowledge you when we go back tomorrow?\"","\"Hey, I’m trying to comfort you here!\" G3, whose calluses were so thick that his palms were like a wire sponge, raised his head and glared at Xia Jinyuan, who was teasing him. \"Can’t you say some nice things?\"","\"I was sitting down and meditating. You came over to disturb me. I haven’t even settled the score with you. Go, go, go. Don’t comfort me. Who’s patrolling tonight? Tell them to clean the toilets tomorrow.\"","G3 choked. He couldn’t tell if the captain was alright.","The moment he opened his mouth, he made people choke and stutter.","It was abnormal to say that he was fine.","How could Xia Jinyuan be afraid? G3 had never seen him afraid!","It wasn’t fear. It was the most normal worry a man would have for someone he loved deeply.","Just because he was a fellow soldier, it didn’t mean he didn’t have the right to worry about his girlfriend.","Xia Jinyuan saw G3’s expression changing again and again. One moment, he looked like he was constipated, and the next moment, he looked like he was suffering from internal injuries. He raised his hand and patted G3’s shoulder. \"I think I might be sick. I might wanna seek treatment.","\"One moment, I feel suffocated. The next moment, I’m sad. But now that I’ve calmed down and look back on things, I don’t think anything is wrong. I’m just messing around.","\"Whether she’s afraid, bloody, or dead, I’ll accept it. As long as it’s her decision, I’ll accept it.","\"Don’t worry, I won’t stop her from joining the team. She’s definitely coming to our team! In the future, when I become her captain, I want to see if Old Yang dares to hide things from me again.\"","He gritted his teeth when he said the last sentence. Major General Yang, who was in the capital city, shivered inexplicably."]},{"number":4773,"title":"Chapter 4773: Gentleman Like Heng","paragraphs":["G3, on the other hand, felt that Lieutenant Colonel Xia was probably suffering from mood swings. He gritted his teeth and said, \"You should really seek help. If this continues, I’ll be tortured by you.","\"However, you’re not considered sick. Your girlfriend disappeared for a few months. As her boyfriend, it would be abnormal if you weren’t worried at all.","\"Your situation is normal. It’s understandable. You’re in charge of the soldiers and the military unit during the day. It’s normal for you to worry about your girlfriend at night.","\"Don’t think too much. Go to Xiang City tomorrow and serve Little Ye obediently. When you come back in a few days, I guarantee that you’ll be radiant!\"","When night fell, Xia Jinyuan, as a man, would shed the strength of a soldier in the day and reveal the gentlest side of a man.","At the core, he was a man who loved a woman deeply. He was a soldier and a man. Naturally, he would be weak at times.","Hence, it had nothing to do with being pretentious.","As a man, it was normal for him to be worried about his girlfriend’s safety.","G3 didn’t think that he was pretentious. He just knew that Xia Jinyuan was a man who missed a woman deeply.","\"How long do you plan to sit there? You have a flight tomorrow.\"","\"Let’s sit for a while more.\"","\"What’s there to sit for? It’s already past two in the morning.\"","\"There’s no hurry. Let’s wait a little longer.\"","\"Wait for what?\"","\"Wait for the call. If there’s going to be news, it’s going to be within the next two days.\"","\"Are you sure?\"","\"Get lost. Don’t disturb me.\"","On the sports ground, the captain of the Xueyu unit, Q King, and G3, who only accepted the temporary position of an ’instructor’, were no longer as wise and mighty as they were in the morning. They were even worse than three-year-olds.","At three o’clock in the morning, Captain Deng, who was sleeping lightly on the desk, received a call again. The entire Narcotics Brigade was enveloped in joy.","Their heroes had returned to the country!","\"Quick, get the helicopter to pick them up! The medical staff should all get into position. Hurry up and make arrangements! Hurry!\"","In the Narcotics Brigade, Captain DEng’s loud voice entered the ears of all the narcotics officers. At that moment, the entire office building of the unit was in an uproar.","The heroes in the black and white photos who were quietly accompanying their comrades seemed to smile too.","There was still a long way to go. Some people passed while others advanced. They would follow up with weapons to protect the peace of the country!!","At five minutes past three in the morning, Xia Jinyuan, who had been sitting on the sports ground, felt his phone vibrate. G3 widened his eyes and moved his lips silently. \"There’s really news?!\"","He found it hard to believe.","The smile on Xia Jinyuan’s face spread. He looked like a gentleman.","In the middle of the night, a sentinel from a military base looked at the captain who was running in the middle of the night. He couldn’t help but criticize him internally, \"Why is he running in the middle of the night? Is something wrong with his brain?\"","Major General Yang felt refreshed.","He had been holding it in for a few months and was questioned by Xia Jinyuan every day as if he was asking to pay back a debt. It was finally over early this morning!","As for the matter of injuries, Ye Jian and Liu Ning didn’t tell Captain Deng about it, let alone Major General Yang.","Ye Jian drove out of the mountains and returned to the prosperous city. The first thing she did was to go to a small pharmacy in Myanmar and get a pile of medicine. It was not a big deal to look for medicine in a border town with blood all over their bodies. The pharmacy staff didn’t even ask. They calmly handed over the medicine and accepted the money to end the transaction.","With the medicine they bought, the two of them endured until they reached the border. They found an informant who could send them out of Myanmar.","At five o’clock the next afternoon, the sky was still bright and the sun was still warm. A helicopter took off from the border and flew straight to the best hospital in Cheli City.","When the two medical staff accompanying them saw the two injured people, their eyes turned red."]},{"number":4774,"title":"Chapter 4774: Tenacity","paragraphs":["The medical staff who came to receive them were an experienced doctor from the border defense armed police officer hospital and a nurse with 14 years of experience. The two of them had seen many gunshot wounds and knife wounds. They were able to remain calm under normal circumstances.","However, when the border defense soldiers carried the two injured people onto the helicopter and the medical staff saw their tattered clothes stained with brown blood and their injuries, their hands trembled as they opened the medicine box.","Just how badly were they hurt?","Three of the male patient’s ribs were broken. He was shot and didn’t treat his inflammation in time, causing him to have a high fever. The bullets deviated, and there were signs of digging around the wounds. HIs facial features were swollen, so his original appearance couldn’t be seen clearly.","There was a large area of abrasion on his hands and feet. When the medical staff lightly pressed his abdomen lightly, the patient was in unbearable pain. They suspected that his spleen was injured.","Despite all that, he was still considered alright.","When the female soldier’s clothes were cut open, the nurse, who had 14 years of experience, couldn’t bear to look at her anymore. She tilted her head slightly.","The soldier’s back... was full of wounds and dried blood.","The snow-white bandage turned black. When the bandage was slowly untied, the doctor gasped slightly.","There were countless wounds on the female soldier’s back. The deepest wound was three to four centimeters deep. It was caused by a blunt object. The wound on the back of her waist was suspected to be caused by a tree branch. There was a dark brown stain on her flesh. They needed to wash the wounds to remove the impurities.","She was also shot in the shoulder. The bullet went deep into her muscles. It had been a long time since she was shot, so the area around the wound was inflamed and red.","Her lower jaw was injured, and she was hit violently. There were countless bloodstains on her face. It was suspected that they were caused by sharp thorns.","Her legs were also scratched. The ten bloody finger marks could be seen clearly. Some skin tissue was forcefully torn off. Even if the wounds healed, they would leave permanent scars.","Two of her ribs were broken. There was no pain when they pressed on her abdomen. As for the large purple subcutaneous tissue wound on her chest, it was suspected that she had been hit violently.","Her body temperature was high, but her mind was clear.","The doctor looked at the slender fingers that were covered in blood and grime. He sighed and said, \"Okay, I won’t give you any painkillers for the time being, but you’ll still need them when you go onto the operating table later.\"","\"Okay, I’ll cooperate later. But not now. I’m afraid I’ll fall asleep.\" Ye Jian had to take painkillers on the way back to the country. She smiled slightly. \"Doctor, I’m sorry to make things difficult for you.\"","\"You’re not making things difficult for me. In the end, you’ll be the one in pain.\" The doctor was in his early 40s. \"If you can’t stand it, you must tell me. There’s still half an hour before we reach Cheli City.\"","Ye Jian and Liu Ning boarded the helicopter from a remote place. However, they were able to reach the border as soon as possible. It would take them 40 minutes to get to Cheli City by helicopter.","The doctor checked their injuries carefully and asked them to be hospitalized immediately. However, Ye Jian rejected him.","She had to return to Cheli City tonight. Even if she had to undergo surgery, she had to complete it in Cheli City. Liu Ning knew the reason and insisted on returning to Cheli City as well. After being yelled at by Captain Deng, Captain Deng eventually nodded and agreed.","It wasn’t easy for her to get Captain Deng to agree to let her go back to Cheli City for surgery. Ye Jian was afraid that once she was injected with painkillers, her tense nerves would relax. She might oversleep and miss her graduation ceremony.","She had to go back and attend the graduation ceremony. This was her agreement with Captain Xia.","Liu Ning could take the painkillers. Even after he returned to Cheli City, he would be on leave. Even if he slept until dawn, it wouldn’t affect anything. However, Liu Ning was loyal and didn’t sleep either. He accompanied Ye Jian."]},{"number":4775,"title":"Chapter 4775: Go Back On Your Word","paragraphs":["Seeing the two of them like this, the doctor and nurse silently cleaned and disinfected the shallow flesh wounds.","They had waited at the border for 14 hours, which meant that the two of them had to bear with the pain for 14 hours. The two of them didn’t faint the entire time and relied on their willpower to support themselves.","If it were an ordinary person, they would’ve fainted three to five times.","The two of them took IV drips in the helicopter and arrived at Cheli City People’s Hospital at 6:15 pm. This place was specially used for emergency surgeries, so the helicopter could land at the back yard.","Captain Deng, who was dressed casually, and 30 narcotics police officers welcomed their heroes back.","They saw the two people coming down from the helicopter, pushing away the support of the medical staff and the accompanying border armed police. The two walked over with their backs straight even though they were seriously injured. Everyone present was moved at that moment.","They had gone through a difficult time, but they had made an achievement for themselves!","\"Salute!\"","Captain Deng shouted and saluted the returning heroes.","He wanted to thank them for doing their best to protect the peace of the country!","The two of them responded with solemn military salutations. ’Thank you for persevering back home. You’re the reason we could come back today!’","On the way to the operating room, Ye Jian used her willpower to hold on to her last bit of consciousness. She said to Captain Deng, \"Captain Deng, don’t forget our agreement.\"","\"Don’t worry! I didn’t forget!\" Captain Deng held Ye Jian tightly and replied seriously, \"I’ll definitely send you back to school for your graduation ceremony!\"","\"Okay, thank you, Captain Deng.\"","Ye Jian, who was lying on the bed, waved her hand and closed her eyes with a smile. Her expression was relaxed.","She would be able to return to Xiang City very soon!","’Captain Xia, are you waiting for me to come back?’","He was most definitely waiting for her to come back.","How could the two of them go back on their word?","Unless they had a mission and had no choice.","When she reached the operating room, Ye Jian chose local anesthesia. The effects of local anesthesia were limited. She said that she still had a rather important matter to deal with. The general anesthesia would make her unable to keep her mind clear. Because of this, the surgeon felt a headache coming on.","But what else could the surgeon do? He just chose to cooperate.","Usually, it was the patients cooperating with the doctors in the operating room. Today, it was the doctor cooperating with the patient.","The effects of local anesthesia lasted for only a limited time. The doctor chose to take out the bullet and suture the wound first. Then, he cleaned and sutured the two deep puncture wounds on Ye Jian’s back. He also treated the wounds on her legs.","From 6:10 pm until around 10:00 pm, Ye Jian’s injuries were all treated. Her broken ribs were bandaged and stabilized. Captain Deng saw Ye Jian being pushed out of the operating room and was alarmed by her sweat.","The doctor had no choice but to tell Captain Deng what happened before the surgery. Captain Deng swallowed his reprimands and expressed his heartache with the word ’mischievous’.","Far away in Xiang City, Xia Jinyuan walked past his former alma mater. Now, it was Ye Jian’s alma mater. He walked slowly step by step. The scenery of Ye Jian walking through the campus was spread out in front of him.","\"Little Ye’s favorite place is the library. I don’t know where she gets so much energy from. Every time the students finish training, most will be so tired that they’ll collapse. But Ye Jian is still energetic and will go to the library to study. Ten out of ten times when I go to the library, I’ll see her there.","\"If she wants to become a soldier under you in the future, you have to cherish her and nurture her well. You can’t ruin her for personal gain.\"","The dean of the department, who was walking, seemed to have guessed what his favorite student was thinking. He spoke slowly. If he didn’t expose him, the people who heard him wouldn’t know what he was saying.","Xia Jinyuan had come to look for Ye Jian a few times. The dean knew this, but he didn’t point it out."]},{"number":4776,"title":"Chapter 4776: Very Important Person","paragraphs":["One was in the military unit while the other was in the military school. The two of them were so busy that they only saw each other once a year. Of course, this was excluding the holiday training.","In short, the two of them would only see each other twice a year. They were both ambitious young people. They knew the rules and were not afraid that something would happen to them. As the dean of the department, even if he realized the truth, there was no need to point it out.","Now that Little Ye was about to graduate, as the dean of the department, he had the responsibility to give some advice so that the two young people wouldn’t lose their sense of propriety.","Xia Jinyuan could naturally hear the meaning behind the dean’s words. He smiled slightly. \"Don’t worry. She and I know what we’re doing. We won’t mess around and cause trouble.\"","\"That’s good, that’s good. I’ll believe what you say.\"","The dean couldn’t help but smile and nod. He looked at the fourth-year students who walked past the campus from time to time and restrained his smile. \"She’ll be speaking as the representative of the Outstanding Students at tomorrow’s graduation ceremony. Although she’s not around, she’ll still have her spot. I hope that she’ll make it in time, just as you said.\"","\"She’ll be back. She’ll definitely attend the graduation ceremony on time.\"","Xia Jinyuan’s affirmative answer reassured the dean.","The night got darker. The stars in the sky were so bright, and the Milky Way was beautiful.","A civilian plane that was more than 8,000 meters high in the sky was flying under the Milky Way, over the beautiful mountains and rivers, going from Yun Province to Xiang City.","At two in the morning, the plane descended on time. While the passengers waited patiently, the special passenger at the front was pushed by a narcotics officer in a wheelchair. A medical staff followed closely behind.","Ye Jian made up her mind that such a thing wouldn’t happen again.","No matter how persistent she was, Captain Deng and the narcotics police wouldn’t give in. They insisted on sending a narcotics police officer and a medical staff to accompany her. In the end, even the leaders appeared. No matter what they said, however, Ye Jian wouldn’t give in.","The real reason why Ye Jian agreed was because of Major General Yang.","Hence, Ye Jian was accompanied by a narcotics police officer and a medical staff. Although the crew didn’t know what happened to Ye Jian, it didn’t stop them from admiring her as she left in a wheelchair.","At 2:00 am, the airport was very quiet, with only a few people transiting. Although Ye Jian and the other two were dressed casually, they were still quite eye-catching as Ye Jian was in a wheelchair. The Yun Province’s narcotics police contacted Xiang City Airport in advance, so Ye Jian came out from the special passageway.","Ye Jian’s back was injured, and her ribs were broken. She only rested for a while on the plane. There were many injuries. She tilted her body slightly and closed her eyes to rest.","Logically speaking, she should be very tired, but she was in high spirits and didn’t feel sleepy at all.","The medical staff teased, \"You’re still young.\"","Ye Jian pursed her lips and smiled. It wasn’t because of her youth; it was because she had someone in her heart. He was the source of her energy.","Before she came out of the passageway, Ye Jian was already subconsciously looking for a figure that she could recognize even if it was just a blurry back view.","The narcotics officer noticed that she was looking for someone. He smiled and asked, \"Who are you looking for?\"","\"I’m looking for someone. Someone very, very important...\" Her voice gradually lowered. The very important person in her heart had appeared.","He was tall and majestic like a mountain. He was striding toward her with a smile on his face.","\"Someone very, very important. I’ve found him.\"","Ye Jian said in a low voice. Even when the anesthesia wore off halfway through the surgery, the special forces soldier didn’t shed a single tear... At this moment, tears were already shimmering in her eyes.","That very important person had come. He had come to her side.","This was great... This was really great!"]},{"number":4777,"title":"Chapter 4777: The Most Beautiful Reunion","paragraphs":["She crawled through the mountains and rivers just to see him.","She went through a calamity so that they could meet again.","Seeing the tall figure striding over and the smile on his face, Ye Jian stretched out her hands and welcomed him with a hug.","’The most beautiful thing is to reunite with you. Hug me, Captain Xia.’","The journey was really too tiring. If she didn’t have faith in her heart and didn’t persevere, she might’ve really collapsed halfway. Her faith was the pledge of the soldier flag and the country’s flag, and her persistence was him.","He was a very, very important man whom she loved very much.","Xia Jinyuan walked faster and faster. He had lost his composure. He had never lost his composure before. He even staggered.","The woman he loved deeply had returned. When her gaze found him, her eyes were filled with tears. A smile spread from the corners of her mouth and finally stopped in her eyes. There were smiles and tears. It felt like a small boat returning to its harbor.","He had always known that he was her harbor!","’I’m here to pick you up, little fox.","’I’m here to fetch you, my love.’","With his quick steps, handsome face, and the military aura he exuded, even the narcotics officer who was wearing casual clothes and pushing Ye Jian’s wheelchair, knew that the young man who was walking over was a soldier.","He was the lover of the female soldier, Ye Jian.","The two of them exchanged glances with each other. It was obvious what their relationship was.","The narcotics officer bent down slightly and smiled gently. \"I can let him take over now. Congratulations, Ye Jian. You’ve returned home safely.\"","Only with someone waiting and expecting one’s return could one return home safely.","Ye Jian nodded heavily and hummed softly.","Yes, she had returned home safely.","The narcotics officer was smart. He smiled at the medical staff and didn’t push the wheelchair forward anymore. He just stood at the same spot and waited for the young man who was jogging over.","Xia Jinyuan walked closer and looked at his lover in front of him without blinking. He saw her thin face and thin body that looked like it could be blown away by the wind. He saw the new injuries on her face, and his heart ached.","He knew it. He knew it... Even an ambulance was sent to pick her up. It definitely wasn’t as the major general said, that she had just sustained minor injuries.","With the little fox’s perseverance, why would she need a narcotics officer and a medical staff to accompany her back to Xiang City if she was just slightly injured?","Why did she need to sit in a wheelchair?","He bent his straight waist gently and welcomed his lover with his gentlest side.","There was no need for the medical staff to remind him. Xia Jinyuan knew that he couldn’t hug Ye Jian tightly. Although he really wanted to hug her tightly, he had to bear with it.","He carefully opened his strong arms and hugged her gently. \"I’m here to pick you up, baby.\"","A kiss of love and pity landed on Ye Jian’s cheek. A hint of affection wrapped around the two of them. Even the air became sweet.","\"I’m back, Captain Xia.\" Ye Jian could only hug Xia Jinyuan with one hand. Her injured shoulder could only be lifted to the same height as her shoulder. The medical staff wouldn’t allow anything more.","\"I didn’t go back on my word.\"","This was the second sentence Ye Jian said when they met.","Xia Jinyuan’s eyes reddened. He almost cried in front of everyone there.","Fortunately, he didn’t lose his composure.","\"Yes, I know. My little baby has always valued promises. How could she go back on her word?\" As he spoke, a gentle and delicate kiss landed on Ye Jian’s temple again. \"That’s why I’ve been waiting for you to come back.\""]},{"number":4778,"title":"Chapter 4778: It’s Good Enough She’s Alive","paragraphs":["The tall and big man hugged the slender woman with his strong arms. He was like a mountain that supported the woman. There was no wind or rain, only the sun. He would protect her and guard her for the rest of her life.","The narcotics police and the accompanying medical staff didn’t disturb the reunion of the lovers. They couldn’t bear to.","The reunion hug ended reluctantly. When Xia Jinyuan got up, he kissed Ye Jian’s cheek lightly before introducing himself to the narcotics police and the accompanying medical staff.","\"I’m Ye Jian’s boyfriend. Thank you for escorting her.\"","\"Ye Jian is the number one contributor to our Yun Province. It’s only right to escort her.\" The narcotics officer reached out his hand. Even though they were just shaking hands politely, they could feel the calluses on each other’s palms.","Only people who held guns all year round would have thick gun calluses. It seemed that Little Ye’s boyfriend was not simple either.","Then, Xia Jinyuan shook hands with the medical staff and thanked them. Afterward, Xia Jinyuan pushed Ye Jian out.","Xia Jinyuan wasn’t the only one who came to pick her up. Commissar Yue and the director were here too.","The ambulance was also waiting. It was waiting for Ye Jian to come out and send her to the hospital immediately.","Commissar Yue arrived at Xiang City Airport from the capital city two hours ago. He had been waiting at the airport without going to the military school. Xia Jinyuan and the director arrived an hour ago with the ambulance.","After knowing that Ye Jian was injured, Xia Jinyuan’s expression turned cold. The dean had been thinking for a long time, but even after speaking till his mouth was dry, Xia Jinyuan’s expression didn’t improve.","Knowing Xia Jinyuan’s personality, the dean wanted to point at his nose and scold him. Just as he was about to scold him, Xia Jinyuan looked ahead with a cold face and said in a deep voice, \"In our line of work, it’s normal to get injured. There’s nothing to worry about. As long as she’s alive, everything’s fine.\"","Did he waste his breath just now?","The dean’s fingers trembled as he choked. He said angrily, \"Then why did you make me worry for so long?\"","\"I saw that you were worried about Ye Jian, so I let you speak.\"","The dean wanted to thump his chest. \"Young brat, you’re already a lieutenant colonel. Why do you still like to anger me as much as before? Let me tell you, if I really fall sick from anger because of you, you have to come to the hospital and serve me!","\"No, you have to come to the hospital to serve Little Ye and me!\"","\"Little Ye has me serving her, and you have your wife serving you. It’ll be a hindrance if I’m there with you,\" Xia Jinyuan replied with a smile. Besides the fact that his voice was colder than usual, he looked normal.","No one saw that he was secretly clenching his fists. No one noticed the deep fear in his eyes.","She was hurt. His woman was hurt.","She was seriously injured and needed an ambulance to fetch her.","Where was she hurt? Was she afraid of carrying out a mission alone without him accompanying her?","How much pain and grievances did she suffer?","He knew that it was inevitable to get injured during combat, but his heart still ached.","After the pain, he felt fortunate that she was only injured. Fortunately, she came back smoothly.","That was good. That was good.","As long as she came back alive, everything would be fine. It was really good!","From the moment he knew that Ye Jian was injured to the moment he saw her, Xia Jinyuan used a lot of effort to stabilize his voice and emotions.","It was already very good that she had returned to his side alive.","He didn’t ask for much. He just hoped that she could come back alive every time she went on a mission.","Hearing her voice and seeing her smile was enough. That was enough."]},{"number":4779,"title":"Chapter 4779: Gentleness","paragraphs":["It was fine to be injured. It was fine to bleed a little. She’d recover after recuperating.","As long as she was alive, everything else was fine!","Outside, Commissar Yue and the dean had been waiting for a long time. The two leaders didn’t know what mission Ye Jian had gone on, so they didn’t know if Ye Jian’s injuries were light or heavy. Even with the ambulance, they didn’t think too much about it.","If the students from the military school got injured or fractured during training, they would also be sent to the hospital in an ambulance.","When the two leaders saw Xia Jinyuan pushing the wheelchair out and then saw the Outstanding Student, Ye Jian, sitting in the wheelchair, they felt their hearts about to jump out of their throats.","They didn’t wait on the spot anymore. They rushed over and surrounded Ye Jian.","\"Hurry, hurry. Take a look and see if she’s okay!\"","Even though their hearts were in their throats, the two leaders, who had seen many storms, were very calm. They let the medical staff take a look at Ye Jian first. They didn’t immediately hound her with questions.","Ye Jian didn’t expect that her return to Xiang City would alarm the political commissar and dean. Her face was as red as fire. \"Political Commissar, Director, I’m fine. I’ll be fine after resting for a few days.\"","\"That’s not up to you to say. Jinyuan, accompany Little Ye to the ambulance,\" Commissar Yue said in a low voice. They needed to get Ye Jian into the ambulance and let the medical staff check on her. They could always talk later.","The dean only dared to pat Ye Jian’s hands lightly. He didn’t dare to pat her shoulders. She was wearing a short-sleeved shirt, but he could see the traces of bandages under the thin fabric.","Then, he looked at her arms. They were green and purple. It was a scary sight.","Her face was the same. It was filled with fine new wounds.","He didn’t even dare to pat too hard. The back of her hands were also injured.","She was just fine before, but after a few months, she came back injured. The dean’s mood... It was better not to talk about it.","\"Let Jinyuan accompany you to the car. We’ll talk to the two comrades who sent you back. We’ll visit you later.\"","After the dean finished speaking, Xia Jinyuan hurriedly pushed Ye Jian away. Three medical staff followed him, all of them in a hurry.","The medical staff from Yun Province walked with them and passed the medical record to the medical staff from Xiang City. \"There’s a gunshot wound in her shoulder. It was inflamed before the surgery. Two branches were stabbed into her back. The wounds got inflamed before the surgery too. Her ribs are broken...","\"...The patient insisted on local anesthesia, so there’s only disinfection in the intravenous prescription. There’s no pain relief.\"","As the medical staff explained, Xia Jinyuan held the armrest of the wheelchair so tightly that the veins on the back of his hands were popping out. His joints were pale.","The doctor from Xiang City looked through Ye Jian’s medical records and realized that there were no painkillers in the medicine listed. Hence, he raised his question. After receiving a reply, the doctor from Xiang City sighed softly. \"It’s said that soldiers are made of steel. I saw it for myself today.\"","\"That’s right. Professor Liang was frightened by the patient’s request. In the end, she relied on her willpower to survive. She’s young, but her willpower is so strong. It’s admirable.\"","Xia Jinyuan listened. Without needing the medical staff from Yun Province to explain, he understood why Ye Jian didn’t ask for painkillers and didn’t choose general anesthesia.","That was because his silly woman was afraid that she would go back on her word and that he would be anxious if he had to wait any longer for her.","\"Don’t worry, I’m fine.\"","A soft hand was placed on the back of his hand. She patted the back of his hand and said happily with a faint smile, \"The doctor said that with my physique, I’ll recover in eight to nine days.\"","\"There was a medical staff member accompanying me along the way, and the flight attendants took care of me. My wounds didn’t split open, and I didn’t bleed. I’m fine.\""]},{"number":4780,"title":"Chapter 4780: Know Her, Understand Her, Love Her","paragraphs":["Captain Xia wouldn’t believe her if she said that everything was well. Ye Jian blinked and lowered her voice. \"It’s just a little painful.\"","Xia Jinyuan, who couldn’t bear to scold her, couldn’t bear to do it even more now. He wished that he could take out his heart and put it in her hands.","\"My silly girl...\"","All his heartache disappeared with a sigh. Of course, it hurt. How could it not hurt?","\"You have to be obedient. You have to obey whatever the doctor says. Tell me immediately if you feel uncomfortable or in pain. Don’t force yourself.","\"Let’s go to the hospital first and let the doctor do a detailed check-up.\"","His gentle and deep voice made the accompanying nurse blush slightly.","Ye Jian naturally listened obediently. If she didn’t, she was worried that Captain Xia, who rarely got angry at her, would get angry.","After the medical staff finished speaking, Commissar Yue, the director, and the escorting narcotics officer were almost done speaking too. Seeing that Ye Jian had already gotten into the ambulance, the narcotics officer smiled and said, \"We’ll catch a plane back to Yun Province tomorrow morning. We won’t disturb you in the city. Although we really want to attend Little Ye’s graduation ceremony, we have many things to do. We have no choice but to miss it.","\"I’ll go over and say a few words to Little Ye. I’ll have to trouble your school to take over from now on.\"","Ye Jian knew that the narcotics officer who sent her back to Xiang City would be rushing for tomorrow’s morning flight. As Ye Jian needed to be sent to the hospital, the narcotics officer only gave a few reminders before ending the conversation.","When the ambulance door closed, Xia Jinyuan saw the narcotics officer saluting toward the vehicle. Ye Jian, who was talking to the doctor with her head lowered, didn’t see it, but he did.","He would represent Ye Jian and return the salute.","When they reached Xiang City, Ye Jian didn’t have to worry about anything. Xia Jinyuan handled everything alone. The results of the hospital checkup were good. There was no bleeding or splitting of the wounds. Ye Jian saw the tense expression of her lover, who had been accompanying her, finally easing. She smiled, and her eyes were curved like the moon.","\"Oh, you.\"","Xia Jinyuan’s gentle palm rubbed the top of Ye Jian’s head. Ye Jian used her left hand to gently tug the corner of his shirt. Her clear eyes were filled with pleas.","What was she asking for?","Xia Jinyuan understood everything.","She wanted to go back to Xiang City even though she was so injured. She didn’t want to miss her graduation ceremony. Tomorrow, she would be separated from her classmates whom she had spent the last four years with. And she hadn’t gone to school for the entire semester. It wouldn’t make sense if she didn’t attend the graduation ceremony.","The doctor’s expression changed several degrees when he heard this.","The two leaders, the political commissar and the dean, were very happy at first. It was good news that her wounds were fine after the bumpy journey.","When Xia Jinyuan represented Ye Jian and told the two leaders that Ye Jian would be participating in the graduation ceremony tomorrow, two reprimands sounded at the same time.","Ye Jian, who was waiting inside, felt her heart tremble when she heard that. She felt that pushing Captain Xia out to inform the two leaders in advance was a wise move.","At this moment, it was up to her boyfriend to be awesome and exciting!","Obviously, as her boyfriend, Xia Jinyuan was very awesome. He invited a doctor to explain to the two leaders whose faces were ashen as they didn’t agree with Ye Jian leaving the hospital tomorrow.","Half an hour later, Xia Jinyuan was the first to enter the ward. He looked helplessly at the woman who was sleeping soundly on the bed. His resignation disappeared.","Forget it. It was rare for his little fox to be wilful. He would listen to her.","After understanding the situation in the hospital, the two leaders knew that Ye Jian had fallen asleep, so they didn’t disturb her anymore. They reminded Xia Jinyuan to take good care of her and told him that if he couldn’t take good care of her, he could ask a nurse for help."]},{"number":4781,"title":"Chapter 4781: This Is Eternal","paragraphs":["How could Xia Jinyuan get the help of others to take care of his own lover? Naturally, he said that he could do it alone without any difficulties.","Ye Jian, who had stayed up all the way back to Xiang City, finally fell asleep with the help of painkillers. She was covered in injuries, so she couldn’t lie down flat. The bed was tilted to 45 degrees, so she could only sleep sideways.","Fortunately, her back, which was stabbed by tree branches, was on the same side as the gunshot wound on her shoulder. Although her ribs were broken, she could still fall asleep if she lay slightly on her side. She was just not used to it.","Xia Jinyuan was worried that Ye Jian would press on her wounds when she was asleep, so he didn’t sleep. He sat by the bed and looked at the person who was sleeping gently. He silently watched her beautiful face. His empty heart was finally filled.","Her voice and smile had already scattered all his panic and fear. He was unprecedentedly satisfied.","His slender fingers slowly caressed her picturesque eyebrows and nose tip. Then, he slowly caressed her cheek. His fingers brushed past the fine and uneven new injuries. His unfathomable eyes were filled with heartache.","He placed his hands on the top part of the bed and leaned over slowly. His thin lips were close to Ye Jian’s. He kissed her soft lips and closed his eyes for a long time.","\"Little fox, how much have you suffered in the past five months? After coming back from the province... you must’ve gone overseas to do undercover combat, right?\"","...","On the bed, the young and handsome lieutenant colonel was full of gentleness as he accompanied the injured woman and muttered softly. No one came to disturb them. No one walked around. It was like there were only the two of them in this world. One slept peacefully while the other accompanied her peacefully.","In the car, Commissar Yue, who was a little tired, massaged his throbbing temples and spoke to the dean of the department in a low voice, \"Little Ye is seriously injured. It’s obvious that she wasn’t injured during training, but the military still hid it.\"","\"It’s normal. A good student was out on business for almost five months. It’s to be expected that she came back with injuries. I’m afraid it wasn’t convenient for the military to tell our school in detail.\"","\"Little Ye is very outstanding. The military chose her long ago. A few commanders-in-chief who have seen Little Ye hope that Little Ye can join them after graduation. Our school doesn’t even need to do anything. The military will approach Ye Jian first.\"","\"Now that I see the injured Little Ye, Old Yue, I suspect that Little Ye has fulfilled her wish in advance.\"","The dean’s sigh made Commissar Yue frown. \"You mean... she’s already in?\"","\"What else? How do you explain her injuries?\"","Commissar Yue, who was no longer massaging his temples, frowned and pondered for a moment. He nodded. \"Your suspicion is valid. I’m afraid the military has already made their move.\"","\"A good talent will shine wherever they go. Now that her wish has been fulfilled, she’ll be like a fish in water.\"","The dean smiled bitterly and shook his head. \"A good talent will shine wherever they go. However, the path she chose is too dangerous. It’s really worrying.\"","Commissar Yue said, \"We’ll respect her choice. The path of a soldier is difficult to begin with, and Little Ye is very outstanding. Now that she has taken the most difficult path, she’ll shine with the outstanding qualities of the current generation of soldiers.","\"I support her. I hope that she’ll have greater achievements in the future and use her abilities to serve the country. Only then will she not let down her military uniform.\"","Political Commissar Yue, who came from the field military unit, supported Ye Jian’s choice. He felt that soldiers needed to train well to shine. If they just wanted peace, the military unit wouldn’t welcome them.","After a pause, Commissar Yue seemed to remember something. His expression turned exceptionally serious. \"This isn’t right!\""]},{"number":4782,"title":"Chapter 4782: Discovered","paragraphs":["Commissar Yue’s expression was so serious that the director’s body trembled. The director’s facial expressions turned exceptionally serious too. \"What’s wrong?\"","\"Those two’s relationship isn’t right!\" Commissar Yue said with a serious expression. \"There’s a problem. There’s something fishy!\"","...","It was a false alarm!","He thought that something was wrong with Little Ye’s injuries and the doctor was hiding something from them.","After catching his breath, the dean smiled and said, \"What’s wrong with that? There’s nothing wrong with a senior taking care of his junior.\"","Did Commissar Yue only notice it now?","It was too late. Way too late.","It was obvious that Xia Jinyuan had already won over Little Ye. If he didn’t know Xia Jinyuan’s personality, as the dean, he would’ve immediately gone over and reminded Little Ye to stay away from him.","A senior taking care of his junior. Hahaha!","Commissar Yue finally reacted. He smelled something amiss and narrowed his eyes slightly. \"What a cunning old man. Tell me, what are you hiding? How can you say that there’s nothing wrong with such a strange relationship?\"","The dean laughed. \"Political Commissar, it’s too late for you to say anything now that they’ve already graduated. I’m not hiding anything. I see everything you see. As for what’s wrong or not, that’s up to the young people.","\"Let’s not care about it. Isn’t everything fine now? Don’t you think so?\"","Commissar Yue snorted. \"You said that you’re not hiding anything. If she hadn’t graduated, I would definitely...\"","\"Definitely what? Everyone can see Little Ye’s performance during her four years of military school. Even if there was something wrong, it didn’t affect her. On the contrary, she’s very outstanding. She’s so outstanding that she went out for work before graduating and came back with injuries. What can you do in such a situation apart from praising her?\"","The dean absolutely adored Ye Jian, and Xia Jinyuan was his favorite student. He knew him very well. Although he just realized the truth as well, he had never thought of breaking up the couple.","\"Old fox, do you think I don’t know your selfishness? That lieutenant colonel called Xia Jinyuan was your favorite student in the past. I suspect that you were the one who encouraged him to get together with Ye Jian!\"","\"I’m innocent, Political Commissar. They like each other. Why do I need to do anything? You’ve done too much political thinking. You’re too paranoid. There can’t be distrust internally. We have to trust each other.\"","\"As if I’ll believe you!\"","The sky outside the car window was already turning bright. Commissar Yue turned around and looked at the hospital behind the car. After a long time, he shook his head and smiled before retracting his gaze.","What could he do?","He could only praise Ye Jian.","She had good taste too. It was just that... Alas, it was too early for her to find a boyfriend!","He was still thinking of introducing someone to her after she graduated!","In the end...","Someone had already made the first move!","Fortunately, the person she liked was not bad. They were from the same school. Forget it, there was no need for him to be an evil person.","With Ye Jian’s early performance as a foundation, Commissar Yue was magnanimous enough to let the two of them off. But he was very concerned about Ye Jian’s future arrangements. He said to the dean of the department, \"I heard that Little Ye’s class hasn’t taken any graduation photos yet. That’s because they want to wait for Little Ye to come back.\"","\"That’s right. Their class has always been united, and the students have a deep relationship. After the morning exercise, go to their class and remind them. They shouldn’t rush over when they see Little Ye returning to school. We don’t want an accident happening.\"","If the doctor hadn’t given the green light and said that Ye Jian could attend the graduation ceremony as long as she was careful and didn’t move around too much, he would never have agreed.","At the mention of Ye Jian’s class, the smile in the dean’s eyes deepened. \"Okay, I’ll inform them. I’ll tell them the news that Little Ye will be returning to school today. The students who have been waiting for a few months will surely be happy.\""]},{"number":4783,"title":"Chapter 4783: Good News","paragraphs":["When they talked about Ye Jian and the students, Political Commissar Yue, who had been awake the entire night, became interested. \"Why are you still worried?\"","Commissar Yue didn’t walk around the school often. Other than going on business trips, he sometimes had to go to the military unit. Hence, he didn’t know much about the students as compared to the dean, who was in charge of the school most of the time.","Even among colleagues, they would chat about daily matters together after becoming close.","The dean scratched his head. He looked resigned, but he was actually happy. \"I’ve been questioned by the students in Ye Jian’s class until my hair has turned white, especially that student called Xu Wen. After seeing her a few times, I quickly learned to avoid her.\"","At the mention of this, Commissar Yue was elated. He even slapped his thigh. As a soldier, even the political commissar was bold. \"This is a good thing. It means that Little Ye is very popular in the class.\"","\"It’s not just her popularity. She’s the glue between the students in the class. All the instructors who teach them are satisfied with them. They praise them endlessly. Alas, we can’t keep such good talent in the school. What a loss!\"","\"We can’t force her. She’s made a very good choice. You should stop sighing. I haven’t even pursued you for not stopping a student from falling in love and getting into a relationship. Instead, you seem happy to see it happen!\"","\"Hahaha, Old Yue, don’t you think the two of them are quite compatible? They’re a match made in heaven.\"","Commissar Yue smiled too. He was right. They were indeed compatible. They were pleasing to the eye.","It even gave people the feeling that this was how it should be. That was why he didn’t feel that it was abrupt at all.","There were too many single people in the military school. After graduating, they had to worry about finding a girlfriend. With Little Ye’s appearance, character, and knowledge, she had attracted the hearts of many male students.","Now, she had been snatched away by her senior who was several years older than her.","Tsk, those male students who secretly wanted to woo Ye Jian after graduating would cry to their hearts’ content!","Graduation was sad. It was a good opportunity for them to cry. It was beneficial for their physical and mental development to recognize reality in advance.","As expected of the political commissar. Even his mindset and perspective was different.","At 5:00 am the trumpet of the military school sounded. The new day of training for all the students began.","As for the fourth-year students, this was their last training in school. When the horn sounded, all the fourth-year students gathered at the fastest speed.","\"Forward and back! At ease, attention!\"","The command sounded. The sun had yet to rise, but the entire training ground of the National Science University was already in full swing.","The students from Ye Jian’s class started warming up. They surrounded the sports ground and ran three kilometers first.","The temperature in the morning was just right, and there was a slight cold wind blowing. Xu Wen and He Jing ran steadily. When they passed by a few male students, the male students slowed down and called out to the two girls to stop.","The two of them slowed down and quietly listened to the male students.","The question made the two of them feel even more depressed. The lively Xu Wen was acting extremely abnormally today. She pursed her lips and didn’t answer.","He Jing lowered her eyes and replied to the male students in a low voice, \"We don’t have any news either. She didn’t come today. I’m afraid... she won’t be participating.\"","\"Ye Jian is the only one missing from our graduation photo.\" The male students’ mood dropped a lot. They were all waiting for Ye Jian’s return and even postponed the graduation photo that they should have taken. They didn’t want Ye Jian to be missing from the only photo of all their comrades.","They had been waiting and looking forward to it. However, as the graduation ceremony was nearing, there was still no news of Ye Jian after she left the campus. They felt more and more disappointed.","If Ye Jian didn’t come for today’s graduation ceremony... she would be the only one missing in the group photo."]},{"number":4784,"title":"Chapter 4784: Friendship","paragraphs":["Other than hoping that Ye Jian would come back, some male students had other thoughts. The students in the dormitory would more or less know about these thoughts.","Seeing a few male students running with He Jing and Xu Wen, Wei Jiaming ran to Liu Yang’s side and whispered, \"Hurry up and listen to what He Jing said. We’ve already graduated. If you don’t say it, you won’t have a chance to say it in the future!","\"There are many more single guys in the military unit than in our school. Do you plan to keep it a secret for the rest of your life?\"","Liu Yang was a male student whom Ye Jian had saved from a few hooligans. He fell in love with her at that moment and had been crushing on her for four years.","Besides him, there were a few male students in the class who were also interested in Ye Jian.","In the past, they thought that Song Zhiqiu liked Ye Jian too. Once, Liu Yang was even comforted by Wei Jiaming, Ge Jinglin, and the rest. They all thought that Liu Yang had no hope and that Ye Jian would definitely choose Song Zhiqiu.","The boys were later flabbergasted. Song Zhiqiu actually liked Xu Wen. The news was really stimulating. The male students who thought they had no chance were thrilled.","Unexpectedly, they started having thoughts about Ye Jian again. However, she didn’t come to school for a semester and even missed the exam!","Liu Yang was gentle and had good personality traits. Wei Jiaming quickly asked Liu Yang to hear if there was any news so that he could gain the upper hand.","Liu Yang, who didn’t have the guts in the past but had gotten bolder now, thanked him and quickly chased after He Jing.","\"There’s no news from the department either. Wen and I have looked for the dean a few times, but the answers we received were always the same. He always asks us to wait a little longer.\" He Jing’s expression was a little melancholic as she ran. Ye Jian, who was supposed to be with them, had been gone for a few months. How could she not be worried?","Liu Yang didn’t hear the start. He only heard ’wait a little longer’ and knew that there was still no news of Ye Jian. His eyes were dim, and his shoulders collapsed a little.","\"Don’t be discouraged. There’s no news now, but you can wait till there’s news about her and then pursue her. It’s the same for everyone, so shouldn’t you be happy about it? Everyone is the same. It’s fair.\"","Wei Jiaming, who wanted to be a clerk, was good at talking. With a few words, he managed to persuade Liu Yang. The two of them ran and talked as they completed their last morning run in school.","When the other male students saw this, they didn’t ask anymore. They couldn’t get any more news.","When Song Zhiqiu saw that his girlfriend, Xu Wen, was in a low mood, he didn’t comfort her.","He was also looking forward to Ye Jian’s return. From the start of school until graduation, he hadn’t seen her.","He didn’t know when she would come back. If she came back any later, other than the 14 comrades who had passed the postgraduate entrance examination and would still be in school, she would miss out on seeing her other comrades who would’ve already gone their separate ways. At that time, she would probably be very sad.","\"Don’t cry. We’ll definitely have a chance to meet in the future. Didn’t you say that her home is in the capital city? You’re from the capital city too. You might bump into each other during the holidays. Be happy and don’t cry.\"","Xu Wen, who was crying, wiped her eyes. She was so disappointed that she couldn’t even smile. \"Jian hasn’t replied to me. I’m not in the mood to be happy. She has been away for a few months, and there’s no news of her. We couldn’t even meet in school, what more after graduation?!\"","Speaking of this, Song Zhiqiu’s mood got even worse. That was right. They didn’t even have the chance to meet in school, what more after graduation?","After the morning training ended, the instructor didn’t ask the students in Ye Jian’s class to leave immediately. Based on past experience, it was definitely not a good thing if they couldn’t leave after the training!"]},{"number":4785,"title":"Chapter 4785: Good News","paragraphs":["Although Xu Wen, He Jing, and the other students were in low spirits, they still held their heads high and remembered that they were soldiers who could not bend their backs.","They couldn’t be reprimanded by their instructor on their last day of training! Today was also their graduation ceremony!","They lined up neatly. The students in the front row suddenly saw the dean walking toward their class, and he was smiling. Xu Wen, who was at the front, seemed to have thought of something, and her eyes lit up.","If not for her discipline, she would have nudged He Jing’s arm and said her guess.","She wasn’t the only one whose eyes lit up. When they saw the smiling dean, all the students’ eyes lit up.","\"It’s as if there are lanterns in your eyes. It seems that you all know what I want to say.\" The smiling dean stood in front of the class and ignited all the students’ enthusiasm.","There was only happiness!","Hahaha, Ye Jian was back!","She was back for the graduation ceremony!","Hahaha...","They were so happy!","The entire class was in an uproar. That happiness caused the other fourth-year students to raise their heads and look at each other. The military school was very disciplined. Even if they wanted to ask what had happened, they wouldn’t go over. They could only wait until they met after this.","Thus, the news of Ye Jian, who had been away for a semester, returning to school today for the graduation ceremony spread during breakfast.","Ye Jian was a famous person in school. Everyone thought that it was not a big deal to miss classes for a week, two weeks, or a month. She was in her fourth year and had more opportunities to go out for work. It was normal.","However, after missing classes for an entire semester, no matter how unconcerned the students were about Ye Jian, they would more or less hear about her from the other students who were concerned about Ye Jian.","The official news was that Ye Jian had gone for an internship in the company. But who would believe that she would go for an internship in the company for the entire semester?","There was one good thing about the military school. It was hard to spread rumors. Once the source was found, the student’s name would be recorded and they would be expelled from school. Hence, even though Ye Jian had been absent from school for the entire semester, there were no bad rumors about her.","Now that they suddenly knew that Ye Jian was back, those students who wanted to take a photo with Ye Jian were happy.","The graduation ceremony would start at 9:00 am. It was 7:00 am now, which meant that they would see Ye Jian in an hour.","\"Will Ye Jian represent the graduates?\"","\"Yes, they’ve reserved a seat for her.\"","\"She’s the most outstanding student in our batch.\"","\"Hahaha, are you jealous?\"","\"F*ck, who would be jealous of someone like her? If it were anyone else but her, I’d definitely be jealous.\"","\"Unfortunately, she didn’t take the postgraduate entrance examination. If she took the postgraduate entrance examination and then went for her PhD, her military rank would be higher and she would have more opportunities.\"","\"Even if she doesn’t study for a PhD, she would be directly awarded military ranks without having to go through an internship.\"","Students from the military school were not awarded military ranks on the day they graduated. Instead, they would be assigned to a company for an internship period. They would first wear a bar epaulet to the company and would be awarded military ranks after three months or half a year.","Even if an Outstanding Student graduated with a military rank, they would still have an internship period.","Ye Jian had been awarded as an Outstanding Student every semester in her four years of military school. She even received third-class honors. These could be used as a reference for her graduation military rank.","At 7:00 am, the leaders of the military arrived at the school. The leaders of the school first introduced the Outstanding Students, including Ye Jian.","Major General Yang knew Ye Jian better than the school leaders. His briefcase contained Ye Jian’s medals of honor, including two third-class merits and two second-class merits.","That meant that when Ye Jian was still a student, she had already received three third-class honors and two second-class honors.","This was a height that even Xia Jinyuan didn’t reach when he was a student."]},{"number":4786,"title":"Chapter 4786: Merit","paragraphs":["\"Ye Jian performed outstandingly during her studies and made many contributions. After discussion, the military decided to make an exception and give Ye Jian the military rank of lieutenant on the day of her graduation ceremony.\"","In the conference room, Major General Yang, who was representing the military to attend the graduation ceremony of the fourth-year students, explained his intention. This was a decision made at last night’s impromptu meeting of the military. Commander Xia would personally sign the document. Major General Yang would take a plane to Xiang City at 4:00 am.","Major General Yang thought that Ye Jian should be given the military rank of major. The rank of lieutenant would simply be a misdeed to Ye Jian.","Commander Xia didn’t agree. It was already an exception to be awarded a military rank on the day of the graduation ceremony. The military rank of major would be a reward for Ye Jian, but the other students might see it as an incentive and that wouldn’t be good.","Hence, the military rank would remain unchanged, but the medal of honor that had never been awarded to Ye Jian had to be awarded this time.","The red boxes containing the medals of honor were placed on the conference table one by one and opened, which shocked the school leaders.","Two third-class honors!","Two second-class honors!","’Ye Jian, what missions did you carry out in the four years of military school?’","There was no need to mention the third-class honors.","Ye Jian actually had second-class honors!","How difficult was it to get second-class honors?","If you carried out a mission or protected the property of the people, you might get second-class honors if you were stabbed a few times and almost sacrificed, or if you needed to bring glory to the country and crush the enemies of other countries, you might get second-class honors.","That meant that Ye Jian’s life had been on the line at least twice!","The school leaders were sweating slightly. As the leaders, they didn’t know what Ye Jian had done. It was their negligence!","Major General Yang’s actions stunned the school leaders. Ye Jian, who finally had a good sleep for a few hours, returned to school energetically.","During the ward round, the doctor reminded Xia Jinyuan again and again to personally supervise and send Ye Jian to the car. Before the car drove off, he didn’t forget to remind Xia Jinyuan what to be careful of before waving his hand and letting Ye Jian get in.","Ye Jian was a little agitated. Xia Jinyuan, who had been serving her the entire time, was afraid that she would strain her wound if she was too agitated. He got into the car and pulled Ye Jian into his arms. \"Don’t be agitated. I can understand your feelings, but the situation doesn’t allow you to be too agitated. If you strain your wounds, the doctor will threaten me with a scalpel.","\"There’s also the dean of the department. I’m afraid he’ll fight me to the death. At least take care of your boyfriend’s personal safety. Don’t be agitated.\"","He spoke in a low voice so that the cab driver couldn’t hear him.","Ye Jian, who was leaning in his arms, smiled until her eyes were as bright as stars. \"Don’t worry, don’t worry. For your personal safety, I’ll definitely take care of myself.\"","It wasn’t easy for her to return to the country and participate in the graduation ceremony. She didn’t want to be reprimanded.","Xia Jinyuan returned to being as obedient as before. He avoided the gunshot wound on her shoulder and hugged her tighter. He lowered his head and kissed her ear. \"Don’t say too much.\"","Hmm?","Ye Jian was puzzled. She raised her head slightly and looked at him with a puzzled expression.","Ye Jian, who had been undercover for almost five months, was very skinny. Her face was only the size of a palm before this. It was exquisite and beautiful. Her eyes were bright and beautiful. Now, she was so skinny that her bones were protruding. Her eyes seemed even bigger, like a deer. It made people’s hearts soften.","The fine wounds on her face didn’t affect her beauty. Instead, they made her look a little delicate. She looked a little delicate and had a pair of eyes that made people’s hearts soften. It inadvertently made Xia Jinyuan hold his breath. Even his Adam’s apple moved slightly."]},{"number":4787,"title":"Chapter 4787: Sweet Reward","paragraphs":["In the past, there was still some baby fat on Ye Jian’s palm-sized face. Now that she was so skinny, all the baby fat was gone. Her already exquisite facial features became even more exquisite. Every frown and smile contained the brightness of a young lady. Although her face was pale from excessive blood loss, this paleness made her look even more delicate than a flower. Even without makeup, she was already gorgeous.","Xia Jinyuan was a normal man. Although he didn’t care about appearances, who didn’t like beautiful things? He was suddenly captivated by Ye Jian’s smile.","However...","The injuries on her face pierced his heart again. Soldiers with jungle combat experience could tell how she was injured at a glance.","His little fox had done an amazing deed. Without his help or their team’s help, she went deep into individual combat.","The little fox he had watched grow up had become a qualified special forces soldier. She had completely walked to his side.","Suppressing the pain in his heart, Xia Jinyuan lowered his eyes and looked at Ye Jian with his dark eyes. His thin lips curved slightly. \"I want you to say two words to me. Think about what they are.\"","After he finished speaking, Lieutenant Colonel Xia lowered his head and kissed Ye Jian’s lips.","It felt wonderful!","As expected, humans couldn’t go against their hearts. They had to follow their hearts.","Ye Jian wasn’t prepared for him to suddenly kiss her in the car. Her pale face turned even paler. She was so beautiful that blooming flowers appeared in his mind. \"Aren’t you supposed to let me think? What’s with all the touching?\"","\"I want to touch you, but I don’t have the chance.\" Xia Jinyuan was very sensible. \"I can’t do anything beastly.\"","Alas, the willpower he was so proud of was no different from a blade of weed in front of her. With a gentle touch, he would collapse.","After a few months of undercover work, Ye Jian realized that she had become more shy. For a moment, she didn’t know how to respond.","As they were in the car, Xia Jinyuan didn’t dare to be too presumptuous. Also, Ye Jian was injured, so Xia Jinyuan naturally knew when to stop.","Seeing his girlfriend glaring at him again, he immediately became obedient. \"Okay, okay, okay. I won’t do anything else. Just think about what two words you should be saying.\"","\"I already forgot what I said before!\"","\"You said that you would take good care of yourself. You just have to add another two words at the back.\"","Ye Jian, whose face was still red, blinked. Under his gentle gaze, Ye Jian quickly thought of what the words were.","\"You’re trying to take advantage of me by making me say it.\" Although she said that, Ye Jian still did as he wished.","Xia Jinyuan lowered his head, waiting to hear the words he wanted to hear most.","\"Good girl. I’ll give you a reward if you do it.\"","Ye Jian raised her left hand and pinched his waist secretly. Xia Jinyuan laughed heartily.","Fortunately, the cab driver had seen the world and was calm. He didn’t even turn his head and drove his car steadily.","\"I’ll take care of myself for you.\"","The narrow-minded Lieutenant Colonel Xia was finally satisfied.","Soon, they arrived at the National Science University. The scenery along the way became more and more familiar. The memories of the four years in the military school surged into Ye Jian’s mind.","Four years ago, Xia Jinyuan wasn’t her lover when school started and he accompanied her to the school gate. Four years later, he was her lover. Ye Jian looked at the familiar school gate and smiled at Xia Jinyuan."]},{"number":4788,"title":"Chapter 4788: Are You Okay?","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan seemed to understand what she didn’t say in her heart. He raised his hand and rubbed her hair. The gentleness in his eyes enveloped Ye Jian like a net. He said, \"I’ll always accompany you.\"","’I will always accompany you and never abandon you.’","The weather today was not bad. The sky was as blue as a mirror, and there were no clouds for thousands of miles. The moment she got out of the car, the sense of security filled Ye Jian’s heart.","The sentinel standing guard at the door recognized Ye Jian. He was shocked to see her sitting in the wheelchair. After checking her identification documents, he asked with concern, \"Are you okay?\"","Afraid that asking too many questions would make Ye Jian uncomfortable, he used the simplest sentence to express his concern.","\"Thank you. I’m alright. I just need to rest for a while.\"","Ye Jian’s reply made the sentinel’s serious face bloom with a relaxed smile. \"That’s good, that’s good. Welcome back to school, Ye Jian!\"","Right on the heels of that, he saluted Ye Jian with a solemn facial expression.","There had to be a reason why a lieutenant colonel was pushing the wheelchair-bound Ye Jian.","Ye Jian was stunned for a moment. Then, she smiled and returned the salute.","After entering the familiar campus, Ye Jian saw the figures of the students coming and going. They were all first-year, second-year, and third-year students. The fourth-year students had already lined up and were heading to the auditorium.","Many first-year, second-year, and third-year students were familiar with the famous figure in the school, Ye Jian. All the juniors who passed by Ye Jian stopped in their tracks and watched their senior, Ye Jian, leave. They didn’t surround her and disturb her.","It wasn’t that they didn’t care. The concern in their eyes shocked them.","They didn’t discuss much. It seemed like everyone knew why their senior was injured.","Actually, they didn’t know.","However, their senior was in a wheelchair that was pushed by a young lieutenant colonel. After thinking about it, they knew that their senior was seriously injured.","Their senior, Ye Jian, had always been at a height that they could not reach.","They only had admiration for her.","Under the countless gazes, Ye Jian whispered her request to stand up and walk. However, Lieutenant Colonel Xia, her boyfriend, rejected her.","The reason for his rejection was very simple. As the representative of the Outstanding Students, she had to go on stage to speak. Having her walk while injured might delay time and make all the fourth-year students wait. It would not be good.","It was a powerful reason to reject her. Ye Jian wouldn’t mention it a second time.","However, Ye Jian felt uncomfortable being stared at by her juniors from time to time. She asked Xia Jinyuan to change to another path to the auditorium.","Xia Jinyuan knew every small path of the National Science University. He didn’t need Ye Jian to guide him and took a relatively remote path.","This was the path that Ye Jian had walked the most. Xia Jinyuan, who was pushing the wheelchair, slowed down his footsteps because he knew that this was the path that Ye Jian had walked the most.","The familiar feeling made Ye Jian’s eyes suddenly turn red. She focused on the alma mater that taught her how to grow and gave her knowledge. Her vision gradually blurred.","Soon, she would be leaving her alma mater.","Soon, she and her comrades would go their separate ways. She didn’t know when they would meet again.","Soon, she would change out of the student’s bar epaulet and draw a line with her student life.","She thought that it would take very long, but today, she realized that four years had passed very quickly.","It was time to say goodbye.","\"We’ll come back often to visit our alma mater in the future. We’ll come back together.\"","Xia Jinyuan, who had also experienced the graduation season, could understand his girlfriend’s feelings at this moment. She was sad. No one could be really happy when they were parting."]},{"number":4789,"title":"Chapter 4789: Sign","paragraphs":["Ye Jian nodded lightly. Her gaze lingered on the campus as if she wanted to carve every scenery, even if it was just a small rock, into her heart.","She heard the voices of her juniors training. Their voices were bright and full of energy. When she looked back on the past, everything had become a memory. Four years later, her classmates were all loyal to their country.","In the past, she stood on the campus and watched her seniors leave. Now, it was finally her turn.","\"Once, I came out of the laboratory after leaving my identification document in the laboratory and saw the inspectors walking over from afar. So, I went up the tree by jumping like a monkey to dodge the bullet.","\"At that time, there were still second-year seniors. They stood under the tree for a long time and didn’t come back to their senses. After the inspection, I came down from the tree and looked at the expressions of the seniors who were holding back their laughter. For a long time after that, I’d take a detour whenever I saw them. It was very embarrassing.","\"This is the place where Xu Wen, He Jing, and I come the most. After dinner, we’d take a walk and discuss topics. I rarely come here in the summer. There are too few trees. I like it in the winter. I can bask in the sun...\"","From the campus to the auditorium, every time they passed by a place, Ye Jian would tell Xia Jinyuan about her four years of beautiful memories. Xia Jinyuan would mostly smile and listen. Occasionally, he would say a few interesting things about the places.","The things he said were really interesting. He saw that his girlfriend was sad, so he specially picked some interesting and embarrassing things to talk about. Ye Jian laughed until her wound nearly opened up. If he continued, she would laugh until all her wounds opened up.","Xia Jinyuan stopped and squatted down to check if the wound on Ye Jian’s shoulder had split open.","His nervous appearance made Ye Jian feel sweet. She was exceptionally satisfied. \"How can my wounds open just from laughing? Even porcelain dolls aren’t so fragile. I need to recover quickly and report to the team as soon as possible!\"","Thinking that she would go to the Xueyu unit after graduation, the sadness of the graduation season faded a lot.","\"You’re no different from a porcelain doll in my eyes now.\" After confirming that the wound was fine, Xia Jinyuan heaved a sigh of relief. His heart, which was tightened because of her words, slowly relaxed. \"If you want to report to the team early, you have to take care of yourself.\"","Ye Jian couldn’t bear to part with him.","Even though she found it sweet that her boyfriend was concerned about her, she knew that her injuries made him worried. \"Captain Xia, I’ll work hard in the future to not get hurt. I’ll work hard to not let my man worry and be afraid. I’ll work hard to take care of myself. For the sake of the man who loves me, I’ll work hard to take care of myself.\"","She nodded her head as she spoke. She could tell that Xia Jinyuan was happy and loved her. The major general even reminded him to observe if she had any psychological trauma. After all, this was her first time fighting alone, and she had gone to a tiger’s den. If there was really a problem, they should detect it early and solve it.","From the looks of it, the major general was thinking too much.","There was no psychological trauma, but the 15 or 16-year-old Ye Jian did have one.","\"That’s right. Remember what you said just now. When we return to the military unit, I’ll prepare a document of what you just said and we’ll sign it together. If you fail to meet the conditions, I’ll definitely punish you.\"","Huh?","That was a good idea!","Ye Jian nodded in agreement. \"Okay, I’ll sign it. You too!\"","\"Of course.\" Lieutenant Colonel Xia blinked and nodded with a smile. It was obvious that there was an unspeakable purpose behind that smile.","Unfortunately, Ye Jian didn’t notice it."]},{"number":4790,"title":"Chapter 4790: Meeting","paragraphs":["It couldn’t be helped. Although she was improving day by day, Lieutenant Colonel Xia was still slightly better.","While the two of them were talking affectionately, they could see the main entrance of the auditorium, which was where the graduation ceremony was taking place.","All the fourth-year students were lined up neatly. They split into groups and walked into the auditorium. Although there were many stone steps, the green figures of the soldiers walking in a straight line formed the most beautiful scenery.","Ye Jian looked at her hospital gown and couldn’t help but feel a little out of place. She needed to hurry up and put on the military uniform.","\"Do you need to go to the bathroom?\"","She had been on IV drips from 4:00 am to 6:00 am and refused to get out of bed as it was convenient with a urine bag. If five bottles of IV drips had flowed into her blood vessels, her bladder would be quite full.","There was a nurse to help her use the bathroom in the hospital. Now that they had reached the school, Xia Jinyuan was worried about asking a female student for help. He planned to escort her himself.","Ye Jian, who was thinking of wearing her military uniform as soon as possible, suddenly heard what he said. She felt herself getting choked. \"Later... Cough, I’ll ask Xu Wen and He Jing for help later. Don’t worry.\"","\"I’m worried about leaving you in their care.\" Xia Jinyuan could tell what she was thinking at a glance. The little fellow was shy again. \"With our relationship, it’s normal for a boyfriend to serve his injured girlfriend in the bathroom.","\"There’s no one in the bathroom. I’ll accompany you.\" Without giving Ye Jian a chance to reject, he pushed the wheelchair over.","...","Five minutes later, Ye Jian sat back in her wheelchair with a red face. Fortunately, there was no one around. If other students had seen her, she would definitely want to find a hole to crawl into.","Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who was upright just a moment ago and thought that there was nothing wrong with what they were doing, was now blushing.","Saying it and doing it were indeed two different things!","He thought that it was a simple thing to do, but in fact, his hands were shaking when he was serving her. It was simply... stimulating!","\"It’s awkward because it’s the first time. Next time will be fine.\" Lieutenant Colonel Xia, whose handsome face was slightly red, comforted her. Ye Jian was so embarrassed that she wanted to cover her face.","She squeezed out a voice from her throat that was as soft as a mosquito. \"I’ll do it myself next time. I won’t let you help again.\"","Xia Jinyuan, who was carrying her on his back, smiled. That was not up to her.","There was only one more class waiting to enter the venue. Xia Jinyuan pushed Ye Jian into the auditorium through the logistics passageway.","Backstage in the auditorium, Xu Wen and He Jing were looking forward to Ye Jian’s arrival. From time to time, they would walk to the door to see if Ye Jian had arrived.","The dean of the department told them that they should remember to bring Ye Jian’s student uniform so that Ye Jian could save time and change into her uniform in the hall. The two of them rushed to the backstage changing room early and waited, but Ye Jian was still nowhere to be seen.","\"It’s only five minutes away from 8:00 am. Why isn’t Jian here yet? Don’t tell me she has something on midway and won’t be attending the graduation ceremony?\" Xu Wen, whose heart was a mess, couldn’t help but run to the door to look around. She still didn’t see a familiar figure and became a little anxious.","He Jing said, \"No, the dean said that Jian will come.\"","\"But...\" Xu Wen, who was looking around again, suddenly widened her eyes. She was elated. \"Jian!\"","With a whoosh, she turned into a gust of wind and rushed out of the changing area. He Jing rushed out too. The two of them ’braked’ almost at the same time.","Their Jian... was sitting in a wheelchair!","No wonder the dean told them to be mentally prepared. When they saw Ye Jian, they shouldn’t be rash and pounce on her because of excitement. It turned out that... Ye Jian was injured."]},{"number":4791,"title":"Chapter 4791: Petty","paragraphs":["\"Ye Jian’s shoulders, lower back, and left and right calves are all injured. When the two of you are helping her to change, please be gentler. You can’t bend, stretch, or pull her arms. It’ll cause the wounds to open.\"","Before Ye Jian entered the changing room to change out of her clothes, Xia Jinyuan reminded Xu Wen and He Jing carefully. His serious expression made their hearts pound and their eyes turn red.","When they helped Ye Jian take off her hospital gown and saw that her limbs, waist, chest, and shoulders were all tied with snow-white bandages, the two of them held back their tears.","\"Why... Why are you injured like this...\" Xu Wen’s trembling fingers were extremely light, like feathers stroking the bandages on Ye Jian’s shoulder. \"Does it hurt? Does it hurt...\"","Her voice was choked up, and her tears were flowing.","Ye Jian smiled and shook her head. \"It’s alright. I didn’t even know it hurt at that time, let alone now. Don’t cry. If you continue crying, your eyes will swell.\"","He Jing, who was silently wiping her tears, said softly, \"Wen, don’t waste any time. Help Jian put on her shirt. The air conditioner is very cold.\"","How could it not hurt when she was injured so badly?","However, Jian had always been able to endure it. No matter how much it hurt, she would endure it and say that it didn’t hurt. She wouldn’t let her comrades worry.","\"Okay, okay...\"","Xu Wen retracted her hand. She didn’t even wipe her tears and quickly helped Ye Jian put on her clothes.","A pacing sound came from outside. Xu Wen sniffled to liven up the atmosphere. \"Jian, your boyfriend is so handsome that we feel inferior. Just now, you said that the two of us would change your clothes for you. Just as the two of us nodded, his gaze shot over like a knife. I almost surrendered and offered to let him take over.","\"We snatched his job. Is he very angry now? What a narrow-minded fellow.\"","\"He’s not narrow-minded? He’s worried that the two of us will hurt Jian.\" He Jing secretly glared at Xu Wen. Did she not know how to speak? Those who didn’t know better would think that Jian’s boyfriend was really narrow-minded.","Xu Wen stuck out her tongue, and He Jing rolled her eyes.","Ye Jian pursed her lips and said in embarrassment, \"Don’t take it to heart. He doesn’t even trust the nurses and wants to handle my intravenous injections personally.\"","\"Fortunately, I have Song Zhiqiu. If not, I’d vomit blood just from listening to your words. How lovey-dovey of you two...\"","\"Be more reserved. There’s a leader outside,\" He Jing reminded her softly. The corners of her mouth twitched.","\"So what if he’s a leader? We’re Jian’s classmates. Shouldn’t he treat us well? Song Zhiqiu is so honest in front of you. He’s afraid that you’ll take me away one day.\" Xu Wen raised her eyebrows. She didn’t find it embarrassing at all.","Xia Jinyuan, who was outside, was speechless. He raised his hand and rubbed his forehead. He regretted not insisting on changing Ye Jian’s clothes himself.","Why did he feel that this female student was unreliable?","Fortunately, the other female student seemed more mature. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have agreed.","Ye Jian didn’t like to talk about other people behind their backs. She wouldn’t say much about other people even in front of Xia Jinyuan. Even if she did, she would only talk about the interesting things they did together.","As a result, Xia Jinyuan didn’t know Xu Wen’s and He Jing’s personalities well.","There was no need to say too much. He would know a thing or two in a few words.","Xu Wen was carefree and knew her limits. He Jing was steady and tolerant. Ye Jian was gentle and cold. The three completely different personalities shared the same dorm. They tolerated each other and complemented each other. Naturally, their relationship was very good."]},{"number":4792,"title":"Chapter 4792: Repeat","paragraphs":["Although Xu Wen and He Jing were talking and laughing in the changing room, their eyes were wet. They carefully helped Ye Jian change her clothes the entire time. They even helped Ye Jian put on her socks despite Ye Jian’s protests.","The graduation ceremony had already started in the auditorium. Ye Jian, who had changed into her military uniform, no longer appeared sick. The light in her that was originally restrained couldn’t be covered up even when she was sitting in the wheelchair. It couldn’t hide her killing aura of a soldier either.","Behind her, Xu Wen and He Jing, who were wearing the military uniforms of the students, also exuded the aura of soldiers, but they were still lacking something compared to Ye Jian. Even if Ye Jian was sitting in a wheelchair, other people would notice her at first glance.","Xia Jinyuan, who was waiting at the door, walked over. He bent over and helped Ye Jian put on her soldier cap. \"Not bad. You look energetic.\"","\"Of course. The Publicity Committee is always looking for Ye Jian. They want to take photos of her to promote the campus, but Jian has never agreed.\"","\"Our Jian is the most suitable person to wear a military uniform.\"","She had a good temperament, good looks, a soldier’s posture, and great ability. The lieutenant colonel had won the jackpot!","Even though his girlfriend was being complimented, Xia Jinyuan couldn’t bring himself to feel happy.","Our Jian? Ha, she was his little fox!","After thanking the two of them, Xia Jinyuan pushed the wheelchair again. Occasionally, he leaned close to Ye Jian’s ear and whispered, \"You’re mine, not theirs.\"","Ye Jian smiled at him helplessly. \"Captain Xia, aren’t you a little too narrow-minded? Huh?\"","\"I was already generous enough just now. I gave up the chance to serve you. Why do you still think that I’m petty?\" Xia Jinyuan felt aggrieved for not being able to change his girlfriend’s clothes himself.","Xu Wen, who was in a neat military uniform, secretly rolled her eyes. This lieutenant colonel, ha! Did he think she didn’t know his words were meant for her?","How petty!","She had never seen such a narrow-minded lieutenant colonel!","He Jing lowered her head and smiled.","He was quite good.","It was obvious that the lieutenant colonel cared a lot about Jian. From the way he looked at Jian, it was not difficult to tell that as long as Jian was around, there was no one else in his eyes.","\"Let’s go back to class first. See you later.\" He Jing put on her soldier cap and turned to talk to Ye Jian. \"All the best. The entire class is waiting for you to speak.\"","\"Wrong. It’s all the fourth-year students, especially the male students who come to our class every few days to ask if Jian has returned to school. All the best, Jian!\" Xu Wen said with a smile. At the same time, she observed the narrow-minded Lieutenant Colonel’s expression from the corner of her eyes.","She failed. She only saw the other party’s flawless and elegant smile. There was no other expression on his face.","Hmph!","She wouldn’t say any more!","Xu Wen pulled He Jing away.","After the two of them left, Xia Jinyuan said helplessly, \"Fortunately, you’re graduating soon. If not, I’d be worried that she’d lead you astray.\"","Ye Jian smiled and said, \"Xu Wen is very smart. She might be a jumpy person, but she never talks nonsense. Previously, she had a good impression of you and even said that I won the lottery by finding such a handsome boyfriend.","Xia Jinyuan raised his eyebrows. \"What about you? Did you agree to it or deny it?\"","\"Of course... I agreed,\" she replied. Her playful look made Xia Jinyuan’s smile stay on his handsome face for a long time.","After coming out of the changing area, Xia Jinyuan pushed the wheelchair to a corner of the backstage where the entire graduation ceremony could be seen. As soon as the two of them appeared, an instructor immediately welcomed them.","This was the instructor of Ye Jian’s class, equivalent to the head teacher.","When he saw Ye Jian, the instructor sized her up. Then, he patted Ye Jian’s shoulder and smiled. \"Good job! This is how a soldier should be. The school is proud of you!\""]},{"number":4793,"title":"Chapter 4793: Going On Stage","paragraphs":["Ye Jian wasn’t used to being praised. She was used to keeping a low profile and didn’t want to publicize her matter.","After chatting with the instructor for a while, Ye Jian asked, \"The class doesn’t know about my situation, right?\"","The instructor knew Ye Jian well. The moment she asked, he knew what she was thinking. He couldn’t help but laugh. \"It’s good for you to keep a low profile, but you can’t keep a low profile for everything.","\"We won’t ask how you got injured, but we can’t hide the fact that you’re injured. Also, the military will reward you with a huge surprise.\"","\"Can I refuse the surprise?\"","\"Are you sure you can reject the military’s decision?\"","Ye Jian was silent. Of course, she couldn’t.","As he spoke, the instructor secretly sized up the young lieutenant colonel who only introduced himself briefly. Xia Jinyuan, who was not afraid of being sized up, allowed the instructor to size him up. He was not as cautious as before.","It was time for him to bask in the sun. Was he afraid that the instructor would find out?","He wasn’t afraid, and he didn’t mind. He allowed the instructor to size him up secretly.","Ye Jian was able to remain calm too. She didn’t say anything until the emcee announced that the representative of the Outstanding Students was going to speak on stage. Before she even appeared, the audience applauded loudly.","Ye Jian, who didn’t want to be on the stage in a wheelchair, got up slowly with Xia Jinyuan’s help. Then, she walked slowly to the podium with the instructor’s help. \"Thank you.\"","\"I’ve been your teacher for four years. This isn’t troublesome.\" The instructor smiled and carefully helped Ye Jian out of the backstage.","The deep voice of the emcee, who was standing in the middle of the ceremonial stage, spread to every corner of the auditorium. Every word fell into the ears of the fourth-year students.","\"I believe everyone is familiar with this Outstanding Student. We’ve heard of her bravery and outstanding performance countless times in school. This time... I think all of us will be shocked by her appearance.","\"Ye Jian will be representing all Outstanding Students on stage to give a speech! Please give a round of applause!\"","Before the emcee said her name, the students below the stage already knew that Ye Jian had returned to school after disappearing for an entire semester!","Thunderous applause sounded again. The dark green figures below the stage all looked at the ceremonial stage. The applause got louder and more intense.","The applause on the rostrum was loud too. Major General Yang looked at the female soldier who walked out and felt gratified.","\"Due to special circumstances, please give the heavily injured Ye Jian some time. Thank you.\"","After the emcee finished speaking, other than He Jing and Xu Wen, all the other students below the stage were surprised. When Ye Jian appeared on the stage, the sharp military might of a sword that had been unsheathed surged toward them as she walked slowly. The students’ facial expressions turned serious. They subconsciously tensed up and sat properly.","\"I’m sorry to keep you waiting, comrades. It’s my honor to stand here and speak as a representative...\"","The slender figure on the stage was as straight as a spear. Thousands of eyes were on her, but there was no abnormality in her voice as she spoke calmly. If she hadn’t walked out extremely slowly, no one would have thought that she was heavily injured.","After speaking for only three minutes, Ye Jian slowly raised her right hand and saluted the rostrum and the audience.","Amidst the applause, Ye Jian was about to turn around and leave the stage when the emcee smiled and asked Ye Jian to stop. Major General Yang stood up."]},{"number":4794,"title":"Chapter 4794: The True Essence Of Life","paragraphs":["Ye Jian had already seen Major General Yang sitting at the rostrum when she was backstage. In addition, the instructor had been smiling and telling her that the military would give her a reward. Now that she saw Major General Yang standing up, Ye Jian suddenly had the urge to escape from the event location.","The emcee was amazing too. He saw through Ye Jian’s thoughts and teased, \"Ye Jian, why do I feel that you can’t wait to escape from this stage?\"","The students sitting below the stage laughed at the cuteness of the most famous person in the school.","The emcee knew that the students could more or less tell too.","Although Ye Jian was an influential figure in the school, she kept a low profile. She never acted frivolously because she was powerful. It didn’t seem strange for her to want to escape.","Fortunately, they were in a disciplined military school, and it was the solemn graduation ceremony. All the students followed the rules and no one whispered to each other. Although there was laughter, it stopped quickly.","The emcee continued, \"Ye Jian, are you afraid that I’ll ask you where your injuries came from? Is that why you want to leave in a hurry?\"","\"Well, you’re wrong about that. Although I do want to know where your injuries came from, I know that even if I ask, you won’t tell me, right?\"","Ye Jian, who was still holding the microphone, smiled. \"Yes, they’re just small injuries. They’re not worth mentioning.\"","Xu Wen and He Jing silently wiped the corners of their eyes.","What minor injuries? They were all serious injuries.","Major General Yang had already walked over. The emcee immediately smiled and changed the topic naturally. \"I’d better hand the microphone to the major. The rules don’t allow me to continue asking.","\"Let’s welcome Major General Yang from the military to speak on stage!\"","Amidst the neat and rhythmic applause, Major General Yang strode to the emcee’s side. The emcee and Ye Jian saluted at the same time to show their respect.","Major General Yang took the microphone and walked to Ye Jian’s side. He held the microphone and asked Ye Jian, \"Can you hold on for another three minutes?\"","\"Report, I can persevere!\" Ye Jian replied firmly.","After receiving an answer, Major General Yang faced all the students below the stage and said in a deep voice, \"I think that all the students will definitely want to know why I asked Ye Jian if she can hold on for another three minutes. As time is limited, I won’t say anything else. Please look at the photos.","\"The photos will explain everything.\"","The bright red military flag was projected on the big screen in the middle of the ceremonial stage. As Major General Yang finished speaking, the students’ gazes turned to the big screen. Ye Jian, who turned her head to look behind, was stunned.","Why were there photos?","When were they taken?","Why didn’t she know anything?","\"Don’t be nervous. This is your moment of glory. Ye Jian, the military owes you, and your glory can’t be forgotten.\"","Major General Yang turned off the microphone and spoke in a low voice that only the two of them could hear. He calmed Ye Jian down.","\"You’re too low-key. The commendation will start soon. Steady yourself, Ye Jian, and welcome your glory!\"","Ye Jian, who was still in a daze, retracted her facial expressions and replied softly, \"Sorry to trouble you and the military.\"","Major General Yang said softly, \"Sometimes, you’re really the same as Yuan. Some people fight for military merits, but in the eyes of you both, they don’t matter. You have to accept what should be yours. You don’t have to worry about it. This is how it should be.\"","Ye Jian pursed her lips and smiled. She didn’t care about military merits. The true meaning of life had nothing to do with fame or benefits."]},{"number":4795,"title":"Chapter 4795: How Fortunate","paragraphs":["Ye Jian’s glory unfolded as a bloody photo was shown on the big screen.","When the photo appeared, gasps could be heard below the stage.","It was a photo of a bullet in the shoulder. The wound was red and swollen, and the bright red skin around it was rolled up. Just looking at it made one’s heart pound.","Right on the heels of that, the second photo was displayed. It was a photo of a pair of calves. The inside and outside of the calves were badly mutilated, and strands of skin were hanging down. Two nurses were carefully cleaning the wounds.","This photo made the students below the stage tense up so much that they even held their breaths.","The third photo was shown. Some female students couldn’t help but close their eyes slightly. They couldn’t bear to look at it anymore. The male students clenched their fists secretly. They were shocked by the two bloody holes in the photo and the large area of abrasion on the person’s back.","Were these injuries... Ye Jian’s injuries?","Did she get all these injuries at the same time?","She was shot in the shoulder. Was the redness and inflammation caused by not treating it immediately?","Why didn’t she seek immediate treatment?","Was it because the conditions and environment didn’t allow it?","The wound on her back seemed to come from being pierced by something hard and then pulling it out directly. At that time, Ye Jian must have been in a lot of pain. When they saw the photo, they felt a sharp pain on their backs.","However, looking at Ye Jian, who was standing upright on the stage, they couldn’t tell that her back was injured!","\"All three photos came from the same person, and she’s standing beside me. Her back is straight, perfectly displaying the tenacity that a soldier should have!\"","As soon as Major General Yang finished speaking, the applause below the stage sounded like a tidal wave hitting the shore. Students, instructors, school leaders, instructors... All the green figures in the auditorium applauded for the young female soldier on the stage.","Before they knew anything, Ye Jian had already shouldered the responsibility of a soldier. She used her blood to complete the mission handed to her by the country.","Ye Jian, who was standing upright, closed her eyes lightly. She never thought that one day, she would let others know what she had done. But when the thunderous applause entered her ears, she was excited. The tough faces of every comrade in the Xueyu unit flashed past her mind.","She was fortunate enough to stand here today and receive applause. However, her comrades who fought alongside her were still behind the scenes. They silently dedicated themselves. Even if they died in battle or retired, no one would know.","As compared to her comrades, Ye Jian was so lucky!","The applause stopped. Major General Yang’s deep voice entered the students’ ears again. \"Let’s ignore why Ye Jian was injured for the time being. The main point is that she was able to complete the mission handed to her by the country even though she was so heavily injured. Students, please give another round of applause for Ye Jian, who isn’t afraid of making sacrifices!\"","Major General Yang adored Ye Jian.","Three third-class honors and two clueless class honors. Just these merits alone wouldn’t be enough for the students to understand Ye Jian’s honor.","Fortunately, the Yun Province’s narcotics police took photos to publicize the fact that the country’s military would not tolerate dark forces. They were not afraid of sacrifices, and they would let all the students see how much blood and sweat Ye Jian had sacrificed.","While they were still undergoing training in school and sitting in the classroom to learn, their comrade, Ye Jian, had already completed all kinds of life-or-death missions.","Next, they would let nature take its course.","\"Three third-class honors and two second-class honors! With these, I’ll make an exception and award Ye Jian the military rank of a lieutenant!\"","As Major General Yang announced, the applause seemed to be able to overturn the entire auditorium."]},{"number":4796,"title":"Chapter 4796: Share Honour And Share Together","paragraphs":["Ye Jian was the only one who was awarded a military rank on the day of graduation!","There was no jealousy or envy. Everyone gave their blessings.","The students in Ye Jian’s class were excited. They agreed that if the school leader could include one more sentence in his speech, he should add, \"The students in your class are proud of you!\"","Xu Wen clapped hard. Tears flowed down her face. Her mouth... kept moving. No one knew what she was muttering.","If one leaned closer and listened carefully, one would be able to hear what she said.","\"Outstanding Students with the military rank of lieutenant. Jian has five other military merits, but she’s only a lieutenant! Shouldn’t she be a major?\"","Although she was muttering, she was still clapping.","He Jing wasn’t as agitated as Xu Wen, but she cried more.","The military merits represented the glory of a soldier and the hard work of a soldier. They were personally worn by the school leader for Ye Jian. \"Ye Jian, you’re the pride of the National Science University. The National Science University is proud of you. You’re also a role model for all the students of the National Science University. Your spirit and your deeds are worth learning from.","\"It’s almost time for you to graduate. I hope that you can work harder and repay what you’ve learned to our country. Your future path will be even more glorious!\"","The five medals that represented Ye Jian’s blood and sweat and carried the glory of a soldier were placed on her chest. The school leader took half a step back and saluted Ye Jian, who had brought honor to the school and the country.","\"Yes!\"","Ye Jian saluted. As she raised her hand, the medals on her chest refracted a resplendent and dazzling light. It entered the eyes of all the students below the stage.","As it turned out, Ye Jian had already made countless contributions. They thought that she was just a student who received the title of ’Outstanding Student’ every semester!","They thought that Ye Jian was already very powerful in school. She was at a height that they couldn’t reach. Now, they realized that Ye Jian wasn’t just powerful in school. She was also powerful outside the school!","Back then, they would think of working hard so that they could maybe surpass Ye Jian. Now, they didn’t even dare to think about it!","They wouldn’t be able to reach where Ye Jian was for the rest of their lives!","As the school leader saluted, the applause from the audience erupted again. It only stopped after Ye Jian returned the salute.","\"Awarding military rank!\"","When the most sacred moment arrived, the students’ expressions became very serious. The atmosphere in the entire auditorium changed. It was solemn. No one dared to be impudent.","A young lieutenant colonel walked up the stage with a red satin tray with a lieutenant rank epaulet. The young lieutenant colonel was extremely handsome and elegant. His eyes were as bright as the sun, and he had the aura of a soldier that made people hold their breaths when he appeared.","He walked over and stood beside Ye Jian. There was a faint smile on his thin lips.","’I once said that I hope that in the future, I can be by your side and share everything with you, be it honor or disgrace!’","Ye Jian looked at him without blinking. Her gaze was warm.","Major General Yang personally untied the shoulder strap on Ye Jian’s shoulder and said softly, \"Outstanding Students are already given the rank of lieutenant. You’ve made five contributions, so you can be given the rank of major. However, since it’s the graduation ceremony, I can only let you suffer.\"","\"It’s good that you know that she has suffered. When she joins the military unit, please award her the military rank of major as soon as possible.\" Beside him, Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who had witnessed his girlfriend becoming an active-duty officer from a student, gritted his teeth and said, \"I’d rather the military not arrange a graduation ceremony for her!\""]},{"number":4797,"title":"Chapter 4797: Oath","paragraphs":["Major General Yang changed Ye Jian’s military rank to lieutenant and replied calmly, \"I know that you wouldn’t accept it, so I didn’t tell you before this.","\"Now that the matter is settled, it’s better for you not to be angry. Take good care of Little Ye. Don’t think that I don’t know about your relationship.\"","\"Captain Xia, I think it’s good enough. Don’t be angry.\" Ye Jian persuaded Xia Jinyuan softly.","Ye Jian had been given the lieutenant rank. Major General Yang tidied Ye Jian’s epaulet and collar. Then, he took half a step back and saluted.","As Ye Jian was the first fourth-year student to be awarded a military rank, the applause below the stage got louder.","The fourth-year students weren’t surprised that Ye Jian was awarded the lieutenant rank. Many students and Xia Jinyuan even thought that Ye Jian could definitely be a major. She fought with her life for five military merits. She could be awarded the military rank of major!","Ye Jian, who had officially become an active-duty officer, saluted the school leaders, instructors, and students who were clapping for her. She made a solemn vow under the military flag.","All the students stood up and saluted, swearing in front of the military flag.","\"...I will wholeheartedly serve the country, obey orders, strictly observe discipline, and fight bravely. I’m not afraid of sacrifices, and I’m loyal to my duties. I’ll work hard and train hard to kill my enemies. I’ll definitely complete my missions. Under no circumstances will I betray my country or the army.\"","\"Observer: Ye Jian!\"","\"Swearer: Xia Jinyuan!\"","Ye Jian’s moment of glory reached its peak. The students clapped until their palms were red. After a long time, all the students could still remember how excited they were that day. They were as excited as if they had been given military ranks.","Ye Jian’s name would forever be etched in the hearts of all the students.","On the day of graduation, she was awarded the military rank of a lieutenant. No one voiced their doubts or had any objections. Everyone was convinced.","One and a half hours later, the graduation ceremony ended. The fourth-year students left one by one. It was finally time to say goodbye.","Ye Jian, who came out in a wheelchair, was surrounded by the students. Song Zhiqiu, whose eyes were red, walked to Ye Jian’s side and smiled. \"Come, let’s take our graduation photo.\"","This time, Xia Jinyuan didn’t accompany her. This moment belonged to her classmates. There was no need for him to get close.","Xia Jinyuan stood in front of Major General Yang with a cold expression. He watched as his girlfriend was pushed away by the students in her class. He immediately said coldly, \"Major General, why did you hide it from me?\"","\"I didn’t hide it from you. Ye Jian was awarded the military rank on the day of the graduation ceremony because it was a last-minute decision last night. Don’t worry, with me around, Little Ye will get her major rank.","\"You, on the other hand, need to be vigilant. If you want to fall in love, so be it. But the rules and regulations clearly state that male and female soldiers in the same military unit are not allowed to fall in love with each other. As the captain, you know the law and broke it. You don’t know how to restrain yourself. Do you want to be implicated?!\"","Xia Jinyuan was unmoved by the major general’s sudden change of topic. His handsome face was still as cold as water. \"I will fight for the honor that belongs to her. Going from lieutenant to a major is a hurdle. I hope that it can be solved as soon as possible!","\"As for our relationship, I’m the captain in the military unit and she’s a soldier. It won’t change because of our relationship. Major General, don’t worry about that.","\"I will definitely do what I promised, and I hope that you can fight for her too. Don’t disappoint my soldier.\""]},{"number":4798,"title":"Chapter 4798: Fight","paragraphs":["At this moment, Xia Jinyuan wasn’t just fighting for Ye Jian as her boyfriend. He was fighting for his soldiers as their captain.","His soldier had fought a bloody battle. If he couldn’t even give her the honor that she deserved, how could he face her and lead her?","He would fight for what he needed to fight for. He would not let it go so easily.","Major General Yang had always admired Xia Jinyuan’s protectiveness. But sometimes, it gave him a headache.","It didn’t feel good to be urged like this.","\"Major General, you saw how bad Ye Jian’s injuries are. As for me, although I don’t know what mission she was on, with my experience, I can more or less guess.","\"Before this, she was just a military school student with a bar epaulet. She hadn’t even finished her studies and she was sent to fight alone. I think she’s the best among all the military school students.","\"Isn’t the military moved by such an outstanding student? Don’t you think that she’s rare and precious? Even the leaders of the National Science University have called for all the students to learn from Ye Jian, so shouldn’t the military reward Ye Jian?","\"What’s been offered isn’t enough to reassure the army. I hope that you can report my sincere words to the military. Please consider it carefully. My soldiers and I will wait for good news.","\"Oh, I’m sorry, Major General. I almost forgot that you’re the boss of our brigade. I’ll have to trouble you for this.\"","Major General Yang, who had a headache from Xia Jinyuan’s nagging, raised his hand and rubbed his temples. \"Don’t worry, I know what I’m doing. I won’t let my soldiers suffer.\"","After he finished speaking, he glared at Xia Jinyuan, who never backed down from a fight. Major General Yang raised his leg and kicked the lieutenant colonel who gave him a headache. \"Get lost, get lost. Don’t be an eyesore in front of me. You’re talking to me as if I’m a traitor! You’re all my soldiers. Would I let my soldiers suffer?","\"Scram. Hurry up and keep an eye on Little Ye. Don’t let them surround her all the time. Since she’s injured, she needs to rest. How can she suffer?\"","Xia Jinyuan, who avoided him easily, raised his eyebrows. \"Boss, you’re a busy man. I was afraid that you would forget, so I reminded you. You’ve always been protective of your own. We all know that.","\"In that case, I’ll thank you on the soldiers’ behalf. If there’s any good news, you have to inform me in time. I’ll get lost now. You can go back to work first.\" He raised his hand slightly and pointed behind him. \"You’re busy today.\"","The leaders of the school and the provincial military district were here as well. Major General Yang only turned around to take a look before looking back. Xia Jinyuan, who gave him a headache, had really left.","He just had one last thing to say, \"I also need your help to keep an eye on my relationship with Ye Jian.\"","...","Young brat!","What did she mean by that? He put it so nicely, but what Xia Jinyuan really wanted was for Major General Yang to help cover for them!","Major General Yang, who was angry but also amused, couldn’t do anything to Xia Jinyuan in the end. Fine, they were his soldiers, after all.","If he didn’t protect them, who would?","However, to Major General Yang’s surprise, the dean of the department and Ye Jian’s instructor had been covering for them all this while.","It made him feel useless.","The students in Ye Jian’s class gathered together nervously. Ye Jian stood in the middle, and they took their graduation photo.","Everyone knew that Ye Jian was seriously injured and couldn’t move around. When students from other classes came to take a photo with Ye Jian, they were politely rejected. After Ye Jian took the graduation photo, she took more photos with the students whom she was about to part with.","At 10:30 am, Xia Jinyuan pushed Ye Jian out of the campus. Behind him were her comrades who watched her leave."]},{"number":4799,"title":"Chapter 4799: Injector","paragraphs":["The back view of the young lieutenant colonel gradually turned into a black dot. The back view of the tall and big lieutenant colonel pushing Ye Jian away with a gentle gaze was forever engraved in the students’ hearts.","Liu Yang stood at the front. He, who was talking and laughing, slowly retracted his gaze. The light in his eyes had turned dim.","\"Young man, you’re still young. Don’t be too sad.\" Wei Jiaming raised his hand and placed it on his shoulder. The students beside him didn’t notice Liu Yang’s abnormality. \"At least we could take a photo with her before we left. That’s enough. We can’t ask for too much. It’ll be tiring.\"","Facing his good friend’s comfort, Liu Yang laughed softly after a long time. \"That’s right. We can’t ask for too much. If we ask too much, we’ll be the one who gets tired in the end. Desire is hard to fill. The more you ask, the harder it gets.\"","Wei Jiaming continued, \"Hahaha, you’re smart. Believe me, when you go to the military unit, you won’t have so much time to think about other people and things besides work. In half a year, I think you’ll probably struggle to remember who Ye Jian is.\"","The place Liu Yang was going to was very difficult. It was cold due to the high altitude, and it was in the northwest. It was difficult to even get water.","Besides Liu Yang, there were four other male students who were heading to the bitter cold place.","His good friend’s teasing made Liu Yang smile again. He couldn’t help but smile resignedly. \"I haven’t forgotten her from the first year to the fourth year. Forgetting her in half a year might be a little difficult.\"","Wei Jiaming said indifferently, \"If half a year doesn’t work, then one year. If not one year, then two years. If not two years, then three years. You’ll be able to forget her with enough time. Also, did you notice that when you took a photo with Ye Jian, the young lieutenant colonel’s gaze was a little cold?\"","\"He must have realized that I have feelings for Ye Jian. Well, who cares? He can’t control what other people feel.\"","The shouts of the other classes came from behind. Liu Yang turned around and saw that they were all students who had been assigned to the highlands. He raised his hand and waved, burying all his emotions in his heart.","It wasn’t difficult to forget, but it wasn’t easy either. He would just let fate take its course.","What Jiaming said made sense. The more he asked for, the harder it would be. It was better not to make things too difficult for himself.","As for the young lieutenant colonel who pushed Ye Jian away, everyone knew who he was to Ye Jian.","Very soon, some students carried their backpacks and walked out of the campus. There were three to five groups of students accompanying them. The students who were taking photos suddenly became silent. They stood at the same spot and watched as the students left.","\"They’re the first to leave school and be assigned a territory.\"","A student spoke in a low voice. A faint sigh passed. It was time for them to part.","There were eight students in Ye Jian’s class who were allocated to the general assembly. They would leave at three in the afternoon. Another 14 students would leave tomorrow. The day after tomorrow, other than the students who passed the postgraduate entrance examination, the rest would leave.","As for Ye Jian... she would have to stay in school for retests after her injuries recovered.","Ye Jian got into the car and looked at the familiar school gate. She tightened her grip on the car window.","She really wanted to stay and accompany her comrades more, but her injuries didn’t allow her to be impudent anymore. Captain Xia, who had been staring at her, didn’t allow her to be impudent either.","After Xu Wen and He Jing watched Ye Jian leave, they returned to the dormitory to pack their things. He Jing’s train would depart a few minutes past 11:00 pm tonight. Her destination was not far from Xiang City. It was in Han City, which was below Xiang City.","Xu Wen, who had failed the postgraduate entrance examination, had a place to go to. Tomorrow, she would take the 10:00 pm train to Guangdong Province. As for Song Zhiqiu, he had passed the postgraduate entrance examination and would continue studying in the school.","Fortunately, Xiang City and Guangdong Province were not too far apart. All it took was an overnight train to reach Guangdong Province."]},{"number":4800,"title":"Chapter 4800: Time","paragraphs":["When Song Zhiqiu came in, Xu Wen and He Jing had just finished packing their luggage. They agreed to visit Ye Jian at the hospital at around 3:00 pm.","When He Jing saw Song Zhiqiu coming over, she nudged Xu Wen gently. \"The two of you can talk for a while. I’ll take care of the rest. Talk properly. Don’t fall out with him again before you can say anything.\"","One was assigned to the Guangdong Province while the other would continue to stay in school for postgraduate studies. The lovers who had been able to see each other every day were going to be separated. That feeling... He Jing felt her own heart aching.","Xu Wen glanced at Song Zhiqiu. Before she could say anything, her eyes were already red.","They were not the only couple on campus. Besides the two of them, there were other lovers who had gone their separate ways. No pair was assigned to the same base.","Those who were lucky were assigned to the same province.","Ye Jian, who was in a low mood, leaned against her seat and turned her head to look out of the window. Xia Jinyuan could only see her slender back.","Both of them were wearing military uniforms. Even if they wanted to get closer, they had to take care of their image.","This time, Xia Jinyuan didn’t disturb Ye Jian. It was good to let her be alone.","When they reached the hospital and closed the ward door, Xia Jinyuan bent down and hugged his girlfriend who was sitting in the wheelchair. \"Cry for a while. If you’re tired, sleep for a while.\"","Ye Jian, whose head was resting on his broad shoulders, slowly closed her eyes. She nuzzled his neck like a cat and rubbed against it. The refreshing and familiar smell gradually soothed the sorrow in her heart.","After a while, she said softly, \"I don’t want to cry. I just can’t bear to part with them. We’ve been classmates for four years. I couldn’t even properly say my goodbyes to them. I don’t know when we’ll meet again.","\"Captain Xia, did you meet your classmates again after graduating?\"","Xia Jinyuan, who was avoiding her wounds and caressing her back, thought for a moment and shook his head. \"I haven’t seen them once since we graduated. I only contact them occasionally by email.","\"A few students from your class are assigned to the Hakkar encampment. I also have two comrades in the Hakkar encampment. Later, I plan to buy some specialties from Xiang City and get your classmates to bring the specialties to them so that the seniors there will take care of your friends.\"","Graduates of the National Science University were assigned to government agencies as well as the most difficult and poorest borders.","They might not be able to meet again.","\"I spent four years with them. When it’s time to say goodbye, you have to say goodbye. It’s human nature to be sad, but don’t let it affect you.","\"The time you had with them is over. Keep this good time in your memory and welcome the rest with the best mentality.\"","Xia Jinyuan straightened his body and half-kneeled on one leg. He held Ye Jian’s face and smiled. \"Baby, the next few days are the days I’ve been looking forward to for a long time. When you reach the team, you’ll be my soldier and I’ll be your captain. You have to be mentally prepared to be scolded by me.\"","Xia Jinyuan saw that Ye Jian didn’t look tired. Instead, she looked worried because of her graduation. His heart ached for her, so he found a topic that could allow Ye Jian to quickly walk out of her sorrow.","Just as he was about to have a chat, someone knocked on the closed ward door. Then, the doorknob was twisted. Xia Jinyuan, who was interrupted, frowned slightly. He didn’t want to open the door.","Ye Jian pushed him. There was a faint smile in her eyes. \"Why did you lock the door? Hurry up and open the door. It should be the doctor.\"","\"Let’s have a good chat after the doctor leaves.\" Xia Jinyuan frowned and quickly kissed her forehead. Then, he stood up and tidied his military uniform.","Fortunately, he locked the door out of habit, and no one saw them."]}]);
